(743272, 80196, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nice duotone and it is cropped well. The two white stalks are the only things that bother me as they seem very bright (overexposed?) and somewhat out of place with the overall tone of the photo. The middle stalk also grabs a lot of my attention when I feel the flowers deserve the most.</td>', 'Very nice duotone and it is cropped well. The two white stalks are the only things that bother me as they seem very bright (overexposed?) and somewhat out of place with the overall tone of the photo. The middle stalk also grabs a lot of my attention when I feel the flowers deserve the most.', '2004-05-31 01:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(743275, 80076, 11518, '<td valign="top">Overexposed and a bit crowded.  Good idea though.</td>', 'Overexposed and a bit crowded.  Good idea though.', '2004-05-31 01:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
