(743324, 80388, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of negative space for this challenge. Good job cropping, too. Sharp details of the clouds. At first, I didn''t see three ships in the thumbnail but I was impressed when I actually saw the photo. Only thing I would change: make the ships a bit larger next time. Good job! 9</td>', 'Excellent use of negative space for this challenge. Good job cropping, too. Sharp details of the clouds. At first, I didn''t see three ships in the thumbnail but I was impressed when I actually saw the photo. Only thing I would change: make the ships a bit larger next time. Good job! 9', '2004-05-31 01:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(743325, 80367, 18677, '<td valign="top">Looks familiar.  Is that Alamogordo?  Beautiful area. Looks a little oversaturated and could be sharper.  Otherwise very nice!</td>', 'Looks familiar.  Is that Alamogordo?  Beautiful area. Looks a little oversaturated and could be sharper.  Otherwise very nice!', '2004-05-31 01:27:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(743328, 79360, 11518, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, a tad over exposed though.</td>', 'Nice idea, a tad over exposed though.', '2004-05-31 01:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(743330, 79684, 7151, '<td valign="top">The only negative I''ve got on this is I wish it was bigger.  Everything else is excellent.  Nice job.</td>', 'The only negative I''ve got on this is I wish it was bigger.  Everything else is excellent.  Nice job.', '2004-05-31 01:29:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(743331, 80312, 8054, '<td valign="top">Clovers appear to be unfocused and lighting is harsh on the foam(?) surface and flat on the clovers.</td>', 'Clovers appear to be unfocused and lighting is harsh on the foam(?) surface and flat on the clovers.', '2004-05-31 01:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(743332, 80383, 20210, '<td valign="top">the texture on the water in this shot is beautiful, but the subjects are quite overexposed.</td>', 'the texture on the water in this shot is beautiful, but the subjects are quite overexposed.', '2004-05-31 01:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(743337, 79575, 8054, '<td valign="top">Good macro details although some of the details along the edges of the leaves are lost and blurred. Lighting is different but I like it.</td>', 'Good macro details although some of the details along the edges of the leaves are lost and blurred. Lighting is different but I like it.', '2004-05-31 01:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(743338, 80147, 11518, '<td valign="top">LOL, cute. Maybe a lil bit over sharpened.  You see a lil halo on the horns.  Did you intend to have the halos there?</td>', 'LOL, cute. Maybe a lil bit over sharpened.  You see a lil halo on the horns.  Did you intend to have the halos there?', '2004-05-31 01:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(743339, 79720, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nicely done...they''re really going for it. 9</td>', 'Nicely done...they''re really going for it. 9', '2004-05-31 01:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(743340, 80318, 18349, '<td valign="top">Don''t let go!  :o)</td>', 'Don''t let go!  :o)', '2004-05-31 01:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(743342, 79588, 7151, '<td valign="top">Psychodelic.  :)  It would have been easy to center the point where the lines connect - I''m glad you didn''t.  It splits the impact between the three "planes" stretching off into the distance with the geometric 3 patterns.</td>', 'Psychodelic.  :)  It would have been easy to center the point where the lines connect - I''m glad you didn''t.  It splits the impact between the three "planes" stretching off into the distance with the geometric 3 patterns.', '2004-05-31 01:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(743345, 79490, 19952, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting! Very good macro of the micro action. :-)</td>', 'Nice lighting! Very good macro of the micro action. :-)', '2004-05-31 01:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(743348, 79322, 20210, '<td valign="top">great subject.  something odd about the outcome..maybe too much unsharp mask?  maybe just not enough contrast, or something.  but beautiful</td>', 'great subject.  something odd about the outcome..maybe too much unsharp mask?  maybe just not enough contrast, or something.  but beautiful', '2004-05-31 01:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(743353, 79389, 8054, '<td valign="top">Sharp details of the orchid flowers. I like the lighting which shows off the translucent properties of the petals. Also, the orchids that face the bottom of the frame could use some light from the bottom to show off details. The short stalk near the top and the fact that the rest of the plant is missing is odd. I think it would have looked better with the supporting stalk running to the edge of the border rather than have the flowers floating in air.</td>', 'Sharp details of the orchid flowers. I like the lighting which shows off the translucent properties of the petals. Also, the orchids that face the bottom of the frame could use some light from the bottom to show off details. The short stalk near the top and the fact that the rest of the plant is missing is odd. I think it would have looked better with the supporting stalk running to the edge of the border rather than have the flowers floating in air.', '2004-05-31 01:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(743354, 78955, 7151, '<td valign="top">A little nit-picky, but I wish you had left a bit of space on the right side of the nuts.  But I like the use of B&amp;W.</td>', 'A little nit-picky, but I wish you had left a bit of space on the right side of the nuts.  But I like the use of B&W.', '2004-05-31 01:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(743355, 79839, 11518, '<td valign="top">Overexposed and the white balance needs to be corrected.  Easily done in PS.</td>', 'Overexposed and the white balance needs to be corrected.  Easily done in PS.', '2004-05-31 01:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(743358, 80121, 326, '<td valign="top">This is simply beautiful! Well done!</td>', 'This is simply beautiful! Well done!', '2004-05-31 01:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(743361, 79957, 9462, '<td valign="top">LOL angle threw me off for a sec.....A N G E L</td>', 'LOL angle threw me off for a sec.....A N G E L', '2004-05-31 01:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(743362, 79637, 8054, '<td valign="top">Wow. Plain and simple. Nice brooding effect of the storm clouds against the tan color of the fields. The three trees also lend well to the feel of this photo. Excellent job! 10.</td>', 'Wow. Plain and simple. Nice brooding effect of the storm clouds against the tan color of the fields. The three trees also lend well to the feel of this photo. Excellent job! 10.', '2004-05-31 01:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(743363, 79185, 20210, '<td valign="top">too light on one side, too dark on the other.  But I do love the angle of the shot, good composition.</td>', 'too light on one side, too dark on the other.  But I do love the angle of the shot, good composition.', '2004-05-31 01:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(743365, 80133, 11518, '<td valign="top">3 as in 3 people?  I like the symmetry.  A bit over exposed.</td>', '3 as in 3 people?  I like the symmetry.  A bit over exposed.', '2004-05-31 01:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(743366, 80140, 7151, '<td valign="top">I hope that''s "I love you" and not gang signs.  :)  Not sure I get the intent of the selective desaturation.  Red = love?</td>', 'I hope that''s "I love you" and not gang signs.  :)  Not sure I get the intent of the selective desaturation.  Red = love?', '2004-05-31 01:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(743368, 80132, 9462, '<td valign="top">not too sweet those canes</td>', 'not too sweet those canes', '2004-05-31 01:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(743370, 79548, 11518, '<td valign="top">LOL, what are the odds of having 2 exactly similar photos.  Nice.</td>', 'LOL, what are the odds of having 2 exactly similar photos.  Nice.', '2004-05-31 01:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(743372, 79727, 12674, '<td valign="top">Nice color and composition. You might try a higher aperture and use a tripod to achieve better focus.</td>', 'Nice color and composition. You might try a higher aperture and use a tripod to achieve better focus.', '2004-05-31 01:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(743374, 79562, 18485, '<td valign="top">this is hilarious.  great shot.  maybe a little overbright in the upper left corner.  love the b/w choice.</td>', 'this is hilarious.  great shot.  maybe a little overbright in the upper left corner.  love the b/w choice.', '2004-05-31 01:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(743375, 79257, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nice b/w photo. Crisp details of the stone wall and even of the plants along the water. Contrast is nice and even. I would have cropped more of the water out so you have just a bit of it showing but I know you probably wanted to show the graffiti in the water. Also, the border is a bit busy for my tastes.</td>', 'Very nice b/w photo. Crisp details of the stone wall and even of the plants along the water. Contrast is nice and even. I would have cropped more of the water out so you have just a bit of it showing but I know you probably wanted to show the graffiti in the water. Also, the border is a bit busy for my tastes.', '2004-05-31 01:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(743376, 80312, 7151, '<td valign="top">Good choice of subjects.  Odd choice of background, and the lighting''s a bit flat.</td>', 'Good choice of subjects.  Odd choice of background, and the lighting''s a bit flat.', '2004-05-31 01:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(743379, 79401, 20210, '<td valign="top">Surprised you didn''t stop it dead on 3:00.  Also, it seems like there''s a lot of noise in the photo, on the metal of the watch, and the background.  But it''s a very attractive composition, and good sharpness.</td>', 'Surprised you didn''t stop it dead on 3:00.  Also, it seems like there''s a lot of noise in the photo, on the metal of the watch, and the background.  But it''s a very attractive composition, and good sharpness.', '2004-05-31 01:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(743382, 80201, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very nice! It''s rare when you see blue buildings let alone THREE of them right next to each other! Are you sure you didn''t photoshop them?  :)<br/> <br/>Nice job getting three people in the same frame, too! Shame there aren''t three cars! 9</td>', 'Very nice! It''s rare when you see blue buildings let alone THREE of them right next to each other! Are you sure you didn''t photoshop them?  :) Nice job getting three people in the same frame, too! Shame there aren''t three cars! 9', '2004-05-31 01:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(743383, 79448, 12674, '<td valign="top">Quite unusual color and interesting...nice shot!</td>', 'Quite unusual color and interesting...nice shot!', '2004-05-31 01:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
