(743388, 80318, 7151, '<td valign="top">But don''t let go.  :)  The connection with "threes" is a bit tenuous, but close enough I suppose.  Maybe a deeper DOF to bring the bullets into focus would have worked better for me.  But technically, a decent shot.</td>', 'But don''t let go.  :)  The connection with "threes" is a bit tenuous, but close enough I suppose.  Maybe a deeper DOF to bring the bullets into focus would have worked better for me.  But technically, a decent shot.', '2004-05-31 01:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(743389, 79466, 20285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!</td>', 'Beautiful colors!', '2004-05-31 01:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
