(743513, 79412, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. My only comment is that, from my screen, the shadows are a bit too dark. The only advice for future would be to leave the shutter open a bit and use a reflector (if possible - if not, use tin-foil). BUt great composition and overall effect.</td>', 'This is awesome. My only comment is that, from my screen, the shadows are a bit too dark. The only advice for future would be to leave the shutter open a bit and use a reflector (if possible - if not, use tin-foil). BUt great composition and overall effect.', '2004-05-31 02:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(743515, 80309, 15207, '<td valign="top">The invasion is on! Awesome... was just reading about these little critters taking over the mid-states. I was surrounded by them one time in Costa Rica - felt like thousands - and it was one of the coolest experiences I''ve ever had. Great capture - 10</td>', 'The invasion is on! Awesome... was just reading about these little critters taking over the mid-states. I was surrounded by them one time in Costa Rica - felt like thousands - and it was one of the coolest experiences I''ve ever had. Great capture - 10', '2004-05-31 02:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
