(743517, 79490, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice use of DOF and creative lighting. Excellent details. The two small spots on the lower left "blade" (to the right of the blue lighting) should have been cloned out.</td>', 'Nice use of DOF and creative lighting. Excellent details. The two small spots on the lower left "blade" (to the right of the blue lighting) should have been cloned out.', '2004-05-31 02:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
