(743523, 80243, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is awesome. My only comment is that there''s a bit of a glare -almost looks washed out - in the left corner (at least from my monitor). I''m not sure how this could be corrected - I can tell your white balance looks dead on. Maybe moving the light a bit in the future would help. Good luck!</td>', 'This is awesome. My only comment is that there''s a bit of a glare -almost looks washed out - in the left corner (at least from my monitor). I''m not sure how this could be corrected - I can tell your white balance looks dead on. Maybe moving the light a bit in the future would help. Good luck!', '2004-05-31 02:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(743528, 80378, 15207, '<td valign="top">Really awesome capture and composition. I''m sure this was really hard to achieve. The image looks just slightly out of focus - but I''m sure it would still get printed in Sports Illustrated. Good luck!</td>', 'Really awesome capture and composition. I''m sure this was really hard to achieve. The image looks just slightly out of focus - but I''m sure it would still get printed in Sports Illustrated. Good luck!', '2004-05-31 02:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
