(743532, 80328, 20210, '<td valign="top">oh no, the Cicadas are coming!  I''m glad I''m in the north-east, away from these noisy buggers.  Great capture of their color and weird red eyes.</td>', 'oh no, the Cicadas are coming!  I''m glad I''m in the north-east, away from these noisy buggers.  Great capture of their color and weird red eyes.', '2004-05-31 02:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
