(743550, 80242, 15207, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of photo that could be on every calendar everywhere. This is an awesome capture of expression - and, of course, those kittens are just about the sweetest things I''ve ever seen in my life. The coolest part is that there''s a lot of humour in this photo  - it''s well composed. The only comment (and this is very minor) is that you may want to increase the saturation just slightly - the greens are dead-on, but you may want to try to enhance the leaves slightly - and maybe the orange of the kittens. It''s a 10 though and you should be proud.</td>', 'This is the kind of photo that could be on every calendar everywhere. This is an awesome capture of expression - and, of course, those kittens are just about the sweetest things I''ve ever seen in my life. The coolest part is that there''s a lot of humour in this photo  - it''s well composed. The only comment (and this is very minor) is that you may want to increase the saturation just slightly - the greens are dead-on, but you may want to try to enhance the leaves slightly - and maybe the orange of the kittens. It''s a 10 though and you should be proud.', '2004-05-31 02:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
