(743591, 79346, 15920, '<td valign="top">Great colors (though they might be just a touch oversaturated.)  Also looks a bit oversharpended on the roof line (left house) but issues aside, this image has real eyecatching appeal.</td>', 'Great colors (though they might be just a touch oversaturated.)  Also looks a bit oversharpended on the roof line (left house) but issues aside, this image has real eyecatching appeal.', '2004-05-31 03:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
