(743599, 79448, 16301, '<td valign="top">WOW, this is just beautiful. The tone and water drops are what really make this shot unique. Excellent job...</td>', 'WOW, this is just beautiful. The tone and water drops are what really make this shot unique. Excellent job...', '2004-05-31 03:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
