(743778, 80318, 15920, '<td valign="top">I hope you do OK on the scoring with the "3" out of focus.  Clever how the title and the sharp focus on the barrle work together, but I bet most people don''t "get it".</td>', 'I hope you do OK on the scoring with the "3" out of focus.  Clever how the title and the sharp focus on the barrle work together, but I bet most people don''t "get it".', '2004-05-31 08:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
