(744006, 79360, 489, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition very much. but I long for color in this shot - the fans, the eyes - so much they could say with color that seems lost in the black and white.</td>', 'I really like the composition very much. but I long for color in this shot - the fans, the eyes - so much they could say with color that seems lost in the black and white.', '2004-05-31 12:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
