(744010, 80052, 489, '<td valign="top">Lol.. great title.</td>', 'Lol.. great title.', '2004-05-31 12:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(744011, 79121, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like your lighting - it really moves your eye over the subject.  Wish there had been a bounce at the bottom to reflect light back at the tips of the crayons so we could see them better.  The crayons themselves are burnt out in spots, but the low light gives nice texture.  Maybe crop the sides a  bit?</td>', 'I like your lighting - it really moves your eye over the subject.  Wish there had been a bounce at the bottom to reflect light back at the tips of the crayons so we could see them better.  The crayons themselves are burnt out in spots, but the low light gives nice texture.  Maybe crop the sides a  bit?', '2004-05-31 12:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(744012, 80321, 489, '<td valign="top">A little too soft in my opinion, but a nice shot all the same.</td>', 'A little too soft in my opinion, but a nice shot all the same.', '2004-05-31 12:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(744013, 79665, 7628, '<td valign="top">Classic.  Well done in detail and composition.</td>', 'Classic.  Well done in detail and composition.', '2004-05-31 12:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(744014, 79214, 10680, '<td valign="top">really cool shot. personally it has too much white for my taste, i think it''d probably look better on a black background, but that''s just me. I still think this is a really good shot. 8</td>', 'really cool shot. personally it has too much white for my taste, i think it''d probably look better on a black background, but that''s just me. I still think this is a really good shot. 8', '2004-05-31 12:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(744016, 80386, 489, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition and fitting for the challenge. The lines add a great deal to this shot, it really makes it flow. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice composition and fitting for the challenge. The lines add a great deal to this shot, it really makes it flow. Well done.', '2004-05-31 12:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(744017, 79059, 489, '<td valign="top">Nice use of reflections in the composition and cropping of this image. Very nicely done.</td>', 'Nice use of reflections in the composition and cropping of this image. Very nicely done.', '2004-05-31 12:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(744020, 80360, 489, '<td valign="top">I oike the composition and color. Very noisy in the background.</td>', 'I oike the composition and color. Very noisy in the background.', '2004-05-31 12:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(744023, 79757, 7628, '<td valign="top">While the diagonal in the background is dramatic and mirrors the line between the boxes, I''m distracted by it because I don''t know what it is and how it fits into the picture.  The shadow and light in the forground is interesting too, but likewise does not add meaning.  I like the boxes and your choice of black and white - it makes the lettering pop out nicely.</td>', 'While the diagonal in the background is dramatic and mirrors the line between the boxes, I''m distracted by it because I don''t know what it is and how it fits into the picture.  The shadow and light in the forground is interesting too, but likewise does not add meaning.  I like the boxes and your choice of black and white - it makes the lettering pop out nicely.', '2004-05-31 12:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(744024, 79101, 489, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what you were going for here. I am missing the reference to threes, and the shot itself seems lifeless. The image is also too small to make out much detail - try using the full 640 pixels on at least one side.</td>', 'I don''t understand what you were going for here. I am missing the reference to threes, and the shot itself seems lifeless. The image is also too small to make out much detail - try using the full 640 pixels on at least one side.', '2004-05-31 12:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(744025, 80402, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like these faces.  Each is individual.  Wish the background were just the leafy trees - I''d clone out the umbrellas.</td>', 'I like these faces.  Each is individual.  Wish the background were just the leafy trees - I''d clone out the umbrellas.', '2004-05-31 12:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(744026, 79562, 489, '<td valign="top">Nice play on an age-old game.</td>', 'Nice play on an age-old game.', '2004-05-31 12:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(744027, 79759, 489, '<td valign="top">Good composition.</td>', 'Good composition.', '2004-05-31 12:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(744028, 79448, 489, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot - the leaves are so wet they almost look frozen! Intersting color as well.</td>', 'Interesting shot - the leaves are so wet they almost look frozen! Intersting color as well.', '2004-05-31 12:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(744029, 80400, 489, '<td valign="top">Kind of harsh flash (or other light)</td>', 'Kind of harsh flash (or other light)', '2004-05-31 12:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(744032, 79620, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the gray background - is it water?  It is very soft and compliments the irises.  I like how the stems are almot silouetted.   I like the off center composition. Wish the top iris was sharper.</td>', 'I like the gray background - is it water?  It is very soft and compliments the irises.  I like how the stems are almot silouetted.   I like the off center composition. Wish the top iris was sharper.', '2004-05-31 12:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(744034, 80255, 7628, '<td valign="top">sweet idea - I wish the photo were sharper (could this be a resolution issue?) and if there were sunlight on the chairs it would give more meaning and focus to your theme.</td>', 'sweet idea - I wish the photo were sharper (could this be a resolution issue?) and if there were sunlight on the chairs it would give more meaning and focus to your theme.', '2004-05-31 12:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(744037, 80061, 489, '<td valign="top">I like the compoisition - interesting angles.</td>', 'I like the compoisition - interesting angles.', '2004-05-31 12:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(744039, 80007, 489, '<td valign="top">Good simple composition.</td>', 'Good simple composition.', '2004-05-31 12:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(744042, 80133, 7628, '<td valign="top">Three?  I like the levels of the photo rising to the lincoln mem,  Is that the 3?  The building behind the licoln are distracting perhaps if you took the shot from a closer/lower angle?  The people here are distracting too.  I think closer would be better so we could see that there are stars on the wall.</td>', 'Three?  I like the levels of the photo rising to the lincoln mem,  Is that the 3?  The building behind the licoln are distracting perhaps if you took the shot from a closer/lower angle?  The people here are distracting too.  I think closer would be better so we could see that there are stars on the wall.', '2004-05-31 12:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(744043, 80147, 489, '<td valign="top">I like the light falloff on the edges - interesting technique to put the focus on the sheep. Very nice colors as well.</td>', 'I like the light falloff on the edges - interesting technique to put the focus on the sheep. Very nice colors as well.', '2004-05-31 12:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(744047, 79575, 7628, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting, texture, composition, simple and elegant.  Good choice for threes!</td>', 'Lovely lighting, texture, composition, simple and elegant.  Good choice for threes!', '2004-05-31 12:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(744048, 80005, 489, '<td valign="top">Great colors.</td>', 'Great colors.', '2004-05-31 12:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(744051, 79280, 7628, '<td valign="top">yum!  Fun! I like the bite taken out of the 3rd donut - it makes the photo personal.  I would tilt to the left  - so the bottom of all the donuts line up.  Nice lighting and textures</td>', 'yum!  Fun! I like the bite taken out of the 3rd donut - it makes the photo personal.  I would tilt to the left  - so the bottom of all the donuts line up.  Nice lighting and textures', '2004-05-31 12:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(744052, 79740, 489, '<td valign="top">Superb photo on technical merits. Good use of color.</td>', 'Superb photo on technical merits. Good use of color.', '2004-05-31 12:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(744054, 79720, 489, '<td valign="top">Greta exposure control - wonderful colors and contrast.</td>', 'Greta exposure control - wonderful colors and contrast.', '2004-05-31 12:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(744055, 80122, 489, '<td valign="top">Great sky - very dramatic.</td>', 'Great sky - very dramatic.', '2004-05-31 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(744056, 80318, 489, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of DOF, and a nice play on 80''s music :-)</td>', 'Excellent use of DOF, and a nice play on 80''s music :-)', '2004-05-31 12:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(744057, 80362, 7628, '<td valign="top">beautiful.I love the mix of colors and those eyes!  I''d crop on the top just a little, a mayeb a bit left and right - bring the composition right in on those lovely faces! Wish there was more detail in the white fur.</td>', 'beautiful.I love the mix of colors and those eyes!  I''d crop on the top just a little, a mayeb a bit left and right - bring the composition right in on those lovely faces! Wish there was more detail in the white fur.', '2004-05-31 12:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(744058, 79548, 489, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast, great monochrome.</td>', 'Nice contrast, great monochrome.', '2004-05-31 12:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(744060, 79831, 489, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this is a filter or a zoom technique. Either way, i think the shot might have been better with good, sharp focus through all three. I like the color and reflection.</td>', 'Not sure if this is a filter or a zoom technique. Either way, i think the shot might have been better with good, sharp focus through all three. I like the color and reflection.', '2004-05-31 12:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(744061, 80183, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the use of narrow DOF to help us spot the first pigeon.  Then our eyes bounce up to the other two.  It is three, although that isn;t the first theme to pop out - I like the "I spy" game.</td>', 'I like the use of narrow DOF to help us spot the first pigeon.  Then our eyes bounce up to the other two.  It is three, although that isn;t the first theme to pop out - I like the "I spy" game.', '2004-05-31 12:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(744063, 79425, 489, '<td valign="top">Noce colors.</td>', 'Noce colors.', '2004-05-31 12:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(744066, 79092, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - two foot prints isn''t enough to show a walk - add the third an the meaning is clear!  I like the light and texture - I wonder if a diagonal composition would be more interesting?</td>', 'Nice idea - two foot prints isn''t enough to show a walk - add the third an the meaning is clear!  I like the light and texture - I wonder if a diagonal composition would be more interesting?', '2004-05-31 12:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(744072, 80368, 7628, '<td valign="top">nice colors - wish this were sharper. nice idea of a composition.</td>', 'nice colors - wish this were sharper. nice idea of a composition.', '2004-05-31 12:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(744080, 79831, 12802, '<td valign="top">I do really like this, a great idea for the challenge, the blue was a good choice of colour because of the water droplets.  However, did you use post-processing to get the blurred effect?  I think I would have liked all three of the droplets to have been more in focus.  I can''t decide if the middle one looks a tiny bit oversharpened, the lower part of the 3''s curve seems a little jagged, but then I like how I can see the texture through the middle bubble.  If I could vote a half mark here I would give you 9 1/2, but I''ll bump it up coz I''m nice...</td>', 'I do really like this, a great idea for the challenge, the blue was a good choice of colour because of the water droplets.  However, did you use post-processing to get the blurred effect?  I think I would have liked all three of the droplets to have been more in focus.  I can''t decide if the middle one looks a tiny bit oversharpened, the lower part of the 3''s curve seems a little jagged, but then I like how I can see the texture through the middle bubble.  If I could vote a half mark here I would give you 9 1/2, but I''ll bump it up coz I''m nice...', '2004-05-31 12:58:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(744083, 80253, 472, '<td valign="top">just pay me 100 of these and i''ll give this a 10 ;)</td>', 'just pay me 100 of these and i''ll give this a 10 ;)', '2004-05-31 13:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(744084, 80147, 7628, '<td valign="top">Heida?  I like the darkening of this photo - particularly with the light catching the sheeps wool and highlighting them.  It is very Icelandic - the darknesss and the light - I like the way it happens naturally as the sun and clouds sweep over the land - your artistic version works well.  Wish the sheep were just a tad sharper!</td>', 'Heida?  I like the darkening of this photo - particularly with the light catching the sheeps wool and highlighting them.  It is very Icelandic - the darknesss and the light - I like the way it happens naturally as the sun and clouds sweep over the land - your artistic version works well.  Wish the sheep were just a tad sharper!', '2004-05-31 13:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(744087, 80280, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the picture. Overall steel grey works well. Contrast and levels are great. Comp is good. I am wondering though if this violates the rules about taking a photo of another work of art. Voted as though it was ok. (7)</td>', 'I like the picture. Overall steel grey works well. Contrast and levels are great. Comp is good. I am wondering though if this violates the rules about taking a photo of another work of art. Voted as though it was ok. (7)', '2004-05-31 13:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(744090, 80387, 7628, '<td valign="top">great light - very "painterly"  I like how the light catches the stems of the pears, makes them look like they are dancing (a bit like Renoir''s onions)  Wish we could see the bottoms of the pears better -and the frame is unnecessary.</td>', 'great light - very "painterly"  I like how the light catches the stems of the pears, makes them look like they are dancing (a bit like Renoir''s onions)  Wish we could see the bottoms of the pears better -and the frame is unnecessary.', '2004-05-31 13:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(744091, 80274, 7485, '<td valign="top">Prequel to the famous 1939 movie? Sorry, I couldn''t help myself, your excellent photo is really worthy of a better joke than that. Geat composition and subtle use of color!</td>', 'Prequel to the famous 1939 movie? Sorry, I couldn''t help myself, your excellent photo is really worthy of a better joke than that. Geat composition and subtle use of color!', '2004-05-31 13:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(744092, 79032, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, excellent colours and white balance.</td>', 'Very nice shot, excellent colours and white balance.', '2004-05-31 13:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(744094, 79374, 7485, '<td valign="top">The idea is great, but that one half-blue triangle on the right breaks the symmetry</td>', 'The idea is great, but that one half-blue triangle on the right breaks the symmetry', '2004-05-31 13:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(744098, 79548, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and natural setting in this one a bit better than the studio dandilion.  The B&amp;W brings out the textures even better and the dapples of the backgound give context.</td>', 'I like the lighting and natural setting in this one a bit better than the studio dandilion.  The B&W brings out the textures even better and the dapples of the backgound give context.', '2004-05-31 13:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(744101, 80140, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the radical red!  The tree trunk background in nice too.  A picture with real attitude!</td>', 'I like the radical red!  The tree trunk background in nice too.  A picture with real attitude!', '2004-05-31 13:13:49.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(744102, 79839, 7485, '<td valign="top">But they look tomato red, not cherry red?</td>', 'But they look tomato red, not cherry red?', '2004-05-31 13:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(744103, 80328, 2130, '<td valign="top">oh my god these r nasty</td>', 'oh my god these r nasty', '2004-05-31 13:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(744104, 79214, 7628, '<td valign="top">What I like about this pic vs, the picture of the 3 queens cards is that this one has dimension - the shadows and angles give us a feeling for the objects in space.  A photo of cards lying flat might as well just be the cars themselves.  I like this!  The cards look like they are floating!</td>', 'What I like about this pic vs, the picture of the 3 queens cards is that this one has dimension - the shadows and angles give us a feeling for the objects in space.  A photo of cards lying flat might as well just be the cars themselves.  I like this!  The cards look like they are floating!', '2004-05-31 13:15:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(744106, 80191, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how the ducks "posed" for you - this line-up makes a nice composition.  The lighting is a bit harsh - the shadows on their faces take away from the picture a bit.</td>', 'I like how the ducks "posed" for you - this line-up makes a nice composition.  The lighting is a bit harsh - the shadows on their faces take away from the picture a bit.', '2004-05-31 13:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(744109, 80174, 7628, '<td valign="top">Those green eyes in that black fuzz-ball!  They seem to be thinking, "Am I big enough to eat these guys yet?"  cute idea and composition</td>', 'Those green eyes in that black fuzz-ball!  They seem to be thinking, "Am I big enough to eat these guys yet?"  cute idea and composition', '2004-05-31 13:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(744111, 79787, 7628, '<td valign="top">Ironic - OUCH!  I like the B&amp;W  I like the shadows and reflection.  I might have composed the pins a bit more spread apart so the two on the left dont overlap so.</td>', 'Ironic - OUCH!  I like the B&W  I like the shadows and reflection.  I might have composed the pins a bit more spread apart so the two on the left dont overlap so.', '2004-05-31 13:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(744112, 79637, 18197, '<td valign="top">Great sky! Possibly best of show. Congratulations! I am curious how much post processing was done. I have seen sky just this way but rarely am successful catching it just this way through the lens. Hope you do a tutoril. I''d like to learn. (9)</td>', 'Great sky! Possibly best of show. Congratulations! I am curious how much post processing was done. I have seen sky just this way but rarely am successful catching it just this way through the lens. Hope you do a tutoril. I''d like to learn. (9)', '2004-05-31 13:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(744113, 80387, 7485, '<td valign="top">Simplicity at its best! And for once, a really nice use of  a frame, I particularly like how they seem to be physically sitting on the bottom edge of the frame - 8</td>', 'Simplicity at its best! And for once, a really nice use of  a frame, I particularly like how they seem to be physically sitting on the bottom edge of the frame - 8', '2004-05-31 13:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(744114, 79665, 18197, '<td valign="top">I like the dramatic contrast. Lighting seems perfect. Good luck. (8)</td>', 'I like the dramatic contrast. Lighting seems perfect. Good luck. (8)', '2004-05-31 13:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(744116, 80381, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea, just wish I could see a little more at the bottom. Maybe a centered composition would have been even better?</td>', 'Wonderful idea, just wish I could see a little more at the bottom. Maybe a centered composition would have been even better?', '2004-05-31 13:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(744117, 80403, 18197, '<td valign="top">A bit of a cliche given the number of attempts with this subject, but yours is the best of te genre. Nice lighting. Good comp. Very nice colors. Hope it does well. (8)</td>', 'A bit of a cliche given the number of attempts with this subject, but yours is the best of te genre. Nice lighting. Good comp. Very nice colors. Hope it does well. (8)', '2004-05-31 13:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(744118, 80189, 18194, '<td valign="top">I think this might have been a bit better taken more from the side. Still I think it is a good photo.</td>', 'I think this might have been a bit better taken more from the side. Still I think it is a good photo.', '2004-05-31 13:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(744120, 80183, 7485, '<td valign="top">A visual riddle that work very well! The red eye caught my attention right away, but it took me a while to register it as an eye. Then the bird and the other two just popped at me.</td>', 'A visual riddle that work very well! The red eye caught my attention right away, but it took me a while to register it as an eye. Then the bird and the other two just popped at me.', '2004-05-31 13:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(744121, 80323, 18197, '<td valign="top">I didn''t expect to like this based on the thumbnail, but I keep being drawn back to it. Nice DOF. Great color and contrast. Elegantly simple photo. Hope it does well. (8)</td>', 'I didn''t expect to like this based on the thumbnail, but I keep being drawn back to it. Nice DOF. Great color and contrast. Elegantly simple photo. Hope it does well. (8)', '2004-05-31 13:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(744122, 80188, 7485, '<td valign="top">Simplicity at its best!</td>', 'Simplicity at its best!', '2004-05-31 13:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(744124, 80197, 18194, '<td valign="top">Great idea and very well shot, a 10 from me.</td>', 'Great idea and very well shot, a 10 from me.', '2004-05-31 13:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(744125, 79665, 18194, '<td valign="top">Wonderful DOF in this one, a 10 from me.</td>', 'Wonderful DOF in this one, a 10 from me.', '2004-05-31 13:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(744128, 79322, 18194, '<td valign="top">I think this meets the challenge very well.  You did a great job framing this, very effective..10</td>', 'I think this meets the challenge very well.  You did a great job framing this, very effective..10', '2004-05-31 13:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(744130, 79784, 7485, '<td valign="top">Ah, yes, the requisite moto-cross shot. I used to score these higher, but after two straight years of them here at DPC, it''s time to move on. Nothing personal, yours is quite good, only thing I''d wish for is a more out-of-focus background.</td>', 'Ah, yes, the requisite moto-cross shot. I used to score these higher, but after two straight years of them here at DPC, it''s time to move on. Nothing personal, yours is quite good, only thing I''d wish for is a more out-of-focus background.', '2004-05-31 13:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(744134, 79791, 18194, '<td valign="top">The blurred branches in the foreground really detract from this photo.</td>', 'The blurred branches in the foreground really detract from this photo.', '2004-05-31 13:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(744136, 80378, 16046, '<td valign="top">Awesome, great dof, 9</td>', 'Awesome, great dof, 9', '2004-05-31 13:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(744137, 79575, 16046, '<td valign="top">Cool lighting, great detail, 9</td>', 'Cool lighting, great detail, 9', '2004-05-31 13:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(744138, 79360, 7485, '<td valign="top">Fabulous idea, but the harsh shadow next to the model''s right eye is distracting</td>', 'Fabulous idea, but the harsh shadow next to the model''s right eye is distracting', '2004-05-31 13:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(744140, 80401, 16046, '<td valign="top">Love the sand, very nice, 9</td>', 'Love the sand, very nice, 9', '2004-05-31 13:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(744141, 80224, 16046, '<td valign="top">Caught some great light here, nice,9</td>', 'Caught some great light here, nice,9', '2004-05-31 13:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(744142, 80174, 7485, '<td valign="top">Wow, talk about capturing the moment! The lighting is a little bland, but the kitten''s look more than makes up for it!</td>', 'Wow, talk about capturing the moment! The lighting is a little bland, but the kitten''s look more than makes up for it!', '2004-05-31 13:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
