(745122, 79957, 17551, '<td valign="top">I don''t remember giving permission to photograph my ride... !<br/>Nice shot.. 8</td>', 'I don''t remember giving permission to photograph my ride... !Nice shot.. 8', '2004-06-01 08:01:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(745125, 79084, 17551, '<td valign="top">heh.. got a laugh out of me</td>', 'heh.. got a laugh out of me', '2004-06-01 08:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(745126, 80075, 17551, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting. 8</td>', 'Love the lighting. 8', '2004-06-01 08:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(745128, 79726, 17551, '<td valign="top">Looks like either freaky whitebalance, or freaky sunset... I like it. 9</td>', 'Looks like either freaky whitebalance, or freaky sunset... I like it. 9', '2004-06-01 08:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(745131, 79889, 2764, '<td valign="top">straighten the horizon - the tilt is disconcerting - even though it is slight it makes everything lean left.  With such strong horizonal lines in the background it is especially important that they be level. 6</td>', 'straighten the horizon - the tilt is disconcerting - even though it is slight it makes everything lean left.  With such strong horizonal lines in the background it is especially important that they be level. 6', '2004-06-01 08:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(745132, 79784, 2764, '<td valign="top">great capture - needs some photoshop help with contrast....or maybe not...as i look at it more i sort of like the desaturated look...</td>', 'great capture - needs some photoshop help with contrast....or maybe not...as i look at it more i sort of like the desaturated look...', '2004-06-01 08:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(745142, 80323, 8139, '<td valign="top">Good subject, nice background color, good shallow DOF.</td>', 'Good subject, nice background color, good shallow DOF.', '2004-06-01 08:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(745146, 79760, 7485, '<td valign="top">Three things could be improved: the head-on light (on-camera flash?) is too harsh for this subject, the  background is too distracting (more blurred would be better), and there are compression artifacts (use better quality jpeg setting).</td>', 'Three things could be improved: the head-on light (on-camera flash?) is too harsh for this subject, the  background is too distracting (more blurred would be better), and there are compression artifacts (use better quality jpeg setting).', '2004-06-01 09:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(745147, 80264, 7485, '<td valign="top">Would have more impact with either more saturated color (maybe selectively boosting the red ember) or in B&amp;W</td>', 'Would have more impact with either more saturated color (maybe selectively boosting the red ember) or in B&W', '2004-06-01 09:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(745174, 79346, 806, '<td valign="top">"and I''ll huff, and I''ll puff, and I''ll blow your house down" said the big bad wolf. =]<br/> <br/>love the symmetry and colors of this shot. perfect find for the challenge, and done well.</td>', '"and I''ll huff, and I''ll puff, and I''ll blow your house down" said the big bad wolf. =] love the symmetry and colors of this shot. perfect find for the challenge, and done well.', '2004-06-01 09:51:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(745175, 80076, 806, '<td valign="top">nice angle. makes me feel like I am part of the game. could be a bit sharper - or is that compression? not terrible, but still noticeable.</td>', 'nice angle. makes me feel like I am part of the game. could be a bit sharper - or is that compression? not terrible, but still noticeable.', '2004-06-01 09:52:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(745177, 79443, 806, '<td valign="top">I think if your lighting was better, you''d have less noise in this shot.<br/>good composition - the curve of the watch makes it interesting, yet the 3 always attracts my attention. cool about the little movement in the second hand.</td>', 'I think if your lighting was better, you''d have less noise in this shot.good composition - the curve of the watch makes it interesting, yet the 3 always attracts my attention. cool about the little movement in the second hand.', '2004-06-01 09:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(745180, 79759, 806, '<td valign="top">what cool animals! brings us right back to prehistory!<br/>amazing that they were lined up this way, and you got a shot off in time.<br/>makes for a nice leading line, and an interesting shot.</td>', 'what cool animals! brings us right back to prehistory!amazing that they were lined up this way, and you got a shot off in time.makes for a nice leading line, and an interesting shot.', '2004-06-01 10:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(745183, 80061, 806, '<td valign="top">this is a cool image. the eye direction of the 2 on the right lead me to the one on the left. because of this, I wonder if it could have been cropped to include the nose of the left horse a bit more.. unless that was the edge of the frame?<br/>the tones are done well, and it is a dynamic and interesting image to view.</td>', 'this is a cool image. the eye direction of the 2 on the right lead me to the one on the left. because of this, I wonder if it could have been cropped to include the nose of the left horse a bit more.. unless that was the edge of the frame?the tones are done well, and it is a dynamic and interesting image to view.', '2004-06-01 10:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(745185, 80313, 806, '<td valign="top">nice exposure in the whites. beautiful flowers. would be nicer to exclude more of the background - shallower dof.<br/>still, they are naturally arranged in a pleasing arched formation.</td>', 'nice exposure in the whites. beautiful flowers. would be nicer to exclude more of the background - shallower dof.still, they are naturally arranged in a pleasing arched formation.', '2004-06-01 10:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(745186, 80100, 806, '<td valign="top">nice use of dof. great color saturation.  overall image has medium appeal.</td>', 'nice use of dof. great color saturation.  overall image has medium appeal.', '2004-06-01 10:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(745187, 80317, 806, '<td valign="top">nicely done composition including the selective color, interesting to view</td>', 'nicely done composition including the selective color, interesting to view', '2004-06-01 10:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(745188, 79965, 806, '<td valign="top">beautifully done!</td>', 'beautifully done!', '2004-06-01 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(745190, 79101, 806, '<td valign="top">this must not be within the realm of my experience. sand''s egg? 3? I just don''t get it. Is it a natural phenomena?</td>', 'this must not be within the realm of my experience. sand''s egg? 3? I just don''t get it. Is it a natural phenomena?', '2004-06-01 10:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(745192, 80214, 806, '<td valign="top">really cool abstract!</td>', 'really cool abstract!', '2004-06-01 10:23:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(745193, 79322, 8139, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit oversharpened, otherwise good pic.</td>', 'Seems a bit oversharpened, otherwise good pic.', '2004-06-01 10:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(745196, 79490, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have an extremely graphic image - presented wth   an artists'' touch. The composition is PERFECT!  The colors really sing!  Focus could not be handled any better - with just a slight fall off towards the upper set of blades.<br/> <br/>If there is any complaint I have it''s with an external object - the border.  If you must have one, pick a color that does nbot demand attention.  The only "white" area in you image is in the border.  I would ask, do you really need the border at all?<br/>Having said all that.. I expect you are headed for the land of ribbons.<br/> <br/></td>', 'You have an extremely graphic image - presented wth   an artists'' touch. The composition is PERFECT!  The colors really sing!  Focus could not be handled any better - with just a slight fall off towards the upper set of blades. If there is any complaint I have it''s with an external object - the border.  If you must have one, pick a color that does nbot demand attention.  The only "white" area in you image is in the border.  I would ask, do you really need the border at all?Having said all that.. I expect you are headed for the land of ribbons. ', '2004-06-01 10:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(745198, 80201, 16004, '<td valign="top">this is a good image, but the shadow (cast by signage?) is a major distraction.  using the kerb and the top railing as your top and bottom crop is pretty smart, gives it a kind of natural border.  the people are a nice touch too.  honda doesn''t fit though, and overall the areas not in shadow feel, to me, a little too bright (though it might be the contrasting shadow that gives the impression of over-brightness).  also, on an initial look it looks like it is one building (wth the shared shopfront) but only on closer inspection, you can see that they are indeed three.   this shot does have a great deal of charm, and i hoe to see it do well.  7.</td>', 'this is a good image, but the shadow (cast by signage?) is a major distraction.  using the kerb and the top railing as your top and bottom crop is pretty smart, gives it a kind of natural border.  the people are a nice touch too.  honda doesn''t fit though, and overall the areas not in shadow feel, to me, a little too bright (though it might be the contrasting shadow that gives the impression of over-brightness).  also, on an initial look it looks like it is one building (wth the shared shopfront) but only on closer inspection, you can see that they are indeed three.   this shot does have a great deal of charm, and i hoe to see it do well.  7.', '2004-06-01 10:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(745203, 80133, 16004, '<td valign="top">i think i''m being thick - i can''t see the threes.  well, 3 people, and three shadows in the monument thing in the background, but i would have thought those are incidental.  i''m afraid i don''t know my american history enough to think of something that might be more specific.  technically, it''s a very nice picture - symmetry is pleasing and the guy in the fountain is a good point of interest.</td>', 'i think i''m being thick - i can''t see the threes.  well, 3 people, and three shadows in the monument thing in the background, but i would have thought those are incidental.  i''m afraid i don''t know my american history enough to think of something that might be more specific.  technically, it''s a very nice picture - symmetry is pleasing and the guy in the fountain is a good point of interest.', '2004-06-01 10:48:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(745207, 80095, 8139, '<td valign="top">gorgeous. Perfect technique.</td>', 'gorgeous. Perfect technique.', '2004-06-01 10:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(745209, 80324, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have a very original one here!  Nice exposure, vute expression.</td>', 'You have a very original one here!  Nice exposure, vute expression.', '2004-06-01 10:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(745214, 80270, 2610, '<td valign="top">A touch soft but I like the DOF</td>', 'A touch soft but I like the DOF', '2004-06-01 11:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(745215, 80391, 2610, '<td valign="top">Interesting card deck.  The lighting might be a little more dramatic but overall very nice!</td>', 'Interesting card deck.  The lighting might be a little more dramatic but overall very nice!', '2004-06-01 11:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
