(745244, 80407, 12962, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the specks of dust  near the top  and side of the shortest transmitter (and there are also some elsewhere) should have been cloned out.  The one near the top is very distracting and mars this good photograph.</td>', 'Good idea, but the specks of dust  near the top  and side of the shortest transmitter (and there are also some elsewhere) should have been cloned out.  The one near the top is very distracting and mars this good photograph.', '2004-06-01 11:43:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(745253, 79490, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and design.</td>', 'Nice lighting and design.', '2004-06-01 11:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(745259, 80403, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice background color, contrasts well with the cherries. Good lighting too. I like the empty space you managed here.</td>', 'Nice background color, contrasts well with the cherries. Good lighting too. I like the empty space you managed here.', '2004-06-01 11:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(745264, 80188, 8139, '<td valign="top">Nice graphical abstract . I''d like the yellow tones more saturated, and the shadows a bit more contrasted IMHO. The cloud is too tiny and detracts . But good picture anyway.</td>', 'Nice graphical abstract . I''d like the yellow tones more saturated, and the shadows a bit more contrasted IMHO. The cloud is too tiny and detracts . But good picture anyway.', '2004-06-01 12:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(745279, 80201, 22286, '<td valign="top">Its a shame about the triangle shadow.  Other than that, the picture is amazing.  Three people... three buildings.  And the color is fantastic.</td>', 'Its a shame about the triangle shadow.  Other than that, the picture is amazing.  Three people... three buildings.  And the color is fantastic.', '2004-06-01 12:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(745282, 79257, 22286, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white use in the picture.  I would have cropped it so that the water line was lower.... not in the middle of the picture.</td>', 'I like the black and white use in the picture.  I would have cropped it so that the water line was lower.... not in the middle of the picture.', '2004-06-01 12:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(745283, 80061, 22286, '<td valign="top">Usually, I don''t like angled pictures.  But this one works!</td>', 'Usually, I don''t like angled pictures.  But this one works!', '2004-06-01 12:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(745287, 80076, 22286, '<td valign="top">Great implementation of the theme!</td>', 'Great implementation of the theme!', '2004-06-01 12:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(745289, 80401, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the silhouettes.  To give a more relaxed feeling to the shot, I think a slow shutter to blur the waves a bit would be nice.</td>', 'I like the silhouettes.  To give a more relaxed feeling to the shot, I think a slow shutter to blur the waves a bit would be nice.', '2004-06-01 12:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(745290, 79877, 509, '<td valign="top">The textures work nicely here.  I''d like to see a little more of the third figure in the statue.</td>', 'The textures work nicely here.  I''d like to see a little more of the third figure in the statue.', '2004-06-01 12:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(745291, 80402, 11793, '<td valign="top">not a bad photo - but a pretty typical snapshot.<br/>exposure is good, focus is good - there just isn''t much here to grab my attention.<br/></td>', 'not a bad photo - but a pretty typical snapshot.exposure is good, focus is good - there just isn''t much here to grab my attention.', '2004-06-01 12:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(745294, 80270, 11793, '<td valign="top">interesting shot - focus seems soft - but it may just be the shine on the cherries themselves.<br/></td>', 'interesting shot - focus seems soft - but it may just be the shine on the cherries themselves.', '2004-06-01 12:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(745295, 80400, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The lighting could be better.  If it was a sunny day, maybe a shot from underneath the berries up towards the sky would look nice.  Though blurred, the background still catches a lot of my attention here and gives an overall impression that the shot is under-exposed.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The lighting could be better.  If it was a sunny day, maybe a shot from underneath the berries up towards the sky would look nice.  Though blurred, the background still catches a lot of my attention here and gives an overall impression that the shot is under-exposed.', '2004-06-01 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(745296, 79235, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract feel to this.  The highlites add interest as well.</td>', 'Nice abstract feel to this.  The highlites add interest as well.', '2004-06-01 12:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(745297, 80235, 11793, '<td valign="top">good one - good luck<br/>nice DOF - good in BW.<br/></td>', 'good one - good lucknice DOF - good in BW.', '2004-06-01 12:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(745298, 79360, 11793, '<td valign="top">good interpretation of the theme - i hope everyone else gets it.<br/>good luck</td>', 'good interpretation of the theme - i hope everyone else gets it.good luck', '2004-06-01 12:45:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(745300, 80014, 509, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Since this is a member''s challenge, I would have cloned out the white spot on the left (another bird?) and maybe the birds in the far background.  I like the symmetry in that the birds are all looking in the same direction.</td>', 'Great shot!  Since this is a member''s challenge, I would have cloned out the white spot on the left (another bird?) and maybe the birds in the far background.  I like the symmetry in that the birds are all looking in the same direction.', '2004-06-01 12:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
