(746250, 80324, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is fuuny, and took alot of guts.  Well done.  9</td>', 'That is fuuny, and took alot of guts.  Well done.  9', '2004-06-02 00:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(746257, 79609, 10818, '<td valign="top">That is so awesome, what a fantastic photo.  I love those rings, and the three of interlaced is spectacular !!</td>', 'That is so awesome, what a fantastic photo.  I love those rings, and the three of interlaced is spectacular !!', '2004-06-02 00:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(746258, 79720, 7322, '<td valign="top">I really like the wide angle view of this. It really makes the daisies pop. Good job!</td>', 'I really like the wide angle view of this. It really makes the daisies pop. Good job!', '2004-06-02 00:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(746259, 79084, 7322, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, fun sign.</td>', 'Love the colors, fun sign.', '2004-06-02 00:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(746262, 79360, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the vintage boudoir photo look of this composition. The graininess works.</td>', 'I like the vintage boudoir photo look of this composition. The graininess works.', '2004-06-02 00:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(746264, 80264, 327, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the smell of these incenses, but I do like the colors and the smoke you''ve captured. Nice..good light on the background.</td>', 'I don''t like the smell of these incenses, but I do like the colors and the smoke you''ve captured. Nice..good light on the background.', '2004-06-02 00:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(746266, 79637, 7322, '<td valign="top">Really simple composition. Like the ominous clouds with the bright light shining through.</td>', 'Really simple composition. Like the ominous clouds with the bright light shining through.', '2004-06-02 00:56:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(746268, 80372, 7322, '<td valign="top">The light coming through the green and yellow glass is excellent. Nice use of an unusual viewpoint.</td>', 'The light coming through the green and yellow glass is excellent. Nice use of an unusual viewpoint.', '2004-06-02 00:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(746274, 79889, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the placement of the sheep in relation to the red barn. All the sheep are so well behaved and posing intently for the camera. Great job!</td>', 'I like the placement of the sheep in relation to the red barn. All the sheep are so well behaved and posing intently for the camera. Great job!', '2004-06-02 00:58:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(746277, 80122, 7322, '<td valign="top">Really strong composition. I love the lighting. The strong bold white looks great against the darker tones. I like the slightly lower viewpoint.</td>', 'Really strong composition. I love the lighting. The strong bold white looks great against the darker tones. I like the slightly lower viewpoint.', '2004-06-02 00:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(746282, 80387, 7322, '<td valign="top">Really striking composition and dramatic black background makes a mundane subject truly appealing. Really great use of negative space in my opinion. Excellent job!</td>', 'Really striking composition and dramatic black background makes a mundane subject truly appealing. Really great use of negative space in my opinion. Excellent job!', '2004-06-02 01:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(746285, 79965, 7322, '<td valign="top">Beautiful subject. Great dramatic lighting and background. The lighting captures the elegant contours of the lilies and the texture of the petals.</td>', 'Beautiful subject. Great dramatic lighting and background. The lighting captures the elegant contours of the lilies and the texture of the petals.', '2004-06-02 01:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(746286, 80324, 7322, '<td valign="top">Really fun portrait. The lighting is a bit flat but I think it works for this. It kind of reminds me of an Annie Leibowitz portrait. I like her pose and the twinkle inher eye.</td>', 'Really fun portrait. The lighting is a bit flat but I think it works for this. It kind of reminds me of an Annie Leibowitz portrait. I like her pose and the twinkle inher eye.', '2004-06-02 01:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(746291, 80214, 7322, '<td valign="top">Really striking and I can see the three.</td>', 'Really striking and I can see the three.', '2004-06-02 01:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(746294, 80151, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the stark quality of this composition. the subject is interesting in the shape and texture.</td>', 'I like the stark quality of this composition. the subject is interesting in the shape and texture.', '2004-06-02 01:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(746318, 80335, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this, and the contrast of the pink and green is nice.  If it would have been possible to make the pinks a bit "richer" it would really have some power to it.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this, and the contrast of the pink and green is nice.  If it would have been possible to make the pinks a bit "richer" it would really have some power to it.', '2004-06-02 01:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(746535, 80372, 8054, '<td valign="top">Normally I wouldn''t like the main subject so dark but for some reason it seems to work well here. Maybe would look even better with a little fill flash, I don''t know. Cropping is nice and the clouds are not too busy to distract. I wish the subject was actually looking at the bottles but I''ve never juggled bottles so maybe you don''t actually look at them. Great photo and interpretation of the challenge! 8</td>', 'Normally I wouldn''t like the main subject so dark but for some reason it seems to work well here. Maybe would look even better with a little fill flash, I don''t know. Cropping is nice and the clouds are not too busy to distract. I wish the subject was actually looking at the bottles but I''ve never juggled bottles so maybe you don''t actually look at them. Great photo and interpretation of the challenge! 8', '2004-06-02 02:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(746542, 79785, 8054, '<td valign="top">I thought this was popcorn at first but I was wrong. Nice details and even lighting. Background is void of noise, too. The only part that I don''t like is the border. As a mock-up frame, it looks good but this kind of image with an all black background I feel would look better without a border. 8</td>', 'I thought this was popcorn at first but I was wrong. Nice details and even lighting. Background is void of noise, too. The only part that I don''t like is the border. As a mock-up frame, it looks good but this kind of image with an all black background I feel would look better without a border. 8', '2004-06-02 02:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(746549, 79826, 8054, '<td valign="top">I like most of the lighting in your photo. The shadow on the left and the light passing through the blue vase make for interesting details. The lighting on the upper two flowers do not allow enough details to come through almost as if they were out of focus.</td>', 'I like most of the lighting in your photo. The shadow on the left and the light passing through the blue vase make for interesting details. The lighting on the upper two flowers do not allow enough details to come through almost as if they were out of focus.', '2004-06-02 02:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(746554, 80065, 8054, '<td valign="top">Contrast seems quite flat and color balance seems off.</td>', 'Contrast seems quite flat and color balance seems off.', '2004-06-02 02:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(746567, 80369, 8054, '<td valign="top">I think I know what this is. It''s the "toy" that lets you leave 3D impressions with pins. Anywho, Nice concept but the three pins are overexposed and maybe out of focus. Nice use of DOF to narrow in on the three pins, though.</td>', 'I think I know what this is. It''s the "toy" that lets you leave 3D impressions with pins. Anywho, Nice concept but the three pins are overexposed and maybe out of focus. Nice use of DOF to narrow in on the three pins, though.', '2004-06-02 02:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(746573, 79787, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice and I like the title very much.</td>', 'Nice and I like the title very much.', '2004-06-02 03:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(746574, 79092, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like it very much.</td>', 'I like it very much.', '2004-06-02 03:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(746581, 80238, 19608, '<td valign="top">A classic image.  Nice leading lines into a relaxing scene.</td>', 'A classic image.  Nice leading lines into a relaxing scene.', '2004-06-02 03:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(746590, 79346, 19608, '<td valign="top">What a perfect threesome!  In most cases, I would avoid placing subjects in a dead-centered position, but this is the exception to the rule.  Your choice of centering works exceptionally well.  And the straight line horizontal layers of brown, green, white, blue - help make this a very "formal" yet exciting image.</td>', 'What a perfect threesome!  In most cases, I would avoid placing subjects in a dead-centered position, but this is the exception to the rule.  Your choice of centering works exceptionally well.  And the straight line horizontal layers of brown, green, white, blue - help make this a very "formal" yet exciting image.', '2004-06-02 03:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(746672, 79785, 20395, '<td valign="top">I very rarely make any noise about borders, usually they don''t bother me at all. I think you have a really excellent shot here, but I keep looking at the border.</td>', 'I very rarely make any noise about borders, usually they don''t bother me at all. I think you have a really excellent shot here, but I keep looking at the border.', '2004-06-02 04:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(746673, 80065, 20395, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. The color seems to have gotten a little muddy though.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. The color seems to have gotten a little muddy though.', '2004-06-02 04:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(746674, 79805, 20395, '<td valign="top">Very nice flower pic, especially of a yellow flower, but the background is weird and splotchy toward the bottom of the picture.</td>', 'Very nice flower pic, especially of a yellow flower, but the background is weird and splotchy toward the bottom of the picture.', '2004-06-02 04:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(746675, 80400, 20395, '<td valign="top">I think the flash may have blown out the lighting on this one. Next time you might want to try natural light and a tripod for more depth.</td>', 'I think the flash may have blown out the lighting on this one. Next time you might want to try natural light and a tripod for more depth.', '2004-06-02 04:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(746677, 80204, 20395, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, it seems to have suffered some from the compression though.</td>', 'I really like this shot, it seems to have suffered some from the compression though.', '2004-06-02 04:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(746678, 79757, 20395, '<td valign="top">The lighting and composition are beautiful. I find I like the picture as a whole a lot more than I like the subject matter, does that make sense?</td>', 'The lighting and composition are beautiful. I find I like the picture as a whole a lot more than I like the subject matter, does that make sense?', '2004-06-02 04:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(746679, 79759, 20395, '<td valign="top">What receptive models you had! So nice of them to pose like that for you!</td>', 'What receptive models you had! So nice of them to pose like that for you!', '2004-06-02 04:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(746680, 80238, 20395, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. I see good things in your future.</td>', 'Gorgeous. I see good things in your future.', '2004-06-02 04:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(746691, 79740, 20395, '<td valign="top">I expect this photo will do very well, as it is technically superb, very crisp, and well done. However, I have to say that the subject matter just doesn''t do much for me- just kinda static, very commercial. It''s a great shot, just a matter of taste.</td>', 'I expect this photo will do very well, as it is technically superb, very crisp, and well done. However, I have to say that the subject matter just doesn''t do much for me- just kinda static, very commercial. It''s a great shot, just a matter of taste.', '2004-06-02 05:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(746693, 80242, 20395, '<td valign="top">Sweet kittens! I might have warmed up the colors a little for a more warm and fuzzy feeling.</td>', 'Sweet kittens! I might have warmed up the colors a little for a more warm and fuzzy feeling.', '2004-06-02 05:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(746694, 80201, 20395, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad about that shadow! They''re very fun looking buildings, just sadly overshadowed.</td>', 'It''s too bad about that shadow! They''re very fun looking buildings, just sadly overshadowed.', '2004-06-02 05:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(746702, 79831, 20395, '<td valign="top">That''s a very cool idea, but it makes my eyes hurt to look at it! Love that color.</td>', 'That''s a very cool idea, but it makes my eyes hurt to look at it! Love that color.', '2004-06-02 05:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
