(747811, 80386, 16126, '<td valign="top">Nice composition with the track lines! I think I would have preferred either a shorter shutter speed to have a crisper focus on the athlete, or a much longer one to have more sense of speed. 7</td>', 'Nice composition with the track lines! I think I would have preferred either a shorter shutter speed to have a crisper focus on the athlete, or a much longer one to have more sense of speed. 7', '2004-06-02 19:58:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(747814, 79784, 22046, '<td valign="top">Excellent action shots. One of my top choices in this challenge.</td>', 'Excellent action shots. One of my top choices in this challenge.', '2004-06-02 19:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(747816, 80188, 22046, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this and the choice of colors.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this and the choice of colors.', '2004-06-02 20:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(747827, 79346, 16126, '<td valign="top">Nice colors! The composition is quite flat looking at the shacks straight on.  You might have improved by including much more sky and cropping off almost all of the foreground leaving only the grass. 7</td>', 'Nice colors! The composition is quite flat looking at the shacks straight on.  You might have improved by including much more sky and cropping off almost all of the foreground leaving only the grass. 7', '2004-06-02 20:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(747837, 79257, 16126, '<td valign="top">What I like a lot here: the B&amp;W is done very well, brings out a lot of contrast, the texture of the wall is great, very interesting, same for the texture in the water. What I don''t like is the separation between wall and water right in the middle, makes me wonder what it is you want me to look at. Both wall and water are interesting, but I keep hopping between them which is uncomfortable for this type of image. To me, at least. 8</td>', 'What I like a lot here: the B&W is done very well, brings out a lot of contrast, the texture of the wall is great, very interesting, same for the texture in the water. What I don''t like is the separation between wall and water right in the middle, makes me wonder what it is you want me to look at. Both wall and water are interesting, but I keep hopping between them which is uncomfortable for this type of image. To me, at least. 8', '2004-06-02 20:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(747841, 79360, 16126, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The only thing I find slightly distracting is that the right eye is almost touched by the upper fan, looks a bit unnatural.</td>', 'Very nice! The only thing I find slightly distracting is that the right eye is almost touched by the upper fan, looks a bit unnatural.', '2004-06-02 20:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(747849, 80401, 806, '<td valign="top">very very pretty. great job on the exposure and timing of capture!</td>', 'very very pretty. great job on the exposure and timing of capture!', '2004-06-02 20:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(747851, 79740, 15920, '<td valign="top">What I like about this image most is the clarity of the colors, and hopefully, you''ll have in your notes what you used.  I rated this an 8 because I think the stems could are just a little off in color.</td>', 'What I like about this image most is the clarity of the colors, and hopefully, you''ll have in your notes what you used.  I rated this an 8 because I think the stems could are just a little off in color.', '2004-06-02 20:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(747853, 80363, 15920, '<td valign="top">I rated this a 6 because I think the exposure is solid and the fade into black at the bottom is well done.  Brighter light at the top and a slightly more interesting composition would have gotten a point or two extra from me.</td>', 'I rated this a 6 because I think the exposure is solid and the fade into black at the bottom is well done.  Brighter light at the top and a slightly more interesting composition would have gotten a point or two extra from me.', '2004-06-02 20:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(747855, 79805, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a good picture of a flower, and I rated it as such (5).  Main problem with this is that flowers really need to make an impact to have me notice them since we see so many every week.  Technically, a little sharper focus on the pedals would have strengthened this.</td>', 'This is a good picture of a flower, and I rated it as such (5).  Main problem with this is that flowers really need to make an impact to have me notice them since we see so many every week.  Technically, a little sharper focus on the pedals would have strengthened this.', '2004-06-02 20:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(747860, 80214, 15920, '<td valign="top">I scored this a 4 because the link to the challenge isn''t that strong.  However, it is a beautiful shot of rushing water that has both good coloring and choice of exposure time and DOF.</td>', 'I scored this a 4 because the link to the challenge isn''t that strong.  However, it is a beautiful shot of rushing water that has both good coloring and choice of exposure time and DOF.', '2004-06-02 20:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(747862, 79101, 15920, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to make of this, but, I hope you achieved whatever result you are after.</td>', 'I don''t know what to make of this, but, I hope you achieved whatever result you are after.', '2004-06-02 20:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(747868, 80197, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is great.  I even set up spoons to check out the reflections, and concluded that you had a great idea on a simple thing.  Composition, clean background, interesting pose on the models, and good title.  One of my top three picks in the challenge.</td>', 'This is great.  I even set up spoons to check out the reflections, and concluded that you had a great idea on a simple thing.  Composition, clean background, interesting pose on the models, and good title.  One of my top three picks in the challenge.', '2004-06-02 20:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(747903, 80362, 9581, '<td valign="top">very cute! its that time of year for them....I  was able to take some pics of kitties yesterday.... this is a great photo</td>', 'very cute! its that time of year for them....I  was able to take some pics of kitties yesterday.... this is a great photo', '2004-06-02 20:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(747905, 79665, 9581, '<td valign="top">awesome this must be a picture from a canon??? I am assumming cause It really is awesome &amp; different too!!</td>', 'awesome this must be a picture from a canon??? I am assumming cause It really is awesome & different too!!', '2004-06-02 21:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(747917, 79084, 9581, '<td valign="top">funny!  good picture!</td>', 'funny!  good picture!', '2004-06-02 21:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(747930, 79389, 15920, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting, crisp clear focus, clean colors, and interesting composition (one cut stem) separates this from all the other flower shots.</td>', 'Excellent lighting, crisp clear focus, clean colors, and interesting composition (one cut stem) separates this from all the other flower shots.', '2004-06-02 21:23:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(747931, 80203, 15920, '<td valign="top">Excellent sharp focus and color.  Best of the "Cherries" shots.</td>', 'Excellent sharp focus and color.  Best of the "Cherries" shots.', '2004-06-02 21:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(747934, 79412, 15920, '<td valign="top">I scored this highly because it is an entertaining photo.  It needs more light to be a technically good photo, and the junk on the dashboard needs to go somewhere else.</td>', 'I scored this highly because it is an entertaining photo.  It needs more light to be a technically good photo, and the junk on the dashboard needs to go somewhere else.', '2004-06-02 21:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(747937, 79755, 15920, '<td valign="top">Unfortunate subject, great photo.  Water running down roof, flames, and concentration on three firefighters make the viewer feel the tension.</td>', 'Unfortunate subject, great photo.  Water running down roof, flames, and concentration on three firefighters make the viewer feel the tension.', '2004-06-02 21:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(747943, 79611, 4267, '<td valign="top">WHERE''S THE THREE?</td>', 'WHERE''S THE THREE?', '2004-06-02 21:32:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(747945, 80383, 806, '<td valign="top">LOL! Would like to see the shot of the photographer soaked after this one was taken! <br/>cool action shot! nice spin on the challenge.</td>', 'LOL! Would like to see the shot of the photographer soaked after this one was taken! cool action shot! nice spin on the challenge.', '2004-06-02 21:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(747948, 80133, 806, '<td valign="top">I had to look at this twice to "get it" ... maybe I just wasn''t paying attention the first time. Anyway. good exposure, limited interest level.</td>', 'I had to look at this twice to "get it" ... maybe I just wasn''t paying attention the first time. Anyway. good exposure, limited interest level.', '2004-06-02 21:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(747951, 79059, 806, '<td valign="top">fantastic shot! reflections are great. composition of the birds and the shoreline make a nice smooth transition rather than having a horizon line.<br/>good exposure in the whites, and interesting use of the tones.</td>', 'fantastic shot! reflections are great. composition of the birds and the shoreline make a nice smooth transition rather than having a horizon line.good exposure in the whites, and interesting use of the tones.', '2004-06-02 21:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(747961, 80323, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and color contrast.</td>', 'Great DOF and color contrast.', '2004-06-02 21:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(747965, 80265, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. I see what you were trying to do with the composition, but I think it may have worked better if the subject was more center weighted?</td>', 'Very nice photo. I see what you were trying to do with the composition, but I think it may have worked better if the subject was more center weighted?', '2004-06-02 21:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(747967, 79448, 806, '<td valign="top">very very interesting composition and subject matter.  nicely done with the lighting and dof too.</td>', 'very very interesting composition and subject matter.  nicely done with the lighting and dof too.', '2004-06-02 21:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(747969, 80368, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very good DOF, colors and textures. Seems a little grainy, ISO maybe?</td>', 'Very good DOF, colors and textures. Seems a little grainy, ISO maybe?', '2004-06-02 21:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(747971, 80061, 20235, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and tilt of the camera here. The desaturation also works well to emphasize the shapes and lines in the photo.</td>', 'I like the composition and tilt of the camera here. The desaturation also works well to emphasize the shapes and lines in the photo.', '2004-06-02 21:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(747973, 79447, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great detail and deep DOF.</td>', 'Great detail and deep DOF.', '2004-06-02 21:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(747975, 80075, 20235, '<td valign="top">Good interplay with the lighting and shadopws for effect. The b&amp;w works very well here.</td>', 'Good interplay with the lighting and shadopws for effect. The b&w works very well here.', '2004-06-02 21:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(747978, 80402, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and textures here. The dark backgroud and shallow DOF work well.</td>', 'Very nice colors and textures here. The dark backgroud and shallow DOF work well.', '2004-06-02 21:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(747980, 80070, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great bird shot. Detail and colors are excellent. Maybe some cropping to compose the flapping bird more in the centre might have helped?</td>', 'Great bird shot. Detail and colors are excellent. Maybe some cropping to compose the flapping bird more in the centre might have helped?', '2004-06-02 21:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(747982, 80095, 806, '<td valign="top">beautiful use of light. great color saturation. fairly interesting to view.</td>', 'beautiful use of light. great color saturation. fairly interesting to view.', '2004-06-02 21:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(747983, 79490, 20235, '<td valign="top">Composition, color pallete, and detail are excellent.</td>', 'Composition, color pallete, and detail are excellent.', '2004-06-02 21:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(747984, 79101, 4267, '<td valign="top">wheres the three?</td>', 'wheres the three?', '2004-06-02 21:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(747986, 79401, 4267, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective and crop</td>', 'interesting perspective and crop', '2004-06-02 21:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(747987, 79756, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very pretty picture. The color tone really reflects the mood of the night and flame blowers. The border is nice, but a little heavy for my tastes.</td>', 'Very pretty picture. The color tone really reflects the mood of the night and flame blowers. The border is nice, but a little heavy for my tastes.', '2004-06-02 21:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(747988, 79957, 4267, '<td valign="top">needs some kind of unique perspective to really shine</td>', 'needs some kind of unique perspective to really shine', '2004-06-02 21:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(747993, 80388, 20235, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky. Detail and color saturation look spot on. I think the composition suffered a little though with the ships overpowered by the land masses on the horizon. However, this is often an impossible factor to control in landscape shots. Well done.</td>', 'Beautiful sky. Detail and color saturation look spot on. I think the composition suffered a little though with the ships overpowered by the land masses on the horizon. However, this is often an impossible factor to control in landscape shots. Well done.', '2004-06-02 21:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(747994, 80235, 806, '<td valign="top">incredible capture. perfect timing for this. is that a magnolia?<br/>love the b&amp;w treatment, and the way the ants form a leading line.</td>', 'incredible capture. perfect timing for this. is that a magnolia?love the b&w treatment, and the way the ants form a leading line.', '2004-06-02 21:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(747995, 80025, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great soft focus and color contrast. The lighting is very nice too.</td>', 'Great soft focus and color contrast. The lighting is very nice too.', '2004-06-02 21:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(747998, 80183, 4267, '<td valign="top">wheres the three?</td>', 'wheres the three?', '2004-06-02 21:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(747999, 80318, 4267, '<td valign="top">the 3 is not really the subject</td>', 'the 3 is not really the subject', '2004-06-02 21:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(748000, 79784, 806, '<td valign="top">great moment. superb capture. might use a bit more contrast, but love the feeling!</td>', 'great moment. superb capture. might use a bit more contrast, but love the feeling!', '2004-06-02 21:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(748001, 80255, 20235, '<td valign="top">There is alot of  underexposure here. The focus and detail are off too. Might have been nicer if the lighting was more favorable.</td>', 'There is alot of  underexposure here. The focus and detail are off too. Might have been nicer if the lighting was more favorable.', '2004-06-02 21:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(748003, 80329, 806, '<td valign="top">lighting is done well, but the interest level just isn''t there for me.</td>', 'lighting is done well, but the interest level just isn''t there for me.', '2004-06-02 21:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(748004, 80235, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot and excellent detail. Composition and direction of the ants works nicely. I would have liked this shot in color though.</td>', 'Great macro shot and excellent detail. Composition and direction of the ants works nicely. I would have liked this shot in color though.', '2004-06-02 21:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(748007, 80359, 20235, '<td valign="top">Surprisingly interesting photo to look at given the subject matter. Lighting and detail is excellent. Maybe some cropping to remove the cardboard box at the bottom may have helped?</td>', 'Surprisingly interesting photo to look at given the subject matter. Lighting and detail is excellent. Maybe some cropping to remove the cardboard box at the bottom may have helped?', '2004-06-02 21:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(748008, 80317, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice. Desaturation of the colors except on the ball really emphasize the subject.</td>', 'Very nice. Desaturation of the colors except on the ball really emphasize the subject.', '2004-06-02 21:59:26.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(748010, 80329, 20235, '<td valign="top">Cute picture. Composition and contrast is nice. Rabbits seem a tad overexposed though.</td>', 'Cute picture. Composition and contrast is nice. Rabbits seem a tad overexposed though.', '2004-06-02 22:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(748016, 79401, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great photo and title. Clarity and detail is excellent. Would make a great product shot or advertisement....7</td>', 'Great photo and title. Clarity and detail is excellent. Would make a great product shot or advertisement....7', '2004-06-02 22:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(748019, 79757, 20235, '<td valign="top">The subject is nicely composed. But I find the roof line and shadows on the floos slightly distracting. Nice shot otherwise.</td>', 'The subject is nicely composed. But I find the roof line and shadows on the floos slightly distracting. Nice shot otherwise.', '2004-06-02 22:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(748020, 79785, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great lighting in this shot... gives the subject a nice soft focus.</td>', 'Great lighting in this shot... gives the subject a nice soft focus.', '2004-06-02 22:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(748032, 80381, 20925, '<td valign="top">I really like the subtle differences in metal coloring.  The neutral background really makes the subject pop.  Looks a tiny bit blurry but not bad enough to take away from the shot.  Oh, but I''ll complain about the title - I can see 6 fingers, the 5 obvious ones and the nearly hidden pinky wearing the ring.  :^)</td>', 'I really like the subtle differences in metal coloring.  The neutral background really makes the subject pop.  Looks a tiny bit blurry but not bad enough to take away from the shot.  Oh, but I''ll complain about the title - I can see 6 fingers, the 5 obvious ones and the nearly hidden pinky wearing the ring.  :^)', '2004-06-02 22:28:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(748035, 79059, 20925, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Love the contrast and the grainy feel.  Would love to know your process/workflow for BW conversion after the challenge.</td>', 'Nice.  Love the contrast and the grainy feel.  Would love to know your process/workflow for BW conversion after the challenge.', '2004-06-02 22:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(748038, 80188, 20925, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this shot.  The textures and colors really work well.  Would love to have seen other angles, but then the structure of the shot probably would have broken down.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this shot.  The textures and colors really work well.  Would love to have seen other angles, but then the structure of the shot probably would have broken down.', '2004-06-02 22:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(748042, 79443, 20925, '<td valign="top">I knew I liked this shot when I first voted.  Now that I''m revisiting it to comment, I noticed (for the first time--duh) the 3 second hands.  I like it more now, and I''m upping my vote.  Only complaint would be - starting the exposure 1 second earlier would have centered the second hand on the 3 mark.</td>', 'I knew I liked this shot when I first voted.  Now that I''m revisiting it to comment, I noticed (for the first time--duh) the 3 second hands.  I like it more now, and I''m upping my vote.  Only complaint would be - starting the exposure 1 second earlier would have centered the second hand on the 3 mark.', '2004-06-02 22:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(748052, 79727, 19040, '<td valign="top">I like the colors</td>', 'I like the colors', '2004-06-02 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(748055, 80121, 19040, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of a Degas painting.</td>', 'Reminds me of a Degas painting.', '2004-06-02 22:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(748056, 79965, 19040, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting. Very pretty</td>', 'I like the lighting. Very pretty', '2004-06-02 22:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(748057, 80264, 19040, '<td valign="top">I really like the smoke.</td>', 'I really like the smoke.', '2004-06-02 22:57:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(748072, 79830, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good find, though the out of focus cone in the rear is a little disappointing. Color and exposure are right on, and I like the diagonal composition. I''ll bet you''re kicking yourself over the distracting blue strip at the bottom.</td>', 'Good find, though the out of focus cone in the rear is a little disappointing. Color and exposure are right on, and I like the diagonal composition. I''ll bet you''re kicking yourself over the distracting blue strip at the bottom.', '2004-06-02 23:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(748075, 79322, 17203, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. I like the shadowbox effect, too. It might have been even nicer with the warmer light and angled shadows of late afternoon. Without the shadows, you lose some dimension.</td>', 'Cool shot. I like the shadowbox effect, too. It might have been even nicer with the warmer light and angled shadows of late afternoon. Without the shadows, you lose some dimension.', '2004-06-02 23:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(748082, 79360, 17203, '<td valign="top">Yes, there are 3 fans, but the subject here are those great eyes. Perhaps with a little more light on the dark fan and a wider crop you might get a little more attention on the fans. Wish I could see the color version- it looks like you had a good exposure on the eyes.</td>', 'Yes, there are 3 fans, but the subject here are those great eyes. Perhaps with a little more light on the dark fan and a wider crop you might get a little more attention on the fans. Wish I could see the color version- it looks like you had a good exposure on the eyes.', '2004-06-02 23:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(748087, 79740, 17203, '<td valign="top">Yessiree... the old red wine, white wine and, uh... toilet bowl cleaner photo. Great color and exposure. One of my favorites in spite of being yet another shot of glasses.</td>', 'Yessiree... the old red wine, white wine and, uh... toilet bowl cleaner photo. Great color and exposure. One of my favorites in spite of being yet another shot of glasses.', '2004-06-02 23:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(748098, 80074, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good crop and color, but even with a perfect exposure, this type of shot won''t tend to fare well in the voting. The backs of three strangers aren''t particularly interesting to most, and you''ll get some 1 votes for the apparent 4th person in the stroller. Shooting 1/2 second earlier would have avoided the tree lining up with the man''s head.</td>', 'Good crop and color, but even with a perfect exposure, this type of shot won''t tend to fare well in the voting. The backs of three strangers aren''t particularly interesting to most, and you''ll get some 1 votes for the apparent 4th person in the stroller. Shooting 1/2 second earlier would have avoided the tree lining up with the man''s head.', '2004-06-02 23:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(748106, 80121, 17203, '<td valign="top">Very nice Degas. Great composition and just enough movement to be expressive. The right ballerina''s arms and dress are blown out, but not horribly. Well done!</td>', 'Very nice Degas. Great composition and just enough movement to be expressive. The right ballerina''s arms and dress are blown out, but not horribly. Well done!', '2004-06-02 23:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(748115, 79412, 17203, '<td valign="top">A funny find, though the subject isn''t particularly interesting. Need a flash to get some light into the cab, and I''d have cropped out the distracting window frame and plastic bag on the right.</td>', 'A funny find, though the subject isn''t particularly interesting. Need a flash to get some light into the cab, and I''d have cropped out the distracting window frame and plastic bag on the right.', '2004-06-02 23:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(748124, 80329, 17203, '<td valign="top">A little too cutesy for my taste, but it does meet the challenge. Maybe if the bunnies were in a more interesting environment or actually doing something, I could get past the Precious Moments feel.</td>', 'A little too cutesy for my taste, but it does meet the challenge. Maybe if the bunnies were in a more interesting environment or actually doing something, I could get past the Precious Moments feel.', '2004-06-02 23:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(748128, 80189, 17203, '<td valign="top">The sharp angle conveys an impression of 1 train rather than 3 cars. Nice shot, though- it''s a shame it was such a dreary day. Puffy white clouds on a deep blue sky would have really popped the color of the train. Just change the weather next time- OK?  ;-)</td>', 'The sharp angle conveys an impression of 1 train rather than 3 cars. Nice shot, though- it''s a shame it was such a dreary day. Puffy white clouds on a deep blue sky would have really popped the color of the train. Just change the weather next time- OK?  ;-)', '2004-06-02 23:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(748130, 80224, 17203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Great exposure to get detail in the water and clouds. I think it looks slightly better if I cover the left side for a vertical crop.</td>', 'Beautiful. Great exposure to get detail in the water and clouds. I think it looks slightly better if I cover the left side for a vertical crop.', '2004-06-02 23:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(748132, 80340, 17203, '<td valign="top">Ooooh... pretty colors. I''d like to see the tree branches at left and entire bottom cropped off. That would avoid the bright area above the horizon and forces the viewer to imagine a graceful tall ship rather than what seems to be a monument of some kind.</td>', 'Ooooh... pretty colors. I''d like to see the tree branches at left and entire bottom cropped off. That would avoid the bright area above the horizon and forces the viewer to imagine a graceful tall ship rather than what seems to be a monument of some kind.', '2004-06-03 00:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(748133, 80174, 17203, '<td valign="top">Love it. The slanted green bowl is a little annoying, but the concept is great.</td>', 'Love it. The slanted green bowl is a little annoying, but the concept is great.', '2004-06-03 00:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(748139, 80400, 17203, '<td valign="top">Mmmm... save 1 berry 4 me! Great color and DOF. Perhaps a tighter crop and a spritz of water? The voters tend to favor water beads.</td>', 'Mmmm... save 1 berry 4 me! Great color and DOF. Perhaps a tighter crop and a spritz of water? The voters tend to favor water beads.', '2004-06-03 00:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(748143, 80395, 509, '<td valign="top">I think some more lighting would have helped, as well as a lower vantage point showing more of the kittens'' faces.</td>', 'I think some more lighting would have helped, as well as a lower vantage point showing more of the kittens'' faces.', '2004-06-03 00:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(748144, 79466, 17203, '<td valign="top">Fabulous color, but I think this conveys "5 or 6 with an unfortunate crop" rather than "three." You might have scored higher by yanking the extra petals off rather than forcing the crop.</td>', 'Fabulous color, but I think this conveys "5 or 6 with an unfortunate crop" rather than "three." You might have scored higher by yanking the extra petals off rather than forcing the crop.', '2004-06-03 00:14:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(748147, 79814, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good concept and color. You might consider desaturating the caps to eliminate the color fringes.</td>', 'Good concept and color. You might consider desaturating the caps to eliminate the color fringes.', '2004-06-03 00:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(748155, 79953, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good exposure, but your models weren''t very helpful... the squatting second duck and centered composition don''t yield a particularly interesting duck photo. Maybe if you dangled a piece of bread just above them so they were all reaching for it, or something like that?</td>', 'Good exposure, but your models weren''t very helpful... the squatting second duck and centered composition don''t yield a particularly interesting duck photo. Maybe if you dangled a piece of bread just above them so they were all reaching for it, or something like that?', '2004-06-03 00:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(748156, 79280, 17203, '<td valign="top">Funny. Good color- the sprinkles add a lot.</td>', 'Funny. Good color- the sprinkles add a lot.', '2004-06-03 00:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(748159, 79557, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good subject and composition. It''s a shame the light wasn''t a little more dramatic. With a few water drops and a warm, late afternoon sun, this could snag a ribbon.</td>', 'Good subject and composition. It''s a shame the light wasn''t a little more dramatic. With a few water drops and a warm, late afternoon sun, this could snag a ribbon.', '2004-06-03 00:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(748160, 80100, 17203, '<td valign="top">Snip that fourth bud! Good DOF, though I wish all three flowers were in focus.</td>', 'Snip that fourth bud! Good DOF, though I wish all three flowers were in focus.', '2004-06-03 00:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(748162, 80203, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good color and light. A little more DOF to get that stem in focus would finish this off nicely.</td>', 'Good color and light. A little more DOF to get that stem in focus would finish this off nicely.', '2004-06-03 00:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(748164, 79548, 17203, '<td valign="top">Great shot. One of the best so far.</td>', 'Great shot. One of the best so far.', '2004-06-03 00:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(748166, 80274, 8891, '<td valign="top">very nice detail and composition. The colors are nice as well. My only nit is that it is hard for me to discern where the large feathers begin and end. I''m sure it should be obvious bu the difference in color and pattern on the bottom most feather is throwing me.  Very nice despite my apparent lack of visual accuity.</td>', 'very nice detail and composition. The colors are nice as well. My only nit is that it is hard for me to discern where the large feathers begin and end. I''m sure it should be obvious bu the difference in color and pattern on the bottom most feather is throwing me.  Very nice despite my apparent lack of visual accuity.', '2004-06-03 00:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(748168, 80317, 8891, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what happened here.  I think the de sat might be the culprit. the front of the 3 ball is fine and shows great depth, but the back half of the ball looks flat and without dimension at all.</td>', 'I''m not sure what happened here.  I think the de sat might be the culprit. the front of the 3 ball is fine and shows great depth, but the back half of the ball looks flat and without dimension at all.', '2004-06-03 00:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(748169, 79490, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good idea, love the color. You might consider rotating the shot a bit more to the left for a stronger angle on the lower two blades- they almost line up horizontally.</td>', 'Good idea, love the color. You might consider rotating the shot a bit more to the left for a stronger angle on the lower two blades- they almost line up horizontally.', '2004-06-03 00:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(748172, 80272, 8891, '<td valign="top">I think if you had shot this more to your right, the 3 leaf munchers might be more apparent.  As it is the two on the left are so melded together it is hard for me to tell that there are actually two there....Might just be me.  The colors are very nice as is the detail. Very nice find and capture.</td>', 'I think if you had shot this more to your right, the 3 leaf munchers might be more apparent.  As it is the two on the left are so melded together it is hard for me to tell that there are actually two there....Might just be me.  The colors are very nice as is the detail. Very nice find and capture.', '2004-06-03 00:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(748174, 80253, 8891, '<td valign="top">Well that is close up. Might it be too close? I think it might. A quarter is a quarter after all and going this close just cuts down on the abilitiy to compose and see a bit more of the detail that you have captured so finely.</td>', 'Well that is close up. Might it be too close? I think it might. A quarter is a quarter after all and going this close just cuts down on the abilitiy to compose and see a bit more of the detail that you have captured so finely.', '2004-06-03 00:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(748175, 79374, 17203, '<td valign="top">I know these are all triangles, but I keep seeing hexagons. Just my perception, but It doesn''t communicate as a shot of three of something. Good exposure and composition, though.</td>', 'I know these are all triangles, but I keep seeing hexagons. Just my perception, but It doesn''t communicate as a shot of three of something. Good exposure and composition, though.', '2004-06-03 00:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(748176, 80334, 17203, '<td valign="top">I understand the three blades, but the subject isn''t particulalry interesting. Perhaps some strong, colored lights could spice it up?</td>', 'I understand the three blades, but the subject isn''t particulalry interesting. Perhaps some strong, colored lights could spice it up?', '2004-06-03 00:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(748177, 80214, 8891, '<td valign="top">I sort of see a 3 formed by the bends of embankment. Or are the bends the 3 part? Not sure. But the 3  formed by the erosion of this falling water might have been more evident if shot a bit more to the right and higher up as well.</td>', 'I sort of see a 3 formed by the bends of embankment. Or are the bends the 3 part? Not sure. But the 3  formed by the erosion of this falling water might have been more evident if shot a bit more to the right and higher up as well.', '2004-06-03 00:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(748179, 79084, 8891, '<td valign="top">LOL! ain''t it the truth!</td>', 'LOL! ain''t it the truth!', '2004-06-03 00:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(748181, 80324, 11895, '<td valign="top">creative, imaginative, original, neat pic</td>', 'creative, imaginative, original, neat pic', '2004-06-03 00:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(748184, 79424, 17203, '<td valign="top">Guess you had to be there. The color, exposure and composition are all good, but the subject isn''t particulalry interesting (cute title, though). Three rocks and a cat''s rear end just aren''t going to stand out... unless you can get the cat to juggle the rocks.  ;-)</td>', 'Guess you had to be there. The color, exposure and composition are all good, but the subject isn''t particulalry interesting (cute title, though). Three rocks and a cat''s rear end just aren''t going to stand out... unless you can get the cat to juggle the rocks.  ;-)', '2004-06-03 00:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(748185, 79727, 11895, '<td valign="top">this would have scored higher with me if more of the subject was in focus</td>', 'this would have scored higher with me if more of the subject was in focus', '2004-06-03 00:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(748187, 80362, 17203, '<td valign="top">Cute kitties, though the bottom one blinked. Unfortunately, without some unique action or extraordinary lighting in the shot, you''ll have a tough time against the Cat-Haters Anonymous crowd. Good luck.</td>', 'Cute kitties, though the bottom one blinked. Unfortunately, without some unique action or extraordinary lighting in the shot, you''ll have a tough time against the Cat-Haters Anonymous crowd. Good luck.', '2004-06-03 00:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(748189, 80372, 17203, '<td valign="top">Not sure the silhouette helps here. Good idea, but I think you could have put some light on the juggler without compromising the great transparency of the bottles.</td>', 'Not sure the silhouette helps here. Good idea, but I think you could have put some light on the juggler without compromising the great transparency of the bottles.', '2004-06-03 00:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(748190, 80147, 17203, '<td valign="top">Not baaa-aad. Good color and cute kids.</td>', 'Not baaa-aad. Good color and cute kids.', '2004-06-03 00:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(748191, 79185, 17203, '<td valign="top">Except that one of them is hidden in shadow. Good color and composition, but that dark leaf hurts.</td>', 'Except that one of them is hidden in shadow. Good color and composition, but that dark leaf hurts.', '2004-06-03 00:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(748195, 80133, 17203, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the reference to three. Assuming it''s the three people, but they are very minor elements, not the subject of the photo.</td>', 'I don''t get the reference to three. Assuming it''s the three people, but they are very minor elements, not the subject of the photo.', '2004-06-03 01:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(748197, 80034, 17203, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what''s going on at the bottom of the photo, and it''s distracting from an otherwise fine shot. Are those antlers on a table? Maybe eliminate the bottom elements and wait for a passing bird or plane to add interest?</td>', 'I can''t tell what''s going on at the bottom of the photo, and it''s distracting from an otherwise fine shot. Are those antlers on a table? Maybe eliminate the bottom elements and wait for a passing bird or plane to add interest?', '2004-06-03 01:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(748216, 80183, 11895, '<td valign="top">needs more depth of field</td>', 'needs more depth of field', '2004-06-03 01:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(748249, 80270, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple composition. Bottom could be cropped more to eliminate the light shape in the lower left. Cherries are out of focus especially the stems.</td>', 'Nice and simple composition. Bottom could be cropped more to eliminate the light shape in the lower left. Cherries are out of focus especially the stems.', '2004-06-03 02:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(748254, 79562, 8054, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of the more interesting and original entries. Lots of crisp details (slight oversharpening?) of the paper and the rock but the scissors seem a bit soft and may be due to the lighting. There are two small gray spots (one to the right of the scissors and another to the left of the paper) that should have been cloned out.</td>', 'Definitely one of the more interesting and original entries. Lots of crisp details (slight oversharpening?) of the paper and the rock but the scissors seem a bit soft and may be due to the lighting. There are two small gray spots (one to the right of the scissors and another to the left of the paper) that should have been cloned out.', '2004-06-03 02:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(748258, 80407, 8054, '<td valign="top">Above the right antenna there is a small dark spot probably due to a dirty lens. I think if the antennae were not there this would make a good landscape picture but I feel the three antennae should be the dominant portion of the photo, not the landscape. Image is also hazy and could use some help with levels adjustment.</td>', 'Above the right antenna there is a small dark spot probably due to a dirty lens. I think if the antennae were not there this would make a good landscape picture but I feel the three antennae should be the dominant portion of the photo, not the landscape. Image is also hazy and could use some help with levels adjustment.', '2004-06-03 02:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(748264, 79787, 8054, '<td valign="top">I like this idea a lot and is very creative. Nice choice using clear push pins, too. Lighting and contrast are excellent. Now, the only thing that is stopping me from giving you a 10 is the border. Personally, I feel it is too thick for a simple composition such as this. If you left it as a simple thin black border (maybe 4 or 5 pixels) I''d probably rate it higher. 8</td>', 'I like this idea a lot and is very creative. Nice choice using clear push pins, too. Lighting and contrast are excellent. Now, the only thing that is stopping me from giving you a 10 is the border. Personally, I feel it is too thick for a simple composition such as this. If you left it as a simple thin black border (maybe 4 or 5 pixels) I''d probably rate it higher. 8', '2004-06-03 03:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(748265, 79455, 8054, '<td valign="top">Excessive oversharpening.</td>', 'Excessive oversharpening.', '2004-06-03 03:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(748268, 79381, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very cute photo of squirrels! I see them  from time to time around here and they do just that. They love to hide behind things and pretend they can''t be seen. Anyway, great shot of these guys with nice details of the fur. Good use of patterned neg space above them. I wish I could see the whole tail of the one on the left and with a bit of cushion space after that. Contrast seems a bit low, too.</td>', 'Very cute photo of squirrels! I see them  from time to time around here and they do just that. They love to hide behind things and pretend they can''t be seen. Anyway, great shot of these guys with nice details of the fur. Good use of patterned neg space above them. I wish I could see the whole tail of the one on the left and with a bit of cushion space after that. Contrast seems a bit low, too.', '2004-06-03 03:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(748270, 79090, 8054, '<td valign="top">This is great! Must not be easy trying to coordinate snails so I do give you extra brownie points for getting two out of three sort-of facing the same way. I also really like the lighting and how it shows details of the shell and the surface of the snail. Focus is amazing as I can even see the small beady eyes of the foreground snail. I would rather see more space in front of the snails in this type of composition than equal on both sides as they appear to be moving from left to right. I won''t deduct this time because I like this photo. 9</td>', 'This is great! Must not be easy trying to coordinate snails so I do give you extra brownie points for getting two out of three sort-of facing the same way. I also really like the lighting and how it shows details of the shell and the surface of the snail. Focus is amazing as I can even see the small beady eyes of the foreground snail. I would rather see more space in front of the snails in this type of composition than equal on both sides as they appear to be moving from left to right. I won''t deduct this time because I like this photo. 9', '2004-06-03 03:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(748274, 80188, 19608, '<td valign="top">My typical voting pattern is a first pass to assign scores followed by more detailed passes to make comments.    My initial impression of this image was very positive - and this,  my 3rd or 4th pass,  is even more positive.  I must admit I am passionalte about the US Southwest - or similar locations - but this image is very captivating.<br/>So simple yet so perfectly composed and exposed.   I can say no more.</td>', 'My typical voting pattern is a first pass to assign scores followed by more detailed passes to make comments.    My initial impression of this image was very positive - and this,  my 3rd or 4th pass,  is even more positive.  I must admit I am passionalte about the US Southwest - or similar locations - but this image is very captivating.So simple yet so perfectly composed and exposed.   I can say no more.', '2004-06-03 03:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(748290, 80197, 16632, '<td valign="top">I love your photo ! The idea is great, man !<br/>moszi,<br/>www.moszi.net</td>', 'I love your photo ! The idea is great, man !moszi,www.moszi.net', '2004-06-03 04:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(748297, 80277, 20395, '<td valign="top">Interesting take, although I thought they were cocktail swords from the thumbnail ;-). The shadow seems a little overpowering- maybe a lighter or darker background to offset the subject?<br/></td>', 'Interesting take, although I thought they were cocktail swords from the thumbnail ;-). The shadow seems a little overpowering- maybe a lighter or darker background to offset the subject?', '2004-06-03 04:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(748300, 80074, 20395, '<td valign="top">The lighting is nice, very peaceful candid.</td>', 'The lighting is nice, very peaceful candid.', '2004-06-03 04:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(748304, 79109, 20395, '<td valign="top">Selective desat? Just as a thought, try changing the color on the pills- something more vibrant to contrast with the black and white (pink?). The lighting makes for a neat abstract, but I''m sort of thrown off by the "ew, medicine"-ness of the subject matter. Just one girl''s opinion :-)</td>', 'Selective desat? Just as a thought, try changing the color on the pills- something more vibrant to contrast with the black and white (pink?). The lighting makes for a neat abstract, but I''m sort of thrown off by the "ew, medicine"-ness of the subject matter. Just one girl''s opinion :-)', '2004-06-03 04:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(748305, 80331, 20395, '<td valign="top">Some people might be unimpressed, but I like it.</td>', 'Some people might be unimpressed, but I like it.', '2004-06-03 04:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(748306, 78955, 20395, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and texture.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and texture.', '2004-06-03 04:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(748307, 80165, 20395, '<td valign="top">The lighting is pretty harsh. I know you took this shot candidly, but next time, maybe try having the kids pose for you in the shade- it''ll cut down on the glare a lot.</td>', 'The lighting is pretty harsh. I know you took this shot candidly, but next time, maybe try having the kids pose for you in the shade- it''ll cut down on the glare a lot.', '2004-06-03 04:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(748310, 80370, 20395, '<td valign="top">I like the little hint of the moon and the sky is beautiful. I might have cloned out that white pointy thing under the bridge.</td>', 'I like the little hint of the moon and the sky is beautiful. I might have cloned out that white pointy thing under the bridge.', '2004-06-03 04:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(748312, 79727, 20395, '<td valign="top">The warmth of the background works well. Try rotating it 90 degrees CCW just for kicks and giggles- I think it might balance it better.</td>', 'The warmth of the background works well. Try rotating it 90 degrees CCW just for kicks and giggles- I think it might balance it better.', '2004-06-03 04:52:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(748313, 80197, 20395, '<td valign="top">Clever idea! I think cutting down on the number of details might have helped the impact of this shot. Taking it somewhere with only sky, or inside with a white ceiling, and getting rid of things like her sunglasses and his watch would help draw the view just to the 3 faces. That being said, very creative, and I''m amazed you kept yourself out of the reflections!</td>', 'Clever idea! I think cutting down on the number of details might have helped the impact of this shot. Taking it somewhere with only sky, or inside with a white ceiling, and getting rid of things like her sunglasses and his watch would help draw the view just to the 3 faces. That being said, very creative, and I''m amazed you kept yourself out of the reflections!', '2004-06-03 04:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(748314, 79385, 20395, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea for a shot, but this picture suffers a bit from the flash lighting. Maybe next time try natural light and a tripod to get rid of the harshness of the flash.<br/></td>', 'This is a nice idea for a shot, but this picture suffers a bit from the flash lighting. Maybe next time try natural light and a tripod to get rid of the harshness of the flash.', '2004-06-03 05:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
