(748394, 79784, 15920, '<td valign="top">Motorcycles have become like flowers in my mind.  To score really well, the picture needs to be tack sharp, with perfect colors.  Both of those characteristics could be improved in this photo.  So, despite my score, as a normal picture/snap shot for an album, this is fantastic.</td>', 'Motorcycles have become like flowers in my mind.  To score really well, the picture needs to be tack sharp, with perfect colors.  Both of those characteristics could be improved in this photo.  So, despite my score, as a normal picture/snap shot for an album, this is fantastic.', '2004-06-03 07:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(748407, 80072, 15920, '<td valign="top">Tough shot to take and get everything sharp.</td>', 'Tough shot to take and get everything sharp.', '2004-06-03 08:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
