(748513, 80183, 13136, '<td valign="top">You know, I had to look at this about a dozen times for about 3-5 minutes each before I realized that red spot was a bird''s eye. Then it only took me a couple seconds to see the other two birds (that I originally thought were statues or loose bricks).<br/>You made me work too hard for this one!<br/>As a picture, I like the color, contrast and DOF. But in trying to show 3? I hope everyone else saw it quicker than I did.</td>', 'You know, I had to look at this about a dozen times for about 3-5 minutes each before I realized that red spot was a bird''s eye. Then it only took me a couple seconds to see the other two birds (that I originally thought were statues or loose bricks).You made me work too hard for this one!As a picture, I like the color, contrast and DOF. But in trying to show 3? I hope everyone else saw it quicker than I did.', '2004-06-03 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(748516, 80121, 13136, '<td valign="top">I like the tilt and photoshop work on this.</td>', 'I like the tilt and photoshop work on this.', '2004-06-03 11:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(748520, 80388, 13136, '<td valign="top">The ships are a bit secondary to this shot, but I like it anyway. If they were a bit more the main subject I would give another point.</td>', 'The ships are a bit secondary to this shot, but I like it anyway. If they were a bit more the main subject I would give another point.', '2004-06-03 11:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(748523, 80263, 13136, '<td valign="top">Took my idea, huh? Are you a Hollies fan also? Good use of desat although I might have selectively desaturated the striped poles also.</td>', 'Took my idea, huh? Are you a Hollies fan also? Good use of desat although I might have selectively desaturated the striped poles also.', '2004-06-03 11:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(748525, 80147, 13136, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, color and contrast. Not sure I like the darkening around the sugjects, but I don''t know what was in the picture there. It may have been neccesary</td>', 'Nice composition, color and contrast. Not sure I like the darkening around the sugjects, but I don''t know what was in the picture there. It may have been neccesary', '2004-06-03 11:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(748528, 80238, 13136, '<td valign="top">To me, all the tracks in the sand detract from the shot. I might have gone the other way, cropping at the bottom of the trees and showing negative space above them. Nice color and contrast.</td>', 'To me, all the tracks in the sand detract from the shot. I might have gone the other way, cropping at the bottom of the trees and showing negative space above them. Nice color and contrast.', '2004-06-03 11:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(748530, 80383, 13136, '<td valign="top">If you could have timed their jumps right, catching them halfway into the water would have gone better with the title and made much more of a splash as a picture (pun intended).</td>', 'If you could have timed their jumps right, catching them halfway into the water would have gone better with the title and made much more of a splash as a picture (pun intended).', '2004-06-03 11:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(748534, 80072, 13136, '<td valign="top">Really should have had #3 at the finish line. Keeping the three behind still in the shot. Chopping off the winner''s head is a big detraction to this shot. I like that you used a shutter speed that still conveyed the speed of the dogs.</td>', 'Really should have had #3 at the finish line. Keeping the three behind still in the shot. Chopping off the winner''s head is a big detraction to this shot. I like that you used a shutter speed that still conveyed the speed of the dogs.', '2004-06-03 11:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(748535, 80194, 13136, '<td valign="top">I can''t be sure, but those black things look like floppy disks. I don''t understand the connection to the cloth. You definitely got the 3.</td>', 'I can''t be sure, but those black things look like floppy disks. I don''t understand the connection to the cloth. You definitely got the 3.', '2004-06-03 11:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(748537, 80407, 13136, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t help that the day was so hazy. I also see two distracting dark smudges by the right tower. They look like lint or something on the lense.</td>', 'It doesn''t help that the day was so hazy. I also see two distracting dark smudges by the right tower. They look like lint or something on the lense.', '2004-06-03 11:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
