(749163, 80393, 21724, '<td valign="top">interesting background, i''d love to know how you achieved that effect (and got validated, too!)  Unfortunately, it almost makes this look more like digital art than photography which, in the context of this website, is probably a bad thing.  I love the soft focus effects you got on the statue, it makes the centered composition seem not so typical.</td>', 'interesting background, i''d love to know how you achieved that effect (and got validated, too!)  Unfortunately, it almost makes this look more like digital art than photography which, in the context of this website, is probably a bad thing.  I love the soft focus effects you got on the statue, it makes the centered composition seem not so typical.', '2004-06-03 18:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(749170, 79235, 1717, '<td valign="top">this is a good composition and the colors are nice.  i think a bit more contrast would help define the edges of the bottles a little more.</td>', 'this is a good composition and the colors are nice.  i think a bit more contrast would help define the edges of the bottles a little more.', '2004-06-03 18:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(749171, 80280, 21724, '<td valign="top">this seems to be very close the the line of being a literal representation of a piece of artwork.  I love the lighting and contrast in this picture, but I just don''t get a strong sense of you, the photographer, in this.  In the future, I would try to avoid dead-on pictures of artwork and instead try to infuse more of your own vision</td>', 'this seems to be very close the the line of being a literal representation of a piece of artwork.  I love the lighting and contrast in this picture, but I just don''t get a strong sense of you, the photographer, in this.  In the future, I would try to avoid dead-on pictures of artwork and instead try to infuse more of your own vision', '2004-06-03 18:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(749174, 80197, 1717, '<td valign="top">this is a clever take on the challenge and it''s well executed.</td>', 'this is a clever take on the challenge and it''s well executed.', '2004-06-03 18:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
