(749179, 80335, 21724, '<td valign="top">lovely picture, it made me smile :)  because of the bright shade of the flowers, the raindrops are difficult to see and take away from the purity of the petals.  you might try a different angle that makes the water droplets a bit more visible, or trying a similar shot with either dry or darker coloured flowers</td>', 'lovely picture, it made me smile :)  because of the bright shade of the flowers, the raindrops are difficult to see and take away from the purity of the petals.  you might try a different angle that makes the water droplets a bit more visible, or trying a similar shot with either dry or darker coloured flowers', '2004-06-03 18:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(749182, 79121, 21724, '<td valign="top">neat lighting!!  i wonder what it is... clever idea, as well, although the line down the center of the green and red crayons is extremely distracting.. some noise and dust specs, but overall a cool pic</td>', 'neat lighting!!  i wonder what it is... clever idea, as well, although the line down the center of the green and red crayons is extremely distracting.. some noise and dust specs, but overall a cool pic', '2004-06-03 18:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
