(749226, 79740, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great focus. The color ontrast and lighting are also excellent... 8</td>', 'Great focus. The color ontrast and lighting are also excellent... 8', '2004-06-03 18:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(749227, 80317, 21724, '<td valign="top">clever shot, very intense.. unfortunately the texture of the table makes the photo look grainy and overworked.  a very slight blur might help a little with that</td>', 'clever shot, very intense.. unfortunately the texture of the table makes the photo look grainy and overworked.  a very slight blur might help a little with that', '2004-06-03 18:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(749229, 79791, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice color saturation in this photo. The leaves to the right are a little distracting imho and son''t really help to frame the shot. Otherwise, really nice photo</td>', 'Nice color saturation in this photo. The leaves to the right are a little distracting imho and son''t really help to frame the shot. Otherwise, really nice photo', '2004-06-03 18:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(749232, 80335, 20235, '<td valign="top">I love the colors and contrast in this photo. The detail and subtle border is also excellent. The dark area dominating the composition is a little much for my tast, but still a great shot ..... 8</td>', 'I love the colors and contrast in this photo. The detail and subtle border is also excellent. The dark area dominating the composition is a little much for my tast, but still a great shot ..... 8', '2004-06-03 18:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(749236, 80308, 20235, '<td valign="top">Beautiful DOF and focus. The lighting works so well here too. .... 7</td>', 'Beautiful DOF and focus. The lighting works so well here too. .... 7', '2004-06-03 18:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(749238, 80133, 20235, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of "threes" within this photo which makes it really interesting to look at. The framed pillars, the people, and the layers . Nice work.</td>', 'There''s a lot of "threes" within this photo which makes it really interesting to look at. The framed pillars, the people, and the layers . Nice work.', '2004-06-03 18:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(749243, 80121, 21724, '<td valign="top">i''m surprised this hasn''t been offered up as a DQ.. I''d love to know how you achieved these effects :)  great job, very graceful and elegant</td>', 'i''m surprised this hasn''t been offered up as a DQ.. I''d love to know how you achieved these effects :)  great job, very graceful and elegant', '2004-06-03 18:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(749244, 80174, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great focus and detail. The composition and contrast of the cat is splendid... 8</td>', 'Great focus and detail. The composition and contrast of the cat is splendid... 8', '2004-06-03 18:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(749247, 79720, 20235, '<td valign="top">Wow. I love the colors and level of saturation here. The distortion adds a nice effect too.... 8</td>', 'Wow. I love the colors and level of saturation here. The distortion adds a nice effect too.... 8', '2004-06-03 18:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(749252, 80247, 16106, '<td valign="top">a bit dark, but an interesting composition.</td>', 'a bit dark, but an interesting composition.', '2004-06-03 18:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(749255, 79346, 16106, '<td valign="top">great shot but looks oversaturated on my monitor.</td>', 'great shot but looks oversaturated on my monitor.', '2004-06-03 19:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(749262, 79322, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great composition and texture. The detail in this shot is superb.... 8</td>', 'Great composition and texture. The detail in this shot is superb.... 8', '2004-06-03 19:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(749263, 79892, 22140, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I connect the title: is this a reference to ''there but for fortune'' a.k.a. ''there but for the grace of god go I''?<br/>Otherwise nice shot - would have cropped the walking people out...but they do make another three, if that''s what you intended.</td>', 'I''m not sure I connect the title: is this a reference to ''there but for fortune'' a.k.a. ''there but for the grace of god go I''?Otherwise nice shot - would have cropped the walking people out...but they do make another three, if that''s what you intended.', '2004-06-03 19:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(749267, 80335, 22140, '<td valign="top">Lovely flowers - a big overexposed on the big one.</td>', 'Lovely flowers - a big overexposed on the big one.', '2004-06-03 19:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(749268, 79665, 20235, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo. The detail, composition, and contrast is excellent. I really like the black background and the fragility the shot implies. Nice work ..... 8</td>', 'Very nice photo. The detail, composition, and contrast is excellent. I really like the black background and the fragility the shot implies. Nice work ..... 8', '2004-06-03 19:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(749269, 79448, 22140, '<td valign="top">wow.</td>', 'wow.', '2004-06-03 19:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(749271, 79784, 22140, '<td valign="top">OK, how is it that so many DPCers live near motorcycle ralleys?</td>', 'OK, how is it that so many DPCers live near motorcycle ralleys?', '2004-06-03 19:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(749278, 79791, 15920, '<td valign="top">I don''t know quite how to fix this, but the haze cuts color and clarity on the hills and hurts this score wise.  On the other upside, i like the use of near branches to provide some depth.  I have a great picture of the Sydney opera house using this technique.</td>', 'I don''t know quite how to fix this, but the haze cuts color and clarity on the hills and hurts this score wise.  On the other upside, i like the use of near branches to provide some depth.  I have a great picture of the Sydney opera house using this technique.', '2004-06-03 19:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(749280, 79302, 15920, '<td valign="top">This needs more sharpness.  And, the grain is a little rough (which might mean that it is over sharpened during post processing.)  I would try improving the focus, and using a little more light to reduce the exposure time, thus reducing camera shake.</td>', 'This needs more sharpness.  And, the grain is a little rough (which might mean that it is over sharpened during post processing.)  I would try improving the focus, and using a little more light to reduce the exposure time, thus reducing camera shake.', '2004-06-03 19:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(749282, 80368, 15920, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, but the subject needs sharper focus.</td>', 'Good DOF, but the subject needs sharper focus.', '2004-06-03 19:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(749287, 79637, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a hard photo to take.  The clouds give everything a grey cast, and that hurts the picture a bit.  Somehow, if you could get the colors to punch a little, the contrast to the threatening clouds would be great.</td>', 'This is a hard photo to take.  The clouds give everything a grey cast, and that hurts the picture a bit.  Somehow, if you could get the colors to punch a little, the contrast to the threatening clouds would be great.', '2004-06-03 19:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(749315, 79611, 18080, '<td valign="top">3?<br/>Ah, stars, wheels.<br/>Good luck</td>', '3?Ah, stars, wheels.Good luck', '2004-06-03 20:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(749317, 79720, 18080, '<td valign="top">The very best of the flower shots.<br/>9<br/>clean crisp, well composed image<br/> <br/>edit, the more i look at this, the more i like it.<br/>Bumped for 9 to a BIG 10<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'The very best of the flower shots.9clean crisp, well composed image edit, the more i look at this, the more i like it.Bumped for 9 to a BIG 10 Good luck.', '2004-06-03 20:02:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(749342, 79576, 22583, '<td valign="top">Evokes the sentimentality often associated with ballet.  The petals not on the flowers were a very nice touch.  The bright spot in the upper left corner is distracting--to harsh for the picture.  Love how the stems carry your eye to the flowers.</td>', 'Evokes the sentimentality often associated with ballet.  The petals not on the flowers were a very nice touch.  The bright spot in the upper left corner is distracting--to harsh for the picture.  Love how the stems carry your eye to the flowers.', '2004-06-03 20:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(749354, 79637, 20673, '<td valign="top">Looks like Kansas! Nice shot!</td>', 'Looks like Kansas! Nice shot!', '2004-06-03 20:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(749360, 80381, 11793, '<td valign="top">seems to be lacking drama.<br/> <br/></td>', 'seems to be lacking drama. ', '2004-06-03 20:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(749389, 79185, 20662, '<td valign="top">Wish the dark point on the leaf wasn''t so distracting. Maybe you could have moved it onto the sunlight more before taking the shot.</td>', 'Wish the dark point on the leaf wasn''t so distracting. Maybe you could have moved it onto the sunlight more before taking the shot.', '2004-06-03 21:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(749392, 80121, 20662, '<td valign="top">I love how delicate this is -- very nice</td>', 'I love how delicate this is -- very nice', '2004-06-03 21:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(749394, 80335, 20662, '<td valign="top">Love the pale pik against the darker green -- nice contrast</td>', 'Love the pale pik against the darker green -- nice contrast', '2004-06-03 21:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(749396, 80340, 20662, '<td valign="top">beautiful colors</td>', 'beautiful colors', '2004-06-03 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(749398, 80390, 11846, '<td valign="top">nice green and yellow border to "bounce" up the colors....</td>', 'nice green and yellow border to "bounce" up the colors....', '2004-06-03 21:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(749399, 80312, 20662, '<td valign="top">could have gone without the flower in the center -- it distracts from the clovers</td>', 'could have gone without the flower in the center -- it distracts from the clovers', '2004-06-03 21:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(749416, 79455, 12253, '<td valign="top">The dynamic range here is a bit overwhelming--there are not large areas but my guess is the highlights are overexposed. Because of the exposure issue, the scene doesn''t stand well on its own, IMHO.  The three rocks (I am guessing that''s what you mean) aren''t a strong subject as composed here either.  I think if you had shot the other way, into the shade, and perhaps from a low perspective making the rocks more significant, it would have worked better for me.</td>', 'The dynamic range here is a bit overwhelming--there are not large areas but my guess is the highlights are overexposed. Because of the exposure issue, the scene doesn''t stand well on its own, IMHO.  The three rocks (I am guessing that''s what you mean) aren''t a strong subject as composed here either.  I think if you had shot the other way, into the shade, and perhaps from a low perspective making the rocks more significant, it would have worked better for me.', '2004-06-03 22:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(749419, 79401, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptionally well done macro.  You picked the perfect background - supportive without drawing any attention.  There''s nothing I would suggest to improve on this one.</td>', 'Exceptionally well done macro.  You picked the perfect background - supportive without drawing any attention.  There''s nothing I would suggest to improve on this one.', '2004-06-03 22:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(749422, 79963, 12253, '<td valign="top">Good idea and motion capture.  I think the fully fallen dominos, while part of the story, are a visual distraction here.  the blacks are so black, to me, they blend together and make a mass.  I think a bit brighter background, and perhaps if you could have captured fewer dominos, starting with the fifth from the left, it would have been stronger for me.</td>', 'Good idea and motion capture.  I think the fully fallen dominos, while part of the story, are a visual distraction here.  the blacks are so black, to me, they blend together and make a mass.  I think a bit brighter background, and perhaps if you could have captured fewer dominos, starting with the fifth from the left, it would have been stronger for me.', '2004-06-03 22:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(749423, 79755, 12253, '<td valign="top">I bet there were more!  Anyway, nice image, good perspective, good action too.  Nice colors and smoke!</td>', 'I bet there were more!  Anyway, nice image, good perspective, good action too.  Nice colors and smoke!', '2004-06-03 22:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(749424, 79322, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very graphic and full of interest.  It doesn''t seem real somehow, but still keeps your attention.  Your border adds nothing for me.</td>', 'Very graphic and full of interest.  It doesn''t seem real somehow, but still keeps your attention.  Your border adds nothing for me.', '2004-06-03 22:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(749427, 80108, 12253, '<td valign="top">Oops--2 and 1/2 flowers?   The composition here is a bit unusual.  Other than the "three" theme, this would be a much better photo if you cropped off the right 1/2 flower.    Covering that with my hand, it''s a strong two-along-the diagonal comp.</td>', 'Oops--2 and 1/2 flowers?   The composition here is a bit unusual.  Other than the "three" theme, this would be a much better photo if you cropped off the right 1/2 flower.    Covering that with my hand, it''s a strong two-along-the diagonal comp.', '2004-06-03 22:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(749434, 79448, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s a wonderful composition that makes you wander around the drops.  The unusual color makes it very unique.  I know it''s really tough with macro to get much DoF, but that closest diagonal line needs to be crisp.  Too bad you didn''t have a lens that would stop down to f64!  Exposure is spot on.  Overall - an excellent job!</td>', 'It''s a wonderful composition that makes you wander around the drops.  The unusual color makes it very unique.  I know it''s really tough with macro to get much DoF, but that closest diagonal line needs to be crisp.  Too bad you didn''t have a lens that would stop down to f64!  Exposure is spot on.  Overall - an excellent job!', '2004-06-03 22:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(749441, 79032, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of high-key techniques to make those already-vibrant colors really sing!  Perfect exposure, great composition.  The only thing I would do with this if it were mine (drool) - would be remove the border.</td>', 'Wonderful use of high-key techniques to make those already-vibrant colors really sing!  Perfect exposure, great composition.  The only thing I would do with this if it were mine (drool) - would be remove the border.', '2004-06-03 22:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(749446, 80121, 19608, '<td valign="top">A work of art.  Reminds me of a hand-tinted B&amp;W print.  Great positioning of the models - the unusual perspective adds a lot of interest.  The only thing that doesn''t quite work is the strong vertical line that merges with the middle model''s right shoulder.  YOu could not have picked better colors for this.</td>', 'A work of art.  Reminds me of a hand-tinted B&W print.  Great positioning of the models - the unusual perspective adds a lot of interest.  The only thing that doesn''t quite work is the strong vertical line that merges with the middle model''s right shoulder.  YOu could not have picked better colors for this.', '2004-06-03 22:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(749450, 79092, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very simple yet effective study of textures.    May be a bit more dramatic if the composition was more on the diagonal.  Better lighting - right close to sundown would relly make it pop.  Overall an excellent job!</td>', 'Very simple yet effective study of textures.    May be a bit more dramatic if the composition was more on the diagonal.  Better lighting - right close to sundown would relly make it pop.  Overall an excellent job!', '2004-06-03 22:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(749455, 80321, 19608, '<td valign="top">This image has a ghood feel to it, rather dreamy.  The onlt thing that bothers me is the very bright background competeing for attention.</td>', 'This image has a ghood feel to it, rather dreamy.  The onlt thing that bothers me is the very bright background competeing for attention.', '2004-06-03 22:25:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(749466, 79588, 19608, '<td valign="top">A stunning graphic design with excellent colors.  This should be one that no one comments that there''s no 3''s!  It''s also an optical illusion for me - sometimes the "point" seems to recede; other times it seems to be the closest to me.  Great job.</td>', 'A stunning graphic design with excellent colors.  This should be one that no one comments that there''s no 3''s!  It''s also an optical illusion for me - sometimes the "point" seems to recede; other times it seems to be the closest to me.  Great job.', '2004-06-03 22:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(749470, 80242, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very cute little critters - they don''t look very old.  Nice exposure but composition is very busy.</td>', 'Very cute little critters - they don''t look very old.  Nice exposure but composition is very busy.', '2004-06-03 22:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(749478, 80401, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nothing beats a gorgeous sunset on the beach.  The birds'' silhouettes are wonderful as are the shadows and textures in the sand.  The only thing I''d like to do is move the sun out of the center.    Actually, I just moved it on the screen so the top is just below the actual sun - and it works very well that way. Overall - it''s still a very strong contender, but in this challenge with so MANY great ones, it''s going to be tough to get to the top.</td>', 'Nothing beats a gorgeous sunset on the beach.  The birds'' silhouettes are wonderful as are the shadows and textures in the sand.  The only thing I''d like to do is move the sun out of the center.    Actually, I just moved it on the screen so the top is just below the actual sun - and it works very well that way. Overall - it''s still a very strong contender, but in this challenge with so MANY great ones, it''s going to be tough to get to the top.', '2004-06-03 22:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(749484, 79759, 12674, '<td valign="top">Cooperative models....nice shot!</td>', 'Cooperative models....nice shot!', '2004-06-03 22:39:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(749488, 80313, 12674, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...beautiful...beautiful....perfect lighting and rich greens. 10</td>', 'Beautiful...beautiful...beautiful....perfect lighting and rich greens. 10', '2004-06-03 22:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(749506, 78955, 509, '<td valign="top">Well executed, just a tad soft focus on the pecan in the foreground.  Those things are delicious = )</td>', 'Well executed, just a tad soft focus on the pecan in the foreground.  Those things are delicious = )', '2004-06-03 22:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(749510, 79759, 509, '<td valign="top">I think I''d prefer this with a slightly darker exposure or increased contrast.  Having a shallower depth of field might work well too, to throw the second two slightly out of focus.  Another suggestion would be a different crop, showing either all of the first horse or less of all three.  That said, I like the subject and the symmetry in the position of the horses'' heads</td>', 'I think I''d prefer this with a slightly darker exposure or increased contrast.  Having a shallower depth of field might work well too, to throw the second two slightly out of focus.  Another suggestion would be a different crop, showing either all of the first horse or less of all three.  That said, I like the subject and the symmetry in the position of the horses'' heads', '2004-06-03 23:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(749511, 80403, 509, '<td valign="top">The lighting works nicely here.  Blue contrasts well with the red as well.  Nice job.</td>', 'The lighting works nicely here.  Blue contrasts well with the red as well.  Nice job.', '2004-06-03 23:03:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(749518, 80174, 509, '<td valign="top">The eyes of that cat really make this!  Nice composition and focus as well.</td>', 'The eyes of that cat really make this!  Nice composition and focus as well.', '2004-06-03 23:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(749533, 80243, 509, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit low for this type of shot.  I think a closer crop of the clocks, maybe less organized in position, might work well.  I''m not too fond of the backdrop (checkered floor).  The reflections on the top are prevalent and the black squares detract from your main subject.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit low for this type of shot.  I think a closer crop of the clocks, maybe less organized in position, might work well.  I''m not too fond of the backdrop (checkered floor).  The reflections on the top are prevalent and the black squares detract from your main subject.', '2004-06-03 23:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(749534, 80333, 509, '<td valign="top">Very well done.  Can''t think of anything I would change.</td>', 'Very well done.  Can''t think of anything I would change.', '2004-06-03 23:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(749536, 80204, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and exposure.  There seems to be a lot of compression - the image is ony a third of what is allowed (150 kb).  That said, the centerring is a little off and I would have cropped the dark patch of background in the lower left.  Otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'Nice subject and exposure.  There seems to be a lot of compression - the image is ony a third of what is allowed (150 kb).  That said, the centerring is a little off and I would have cropped the dark patch of background in the lower left.  Otherwise a nice shot.', '2004-06-03 23:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(749538, 80262, 19608, '<td valign="top">A perfect threesome.  Hope you got o see them throughout the process.  Great exposure.  Composition fine - except the leaft part in the bottom right corner.  Depth of field handled very well.</td>', 'A perfect threesome.  Hope you got o see them throughout the process.  Great exposure.  Composition fine - except the leaft part in the bottom right corner.  Depth of field handled very well.', '2004-06-03 23:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(749539, 79455, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting find.  Unfortunately the sun was a little harsh that day (bright foliage in the background).  A different time of day might help alleviate that problem.  I was out in the woods today and had the same problem with shadows and highlites.  The subject and framing are both good, but the exposure is a significant detraction.</td>', 'Interesting find.  Unfortunately the sun was a little harsh that day (bright foliage in the background).  A different time of day might help alleviate that problem.  I was out in the woods today and had the same problem with shadows and highlites.  The subject and framing are both good, but the exposure is a significant detraction.', '2004-06-03 23:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(749540, 79787, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s original and works well in the high-key setting.  Catchy title!   Look at it with any border, I suspect you''ll find it doesn''t need one.</td>', 'It''s original and works well in the high-key setting.  Catchy title!   Look at it with any border, I suspect you''ll find it doesn''t need one.', '2004-06-03 23:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(749541, 80263, 509, '<td valign="top">Strangely, this showed up for me immediately after the other image of the same name = P<br/>Nice use of desaturation to make the stop signs dominant.  I like the textures as well.</td>', 'Strangely, this showed up for me immediately after the other image of the same name = PNice use of desaturation to make the stop signs dominant.  I like the textures as well.', '2004-06-03 23:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(749544, 79090, 509, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot = )  Slight color variation in the background, but nothing too serious. -9-</td>', 'Awesome shot = )  Slight color variation in the background, but nothing too serious. -9-', '2004-06-03 23:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(749545, 79665, 19608, '<td valign="top">Exceptional!  That black background makes the seeds really sparkle.  Your exposure is perfect.  I''d like to see it just a tiny bit more diagonal, but that is a very minor point.  You stopped down enough to make the entire image sharp as a tack.  Overall a very strong contender.</td>', 'Exceptional!  That black background makes the seeds really sparkle.  Your exposure is perfect.  I''d like to see it just a tiny bit more diagonal, but that is a very minor point.  You stopped down enough to make the entire image sharp as a tack.  Overall a very strong contender.', '2004-06-03 23:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(749548, 79448, 509, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  I''m predicting a ribbon.  I''d like to see this cropped differently, just to see what other views could be had.  Great subject. -10-</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  I''m predicting a ribbon.  I''d like to see this cropped differently, just to see what other views could be had.  Great subject. -10-', '2004-06-03 23:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(749549, 80387, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of pears - the curled stem on the right adds personality to this.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice choice of pears - the curled stem on the right adds personality to this.  Well done.', '2004-06-03 23:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(749551, 80191, 509, '<td valign="top">Lighting doesn''t look ideal, but I think cloning out some of the specks in the water would make it a little more appealing.</td>', 'Lighting doesn''t look ideal, but I think cloning out some of the specks in the water would make it a little more appealing.', '2004-06-03 23:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(749552, 79756, 509, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Don''t see too many night views of hot air balloons.  The border works here, but a little thinner red line might be better.  Nice capture</td>', 'Very nice.  Don''t see too many night views of hot air balloons.  The border works here, but a little thinner red line might be better.  Nice capture', '2004-06-03 23:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(749553, 80238, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the off-center framing, as well as the twisting car tracks.  Looks a little oversharpened, but still a really nice shot.</td>', 'I like the off-center framing, as well as the twisting car tracks.  Looks a little oversharpened, but still a really nice shot.', '2004-06-03 23:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(749557, 79831, 509, '<td valign="top">Lens zooming during the exposure or post processing?  It adds an interesting effect - not sure if it fits the subject, but I think I would prefer this shot with the effect, rather than without.</td>', 'Lens zooming during the exposure or post processing?  It adds an interesting effect - not sure if it fits the subject, but I think I would prefer this shot with the effect, rather than without.', '2004-06-03 23:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(749559, 80340, 509, '<td valign="top">The border detracts from this imho.  Looks like there are 4 sails, but I''m not gonna be picky ; )</td>', 'The border detracts from this imho.  Looks like there are 4 sails, but I''m not gonna be picky ; )', '2004-06-03 23:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(749584, 80193, 4267, '<td valign="top">yes there''s three horses.. but the one single horse is the main subject and takes away from the challenge.. even the title speaks to just one horse</td>', 'yes there''s three horses.. but the one single horse is the main subject and takes away from the challenge.. even the title speaks to just one horse', '2004-06-04 00:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(749588, 80189, 4267, '<td valign="top">the 3 is not really the main subject of your shot... I''d say attention goes to the engines face...</td>', 'the 3 is not really the main subject of your shot... I''d say attention goes to the engines face...', '2004-06-04 00:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(749590, 80147, 4267, '<td valign="top">the processing is what makes this shot.. nice work</td>', 'the processing is what makes this shot.. nice work', '2004-06-04 00:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
