(749949, 80215, 2780, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W works really well here, and you''ve done a great job with the lighting. 8</td>', 'B&W works really well here, and you''ve done a great job with the lighting. 8', '2004-06-04 08:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(749950, 80188, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great use of the shadows and abstract quality.  The colors work great together.  I gotta get to the desert again!  Great work</td>', 'Great use of the shadows and abstract quality.  The colors work great together.  I gotta get to the desert again!  Great work', '2004-06-04 08:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(749951, 80264, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like the patterns from the smoke :)</td>', 'I really like the patterns from the smoke :)', '2004-06-04 08:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(749952, 79084, 2780, '<td valign="top">Eek, it takes me longer than that to download the photos from my camera :S</td>', 'Eek, it takes me longer than that to download the photos from my camera :S', '2004-06-04 08:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(749954, 80121, 6771, '<td valign="top">Very dreamy looking apearance.  It has been said to you a million times already, so I will forget the "looks like..." comment.   Like the colors and blur. The editing takes a little away from the "real" photo, but still an 8.</td>', 'Very dreamy looking apearance.  It has been said to you a million times already, so I will forget the "looks like..." comment.   Like the colors and blur. The editing takes a little away from the "real" photo, but still an 8.', '2004-06-04 08:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(749955, 79575, 6771, '<td valign="top">Great colors and background.  the right leaf is a touch less in focus than the rest, and the eye is drawn more to it because it is brighter.  Nice work.  8</td>', 'Great colors and background.  the right leaf is a touch less in focus than the rest, and the eye is drawn more to it because it is brighter.  Nice work.  8', '2004-06-04 08:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(749957, 80371, 6771, '<td valign="top">yep three are there. makes me hungry.  the exsposure is off.  too bright in some areas, dark on others.  Focus is a little shallow...needs to be on the subject.  Seems to be on the grill.</td>', 'yep three are there. makes me hungry.  the exsposure is off.  too bright in some areas, dark on others.  Focus is a little shallow...needs to be on the subject.  Seems to be on the grill.', '2004-06-04 08:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(749959, 79101, 6771, '<td valign="top">I can''t find the 3 reference, no matter how long I look.  These are interesting.  Like to see a closer shot, maybe at a little different angle to catch more shadows.</td>', 'I can''t find the 3 reference, no matter how long I look.  These are interesting.  Like to see a closer shot, maybe at a little different angle to catch more shadows.', '2004-06-04 08:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(749960, 79963, 22368, '<td valign="top">really nice!!!</td>', 'really nice!!!', '2004-06-04 08:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(749961, 80072, 6771, '<td valign="top">See the dog with a three.  Blurry, but does indicate speed.  Looks like a photo finish picture.  Not too interesting, sorry</td>', 'See the dog with a three.  Blurry, but does indicate speed.  Looks like a photo finish picture.  Not too interesting, sorry', '2004-06-04 08:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(749966, 80133, 6771, '<td valign="top">Price of Freedom was...3?  Can''t distinguish what this has to do with 3. 3 people in the foreground?  4 sets of 3 pillars?  8 sets of 3 fountains?  I do like this as a photo.  Has great symmetry in the background, and some people interest in the foreground.  Can''t tell if the horizon line is truly off, but seems to go uphill a bit toward the right</td>', 'Price of Freedom was...3?  Can''t distinguish what this has to do with 3. 3 people in the foreground?  4 sets of 3 pillars?  8 sets of 3 fountains?  I do like this as a photo.  Has great symmetry in the background, and some people interest in the foreground.  Can''t tell if the horizon line is truly off, but seems to go uphill a bit toward the right', '2004-06-04 08:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(749973, 79839, 17551, '<td valign="top">I like the composition</td>', 'I like the composition', '2004-06-04 08:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(749975, 80072, 17551, '<td valign="top">I guess its hard to use fast shutter speed with low light, I think the motion blur works kinda well</td>', 'I guess its hard to use fast shutter speed with low light, I think the motion blur works kinda well', '2004-06-04 08:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(749978, 80183, 17551, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, its interesting to look at, but the top two pigeons need to be in focus IMHO</td>', 'I like the shot, its interesting to look at, but the top two pigeons need to be in focus IMHO', '2004-06-04 08:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(749990, 80396, 17551, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot, i love the smooth fade on the hands</td>', 'beautiful shot, i love the smooth fade on the hands', '2004-06-04 09:06:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(749991, 79755, 17551, '<td valign="top">great shot, makes me feel like I''m part of the action</td>', 'great shot, makes me feel like I''m part of the action', '2004-06-04 09:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(749992, 80265, 17551, '<td valign="top">good quality, i like the smoke swirls</td>', 'good quality, i like the smoke swirls', '2004-06-04 09:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(749993, 80318, 17551, '<td valign="top">The amount of handguns available in other countries always astonishes me. Nice shot, good contrast. 8</td>', 'The amount of handguns available in other countries always astonishes me. Nice shot, good contrast. 8', '2004-06-04 09:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(750018, 80224, 806, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image of a tug boat at sunset. Love the little sun light on the clouds and on the boat. The water spray is great, and fits the challenge nicely.</td>', 'This is an interesting image of a tug boat at sunset. Love the little sun light on the clouds and on the boat. The water spray is great, and fits the challenge nicely.', '2004-06-04 09:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(750020, 80188, 806, '<td valign="top">the solitude, the simplicity. the direction/angle of the shadows. this is an overall peaceful image, that becomes almost abstract. nicely done.</td>', 'the solitude, the simplicity. the direction/angle of the shadows. this is an overall peaceful image, that becomes almost abstract. nicely done.', '2004-06-04 10:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(750022, 80265, 806, '<td valign="top">clear, nice focus - rich in detail, interesting composition. perfect catch of the smoke swirl.</td>', 'clear, nice focus - rich in detail, interesting composition. perfect catch of the smoke swirl.', '2004-06-04 10:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(750036, 80386, 806, '<td valign="top">great composition. nice action, colors. a bit over sharpened? I really like this image. pulls me right into the moment.</td>', 'great composition. nice action, colors. a bit over sharpened? I really like this image. pulls me right into the moment.', '2004-06-04 10:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(750037, 80321, 806, '<td valign="top">they are so soft, they almost look like frosting flowers on a cake. the texture is so defined, they "feel" like paper to me.<br/>wonderful use of DOF to isolate them.</td>', 'they are so soft, they almost look like frosting flowers on a cake. the texture is so defined, they "feel" like paper to me.wonderful use of DOF to isolate them.', '2004-06-04 10:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(750043, 79620, 12857, '<td valign="top">I am so bored with flowers, but you did it right.  I like the long stems.  Most people are  close up and focus on the bloom.  I like that you focused on the plant.  Great job....</td>', 'I am so bored with flowers, but you did it right.  I like the long stems.  Most people are  close up and focus on the bloom.  I like that you focused on the plant.  Great job....', '2004-06-04 10:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(750057, 80005, 12802, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good colours etc, makes it nice and happy looking.  Maybe a deeper depth of focus?</td>', 'Nice shot, good colours etc, makes it nice and happy looking.  Maybe a deeper depth of focus?', '2004-06-04 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(750060, 79892, 12802, '<td valign="top">Good shot, great fof the challenge too.<br/> <br/>Might have been better cropped more though to just see the three benches and maybe waited until the two folk in the bacground had passed?  My attention was initially drawn top them, when it should have gone to the guy on the bench.</td>', 'Good shot, great fof the challenge too. Might have been better cropped more though to just see the three benches and maybe waited until the two folk in the bacground had passed?  My attention was initially drawn top them, when it should have gone to the guy on the bench.', '2004-06-04 10:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(750067, 80396, 806, '<td valign="top">how fun! nicely done too. great exposure to not wash out the brights, and good capture of the colors.</td>', 'how fun! nicely done too. great exposure to not wash out the brights, and good capture of the colors.', '2004-06-04 11:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(750068, 80321, 12802, '<td valign="top">Great idea, meets the challenge.  A little too soft for me though.  I think the bright white background ''hurts'' a little on the eyes.</td>', 'Great idea, meets the challenge.  A little too soft for me though.  I think the bright white background ''hurts'' a little on the eyes.', '2004-06-04 11:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(750069, 80052, 806, '<td valign="top">clear intersesting/peaceful image to view. :)</td>', 'clear intersesting/peaceful image to view. :)', '2004-06-04 11:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(750073, 79092, 12802, '<td valign="top">Looked at this shot loads of times, took ages to work out if you had done something to make the footprints 3D...  I really like this shot, great idea for the challenge, well done!</td>', 'Looked at this shot loads of times, took ages to work out if you had done something to make the footprints 3D...  I really like this shot, great idea for the challenge, well done!', '2004-06-04 11:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(750075, 79756, 806, '<td valign="top">very interesting image in that the colors are so pronounced/vivid against the darkness. must have been quite a display!<br/>fun!</td>', 'very interesting image in that the colors are so pronounced/vivid against the darkness. must have been quite a display!fun!', '2004-06-04 11:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(750076, 79740, 806, '<td valign="top">neat spin on this kind of subject matter. like the arrangement.</td>', 'neat spin on this kind of subject matter. like the arrangement.', '2004-06-04 11:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(750078, 80340, 806, '<td valign="top">beautful colors. the sails seem to be pointing to the sunset. good exposure.</td>', 'beautful colors. the sails seem to be pointing to the sunset. good exposure.', '2004-06-04 11:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(750080, 79831, 806, '<td valign="top">what motion! cool reflections, composition, and effect.</td>', 'what motion! cool reflections, composition, and effect.', '2004-06-04 11:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(750081, 80264, 806, '<td valign="top">great swirl action. interesting colors. becomes abstract.</td>', 'great swirl action. interesting colors. becomes abstract.', '2004-06-04 11:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(750082, 79740, 20091, '<td valign="top">Simple subject but still a great photograph</td>', 'Simple subject but still a great photograph', '2004-06-04 11:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(750083, 80387, 806, '<td valign="top">interesting use of negative space. I wonder if they are too far down still. I think the thin greenish-yellow border bothers me so close to the pears. Still, the lighting and overall feel of the image is good.<br/>Like how the last pear has a stem pointing back to the first two. draws the eye back to start over again.</td>', 'interesting use of negative space. I wonder if they are too far down still. I think the thin greenish-yellow border bothers me so close to the pears. Still, the lighting and overall feel of the image is good.Like how the last pear has a stem pointing back to the first two. draws the eye back to start over again.', '2004-06-04 11:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(750089, 80122, 806, '<td valign="top">terrific tones. the tumultuous clouds in b&amp;w add to the windy feeling needed to make this image tie together. nice angle to "place" the windmills where you need them to be to pull the eye into the photo, and to form a nice triangle.</td>', 'terrific tones. the tumultuous clouds in b&w add to the windy feeling needed to make this image tie together. nice angle to "place" the windmills where you need them to be to pull the eye into the photo, and to form a nice triangle.', '2004-06-04 11:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(750101, 79513, 806, '<td valign="top">clean, well done image. has great (I think anyway) potential for stock. one egg leans away... makes it more dynamic.</td>', 'clean, well done image. has great (I think anyway) potential for stock. one egg leans away... makes it more dynamic.', '2004-06-04 11:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(750107, 79720, 6870, '<td valign="top">Bright, clear cheery--everything a photo of daisies should be! I like the use of the wide angle lens here. 9</td>', 'Bright, clear cheery--everything a photo of daisies should be! I like the use of the wide angle lens here. 9', '2004-06-04 11:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(750110, 80323, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun, tight dof here. Nice and sharp. Interesting photo, too. I have one not too unlike this a few challenges ago. Good luck. 9</td>', 'Fun, tight dof here. Nice and sharp. Interesting photo, too. I have one not too unlike this a few challenges ago. Good luck. 9', '2004-06-04 11:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(750111, 80274, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very fun contrasts of textures and tones. 9</td>', 'Very fun contrasts of textures and tones. 9', '2004-06-04 11:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(750115, 80214, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really pretty. Your composition is very effective and works well. Lighting and exposure seem very effective. Have you tried this with a really long exposure to get a misty effect? It might be fun, but t his works for me, too, since I can enjoy the texture and lines of rock and water and how hey interplay and contrast. The white spot at bottom right directs my attention there a bit too much perhaps, but still a nice shot of something simple, yet interesting. 9</td>', 'Really pretty. Your composition is very effective and works well. Lighting and exposure seem very effective. Have you tried this with a really long exposure to get a misty effect? It might be fun, but t his works for me, too, since I can enjoy the texture and lines of rock and water and how hey interplay and contrast. The white spot at bottom right directs my attention there a bit too much perhaps, but still a nice shot of something simple, yet interesting. 9', '2004-06-04 11:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(750117, 79548, 806, '<td valign="top">wonderful DOF creating an ethereal effect. the detail in the seedlings is wonderful. makes me want to fly away with them. :)</td>', 'wonderful DOF creating an ethereal effect. the detail in the seedlings is wonderful. makes me want to fly away with them. :)', '2004-06-04 11:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(750120, 79548, 6870, '<td valign="top">Everyone has to have at least one dandelion in their portfolio! This one is so nice; effective dof and clarity. Two of the ''fairies'' are just ever so slightly out of focus, but it hardly matters. Nice work. 9</td>', 'Everyone has to have at least one dandelion in their portfolio! This one is so nice; effective dof and clarity. Two of the ''fairies'' are just ever so slightly out of focus, but it hardly matters. Nice work. 9', '2004-06-04 11:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(750121, 80333, 806, '<td valign="top">nice angle/viewpoint. a bit of blue in the basket goes well with the red and white. I like how the background isn''t screaming white so that the basket stands out better. interesting crop too.</td>', 'nice angle/viewpoint. a bit of blue in the basket goes well with the red and white. I like how the background isn''t screaming white so that the basket stands out better. interesting crop too.', '2004-06-04 11:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(750123, 80262, 806, '<td valign="top">wonderful angle, interesting crop. beautifully done :)</td>', 'wonderful angle, interesting crop. beautifully done :)', '2004-06-04 11:38:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(750182, 79889, 13381, '<td valign="top">Aww, these are adorable.  The weathered red barn makes a great backdrop.</td>', 'Aww, these are adorable.  The weathered red barn makes a great backdrop.', '2004-06-04 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(750187, 79588, 13381, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a nice shot.  I love the sense of perspective, and you''ve worked threes into every aspect of the challenge, which is pretty cool. I dig this a lot -- very creative.</td>', 'Wow, what a nice shot.  I love the sense of perspective, and you''ve worked threes into every aspect of the challenge, which is pretty cool. I dig this a lot -- very creative.', '2004-06-04 12:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(750194, 79826, 13381, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on the lower daisy, and the blue is nicely contrasted against the white.  I''d like to see how this photo looks with a colored backdrop, so that the petals of the daisies stand more against the background. Maybe a rich red backdrop, with white and yellow daisies and a light blue vase!</td>', 'I like the lighting on the lower daisy, and the blue is nicely contrasted against the white.  I''d like to see how this photo looks with a colored backdrop, so that the petals of the daisies stand more against the background. Maybe a rich red backdrop, with white and yellow daisies and a light blue vase!', '2004-06-04 12:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(750197, 79720, 13381, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, and lovely sharpness to this shot.  This would be one of the better daisy shots in this challenge, I think.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, and lovely sharpness to this shot.  This would be one of the better daisy shots in this challenge, I think.', '2004-06-04 12:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(750211, 79389, 13381, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting, and a lovely backdrop.  I like this very much.</td>', 'Perfect lighting, and a lovely backdrop.  I like this very much.', '2004-06-04 12:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(750214, 80253, 13381, '<td valign="top">lovely macro -- very sharp.</td>', 'lovely macro -- very sharp.', '2004-06-04 12:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(750218, 80319, 13381, '<td valign="top">Fabulous macro.</td>', 'Fabulous macro.', '2004-06-04 12:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(750234, 80274, 13381, '<td valign="top">Beautiful macro -- it accentuates the texture of the feathers.</td>', 'Beautiful macro -- it accentuates the texture of the feathers.', '2004-06-04 12:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(750247, 79466, 13381, '<td valign="top">beautiful color contrast and sharpness.</td>', 'beautiful color contrast and sharpness.', '2004-06-04 13:10:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(750277, 80360, 11248, '<td valign="top">Would be much more interresting if sharpness was there.</td>', 'Would be much more interresting if sharpness was there.', '2004-06-04 13:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(750299, 79665, 9668, '<td valign="top">I love this shot. Really stands out. Great composition, nice macro. Seems a tad bitmapped.</td>', 'I love this shot. Really stands out. Great composition, nice macro. Seems a tad bitmapped.', '2004-06-04 14:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(750303, 80340, 18834, '<td valign="top">nice view<br/></td>', 'nice view', '2004-06-04 14:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(750305, 80400, 18834, '<td valign="top">To much flash.  It''s also out of focus just a bit so try it in macro next time</td>', 'To much flash.  It''s also out of focus just a bit so try it in macro next time', '2004-06-04 14:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(750308, 80398, 18834, '<td valign="top">good idea, but to much shadow.  maybe raising the contrast up a touch.</td>', 'good idea, but to much shadow.  maybe raising the contrast up a touch.', '2004-06-04 14:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(750312, 80360, 18834, '<td valign="top">out of focus, and it probably would have looked more even if you cropped a little off the left</td>', 'out of focus, and it probably would have looked more even if you cropped a little off the left', '2004-06-04 14:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(750313, 79824, 18834, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white, but it looks to dark to me. 6</td>', 'I like the black and white, but it looks to dark to me. 6', '2004-06-04 14:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(750314, 80367, 18834, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but I think you should have cropped off the little bit of red from what was cut off from the sign on the left.</td>', 'Good shot, but I think you should have cropped off the little bit of red from what was cut off from the sign on the left.', '2004-06-04 14:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(750315, 79490, 18834, '<td valign="top">a little out of focus.  5</td>', 'a little out of focus.  5', '2004-06-04 14:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(750317, 80371, 18834, '<td valign="top">looks a little overexposed or a little to contrast happy.</td>', 'looks a little overexposed or a little to contrast happy.', '2004-06-04 14:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(750319, 80025, 18834, '<td valign="top">Good shadowing.  7</td>', 'Good shadowing.  7', '2004-06-04 14:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(750321, 80387, 18834, '<td valign="top">Its a good photo, very clear and great lighting (i could never get it that good), but I really don''t see the point of having all of the excess black space on the top.  I think if you cropped it just above the stems, It would look better, and wouldn''t make it seem so empty.  But no doubt, its a great photo. 8</td>', 'Its a good photo, very clear and great lighting (i could never get it that good), but I really don''t see the point of having all of the excess black space on the top.  I think if you cropped it just above the stems, It would look better, and wouldn''t make it seem so empty.  But no doubt, its a great photo. 8', '2004-06-04 14:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(750322, 79350, 18834, '<td valign="top">Out of focus, and not very even lighting</td>', 'Out of focus, and not very even lighting', '2004-06-04 14:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(750324, 80368, 18834, '<td valign="top">out of focus.  I don''t know if you used macro, or maybe it is just digital zoom</td>', 'out of focus.  I don''t know if you used macro, or maybe it is just digital zoom', '2004-06-04 14:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(750325, 79172, 18834, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2004-06-04 14:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(750326, 80403, 18834, '<td valign="top">Amazing lighting and background.  It goes perfect with the cherries.  Just enough to make it not to dark.  10</td>', 'Amazing lighting and background.  It goes perfect with the cherries.  Just enough to make it not to dark.  10', '2004-06-04 14:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(750329, 80372, 5728, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped off some of the space behind the juggler.</td>', 'I would have cropped off some of the space behind the juggler.', '2004-06-04 14:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(750330, 79665, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, no over-exposed spots at all.</td>', 'Good lighting, no over-exposed spots at all.', '2004-06-04 14:41:51.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(750346, 79109, 22612, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the color and light focusing works on the bland backround</td>', 'I really like the way the color and light focusing works on the bland backround', '2004-06-04 15:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(750370, 79740, 12802, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!!  Really like this!  The colours just jump out at me, I think what you''ve done is brilliant.<br/> <br/>The white balance perfect, the colors look so smooth in the glasses (i.e. no bubbles).  Perfect shot, I can see this doing well!! :-)</td>', 'Very nice!!!  Really like this!  The colours just jump out at me, I think what you''ve done is brilliant. The white balance perfect, the colors look so smooth in the glasses (i.e. no bubbles).  Perfect shot, I can see this doing well!! :-)', '2004-06-04 15:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(750372, 80214, 12802, '<td valign="top">hmmm, i do like this, can see how it meets the challenge, but it takes a bit of looking I think which some folk might not see.<br/> <br/>The reflections in the stone could probably have been removed if you used a circular polariser (Well, that''s if your camera can take one)<br/> <br/>A good long exposure here, shows the water very nicely!</td>', 'hmmm, i do like this, can see how it meets the challenge, but it takes a bit of looking I think which some folk might not see. The reflections in the stone could probably have been removed if you used a circular polariser (Well, that''s if your camera can take one) A good long exposure here, shows the water very nicely!', '2004-06-04 15:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(750384, 80270, 4562, '<td valign="top">nice pic....but.....a lil out of focus,  love the reflection and the stems....5</td>', 'nice pic....but.....a lil out of focus,  love the reflection and the stems....5', '2004-06-04 16:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(750388, 79727, 4562, '<td valign="top">lovely pic!!!....nice detail...7</td>', 'lovely pic!!!....nice detail...7', '2004-06-04 16:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(750391, 78955, 4562, '<td valign="top">nice!!1...love the us of negative space!!!</td>', 'nice!!1...love the us of negative space!!!', '2004-06-04 16:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(750422, 79109, 11897, '<td valign="top">I love this, great clarity, super composition, very clever use of the light.</td>', 'I love this, great clarity, super composition, very clever use of the light.', '2004-06-04 16:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
