(750453, 80007, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - an original threesome.  I like the slightly diagonal composition, but think it feels "crowded."  That could be corrected by not using the basket at all and leaving more room on the sides.  I also think the background would give you more "pop" if it was a brighter white instead of the blotchy magenta.  Thanks for sharing.</td>', 'Nice idea - an original threesome.  I like the slightly diagonal composition, but think it feels "crowded."  That could be corrected by not using the basket at all and leaving more room on the sides.  I also think the background would give you more "pop" if it was a brighter white instead of the blotchy magenta.  Thanks for sharing.', '2004-06-04 17:06:07.000000', NULL, 1),
