(750704, 80407, 20235, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape shot. I like the layers of DOF, colors and textures here. There seems to be a little artifact (maybe dirt on the lens or flying insects) near the top of the third tower. I find it a little distracting but still a nice photo.</td>', 'Nice landscape shot. I like the layers of DOF, colors and textures here. There seems to be a little artifact (maybe dirt on the lens or flying insects) near the top of the third tower. I find it a little distracting but still a nice photo.', '2004-06-04 21:40:05.000000', NULL, 1),
