(750707, 79620, 20235, '<td valign="top">Great photo. I like the color tone here and the reflection of the sky on the water. IMHO I would have liked to see a deeper DOF to bring out more detail on the water''s reflection, but still a nice shot.</td>', 'Great photo. I like the color tone here and the reflection of the sky on the water. IMHO I would have liked to see a deeper DOF to bring out more detail on the water''s reflection, but still a nice shot.', '2004-06-04 21:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
