(750723, 79707, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty tough scene to make interesting in B&amp;W.  I might try color and shooting it in the late afternoon to get the perfect light.</td>', 'This is a pretty tough scene to make interesting in B&W.  I might try color and shooting it in the late afternoon to get the perfect light.', '2004-06-04 21:59:08.000000', NULL, 1),
