(750727, 79172, 15920, '<td valign="top">Good title.  I assumed three legs, but you introduced another "3" dimension with the title.  Without seeing this, I assume you made the right decision not presenting htis in color, but, color might have worked well with all that interesting grain to capture.</td>', 'Good title.  I assumed three legs, but you introduced another "3" dimension with the title.  Without seeing this, I assume you made the right decision not presenting htis in color, but, color might have worked well with all that interesting grain to capture.', '2004-06-04 22:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
