(751225, 79576, 17033, '<td valign="top">Not sure I''m a big fan of ''romantic fantasy'' photos like this. However, I think the set-up could have been improved. All the interesting parts are on the left...on the right you have the rather dark, unattractive stems and the messy ribbons....so I would recommend a tighter composition next time. Also, I now you have fone for the soft focus and grain effects but perhaps the detail wasn''t there in the first place to allow this.....</td>', 'Not sure I''m a big fan of ''romantic fantasy'' photos like this. However, I think the set-up could have been improved. All the interesting parts are on the left...on the right you have the rather dark, unattractive stems and the messy ribbons....so I would recommend a tighter composition next time. Also, I now you have fone for the soft focus and grain effects but perhaps the detail wasn''t there in the first place to allow this.....', '2004-06-05 05:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(751227, 80172, 17033, '<td valign="top">Interesting (Scandinavian?) but not particularly pretty. Lighting a bit harsh?</td>', 'Interesting (Scandinavian?) but not particularly pretty. Lighting a bit harsh?', '2004-06-05 06:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(751228, 79759, 17033, '<td valign="top">Great but perhaps very obviously sharpened</td>', 'Great but perhaps very obviously sharpened', '2004-06-05 06:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(751231, 79322, 17033, '<td valign="top">Really like this ''tryptych''. The oversharpening actually improves it. Perhaps the glass colours could have been strengthened a bit. Well done</td>', 'Really like this ''tryptych''. The oversharpening actually improves it. Perhaps the glass colours could have been strengthened a bit. Well done', '2004-06-05 06:17:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(751232, 80388, 17033, '<td valign="top">Like the simplicity and composition.</td>', 'Like the simplicity and composition.', '2004-06-05 06:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(751233, 80123, 17033, '<td valign="top">Too contrived for my liking.....I don''t wish to sound harsh or mean but I don''t think you''re letting your camera do more than a scanner could. Good luck on the next challenge</td>', 'Too contrived for my liking.....I don''t wish to sound harsh or mean but I don''t think you''re letting your camera do more than a scanner could. Good luck on the next challenge', '2004-06-05 06:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
