(751248, 80387, 10268, '<td valign="top">I think a little bit of negative space under the pears could have improved the overall composition a bit, but I like this.  Nice texture, and lighting. 8.</td>', 'I think a little bit of negative space under the pears could have improved the overall composition a bit, but I like this.  Nice texture, and lighting. 8.', '2004-06-05 08:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(751249, 80172, 10268, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what that is, but it looks kind of gross.<br/> <br/>Fish maybe?  Anyway, 4 for being on topic.</td>', 'I''m not sure what that is, but it looks kind of gross. Fish maybe?  Anyway, 4 for being on topic.', '2004-06-05 08:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(751251, 80074, 10268, '<td valign="top">I would assume that there is a child in the stroller?  Four people then?<br/> <br/>Hmmm.  I only see three people, but I''m 99% sure there are four.<br/> <br/>Anyway, it''s a nice photo.  Not sure what to say beyond that.  5.</td>', 'I would assume that there is a child in the stroller?  Four people then? Hmmm.  I only see three people, but I''m 99% sure there are four. Anyway, it''s a nice photo.  Not sure what to say beyond that.  5.', '2004-06-05 08:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(751252, 79101, 10268, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t see any 3s.  I loked for patters, and everything, but I don''t see anything.  3.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t see any 3s.  I loked for patters, and everything, but I don''t see anything.  3.', '2004-06-05 08:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(751254, 79562, 10268, '<td valign="top">The loghting is a bit uneven, but I like the concept a lot, and the composition is great too.  7.</td>', 'The loghting is a bit uneven, but I like the concept a lot, and the composition is great too.  7.', '2004-06-05 08:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(751256, 80278, 10268, '<td valign="top">I hated Peter Pan.  You get an automatic one.  Sorry, I can''t stand anyone that likes that movie.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/>Kidding!  :)  Uh, well, I do hate that movie.  Anyway.  It''s a little bit busy, and I can''t quite make out what you''re shooting.</td>', 'I hated Peter Pan.  You get an automatic one.  Sorry, I can''t stand anyone that likes that movie.           Kidding!  :)  Uh, well, I do hate that movie.  Anyway.  It''s a little bit busy, and I can''t quite make out what you''re shooting.', '2004-06-05 08:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(751257, 80147, 10268, '<td valign="top">I love the colors, the vignetting.  That really adds to it.  And you caught them in a great moment.  9.</td>', 'I love the colors, the vignetting.  That really adds to it.  And you caught them in a great moment.  9.', '2004-06-05 08:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
