(751259, 79360, 10268, '<td valign="top">I have a feeling this is going to score pretty high.<br/> <br/>I think focus is a little bit too soft, and it''s too grainy.  <br/> <br/>I like the idea, though.  And the composition is pretty good too.  It''s just not working for me, I guess.  5.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-10 01:14:10.</i></td>', 'I have a feeling this is going to score pretty high. I think focus is a little bit too soft, and it''s too grainy.   I like the idea, though.  And the composition is pretty good too.  It''s just not working for me, I guess.  5.', '2004-06-05 08:21:23.000000', '2004-06-10 02:14:10.000000', 1),
(751275, 80151, 18191, '<td valign="top">Wonderful focus and DOF. 9.</td>', 'Wonderful focus and DOF. 9.', '2004-06-05 09:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(751280, 80309, 12674, '<td valign="top">Those are some red eyes...neat shot!</td>', 'Those are some red eyes...neat shot!', '2004-06-05 09:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(751281, 80371, 18191, '<td valign="top">This might have been easier to vote on if it was a larger size.,</td>', 'This might have been easier to vote on if it was a larger size.,', '2004-06-05 09:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(751289, 80403, 489, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot - this one made very good impact on me in the first impression. THe color combination is terrific.</td>', 'Excellent shot - this one made very good impact on me in the first impression. THe color combination is terrific.', '2004-06-05 09:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(751290, 80262, 489, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition - I love the color contrast as well.</td>', 'Nice simple composition - I love the color contrast as well.', '2004-06-05 09:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(751292, 79350, 489, '<td valign="top">This shot would have benefitted from some color or other contrast.</td>', 'This shot would have benefitted from some color or other contrast.', '2004-06-05 09:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(751296, 78955, 489, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been even better by leaving the nuts brown, with the pure white background. more of a duotone that would add a lot of character to the image. This is still a terrific shot - I like the composition; and I would be very interested in seeing the shot that was not desaturated.</td>', 'I think this would have been even better by leaving the nuts brown, with the pure white background. more of a duotone that would add a lot of character to the image. This is still a terrific shot - I like the composition; and I would be very interested in seeing the shot that was not desaturated.', '2004-06-05 09:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(751322, 79214, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really dynamic and interesting shot! I do wish that all cards were in sharp focus, but the shot is still very effective. Fine work! 8</td>', 'Really dynamic and interesting shot! I do wish that all cards were in sharp focus, but the shot is still very effective. Fine work! 8', '2004-06-05 10:38:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(751323, 80333, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice specimens, and great contrast of white and red. 9</td>', 'Nice specimens, and great contrast of white and red. 9', '2004-06-05 10:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(751324, 80318, 6870, '<td valign="top">DOF choices here really add to the mood and mystery of this image. Nice work! 9</td>', 'DOF choices here really add to the mood and mystery of this image. Nice work! 9', '2004-06-05 10:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(751325, 78955, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super tones and wonderful focus. Composition is effective, too. 8</td>', 'Super tones and wonderful focus. Composition is effective, too. 8', '2004-06-05 10:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(751326, 80188, 6870, '<td valign="top">Superb work.Simple, interesting, and objective. I really  like this: clarity and communication are very well done. 10</td>', 'Superb work.Simple, interesting, and objective. I really  like this: clarity and communication are very well done. 10', '2004-06-05 10:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(751327, 80201, 16965, '<td valign="top">shame about the shadow.</td>', 'shame about the shadow.', '2004-06-05 10:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(751328, 79712, 6870, '<td valign="top">Cute flutists! I enjoy your point of view here, which makes them grand and interesting. This could possibly use some brighter highlights on the statues themselves, but great work. 9</td>', 'Cute flutists! I enjoy your point of view here, which makes them grand and interesting. This could possibly use some brighter highlights on the statues themselves, but great work. 9', '2004-06-05 10:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(751330, 79755, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice! Just goes to show how effective 3s are in composition, even in journalistic shots. 9</td>', 'Very nice! Just goes to show how effective 3s are in composition, even in journalistic shots. 9', '2004-06-05 10:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(751332, 79280, 16965, '<td valign="top">colorful and vibrant, not your average flour picture!</td>', 'colorful and vibrant, not your average flour picture!', '2004-06-05 10:43:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(751333, 80215, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super clarity and composition. 9</td>', 'Super clarity and composition. 9', '2004-06-05 10:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
