(751338, 79791, 16965, '<td valign="top">This might have had more power, but the leaves in the foreground detract, and a polarizer might have cut through that haze a bit.</td>', 'This might have had more power, but the leaves in the foreground detract, and a polarizer might have cut through that haze a bit.', '2004-06-05 10:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(751339, 80263, 16965, '<td valign="top">Great desat!</td>', 'Great desat!', '2004-06-05 10:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(751344, 80135, 16965, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect</td>', 'Very cool effect', '2004-06-05 10:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(751347, 80238, 12311, '<td valign="top">Crop out half of the sand in the foreground, and this would be a much more impressive image.</td>', 'Crop out half of the sand in the foreground, and this would be a much more impressive image.', '2004-06-05 10:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(751432, 79412, 8054, '<td valign="top">Very good take on the challenge! Too bad you couldn''t use a fill flash if this was, in fact, a real find on the street vs a staged setup. The interior is a bit dark.</td>', 'Very good take on the challenge! Too bad you couldn''t use a fill flash if this was, in fact, a real find on the street vs a staged setup. The interior is a bit dark.', '2004-06-05 12:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(751434, 80106, 8054, '<td valign="top">Even though there are three guitars in the foreground, my eye tends to wander around and notice the other two in the background for a total of five. The people in the background are also distracting.</td>', 'Even though there are three guitars in the foreground, my eye tends to wander around and notice the other two in the background for a total of five. The people in the background are also distracting.', '2004-06-05 12:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(751435, 80402, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice soft light allows for good details and skin tones. Nice job with DOF.</td>', 'Nice soft light allows for good details and skin tones. Nice job with DOF.', '2004-06-05 12:24:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(751440, 79759, 12311, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  I think it may have been even better with the horses'' entire bodies in the frame.  As is, a 7</td>', 'Nice image.  I think it may have been even better with the horses'' entire bodies in the frame.  As is, a 7', '2004-06-05 12:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(751443, 80201, 7560, '<td valign="top">Love the strong colors in this shot. The sail ''s shadow is unexpected and blends in well with the car and three folks walking. Hmm, three windows per level, three modes of transport, three cars, three sets of barred doors...Threes all over! I''d like to see the same building later in the day with some different sunlight color, but this is still a really well composed shot. 10</td>', 'Love the strong colors in this shot. The sail ''s shadow is unexpected and blends in well with the car and three folks walking. Hmm, three windows per level, three modes of transport, three cars, three sets of barred doors...Threes all over! I''d like to see the same building later in the day with some different sunlight color, but this is still a really well composed shot. 10', '2004-06-05 12:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(751444, 79084, 7560, '<td valign="top">High marks for the best fun shot of the week. :) Nice colors, simple composition, and it all works. 8</td>', 'High marks for the best fun shot of the week. :) Nice colors, simple composition, and it all works. 8', '2004-06-05 12:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(751448, 79588, 51167, '<td valign="top">This is very cool.  I like it a lot.  The color and comp is perfect.</td>', 'This is very cool.  I like it a lot.  The color and comp is perfect.', '2004-06-05 12:52:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(751485, 79455, 21367, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting is hurting this picture.  The bushes are blown out and the subject (three rocks) are quite dark.  I think I would have tried this from a different angle.  From the angle I don''t think you could have lightened the rocks at the same time as darkening the very green bush right behind.</td>', 'I think the lighting is hurting this picture.  The bushes are blown out and the subject (three rocks) are quite dark.  I think I would have tried this from a different angle.  From the angle I don''t think you could have lightened the rocks at the same time as darkening the very green bush right behind.', '2004-06-05 14:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(751488, 80388, 21367, '<td valign="top">I may have chosen a different crop on this one.  The three boats are quite small, and the beautiful sky takes away focus from them.</td>', 'I may have chosen a different crop on this one.  The three boats are quite small, and the beautiful sky takes away focus from them.', '2004-06-05 14:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(751492, 79101, 21367, '<td valign="top">Sorry, there is just not enough (or too much) detail here to pick out the "three".</td>', 'Sorry, there is just not enough (or too much) detail here to pick out the "three".', '2004-06-05 14:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(751503, 79350, 21367, '<td valign="top">Composition is alright, I think the light could be a little more dramatic.  When viewing eggs artistically I like to see clean soft surfaces,  I think these guys could have been cleaned up a little better prior to shooting.   Maybe a softer light would mask some of the artifacts and imperfections a little better or even a dusting of baby powder or talc to whiten them up a tad.</td>', 'Composition is alright, I think the light could be a little more dramatic.  When viewing eggs artistically I like to see clean soft surfaces,  I think these guys could have been cleaned up a little better prior to shooting.   Maybe a softer light would mask some of the artifacts and imperfections a little better or even a dusting of baby powder or talc to whiten them up a tad.', '2004-06-05 14:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(751510, 80194, 21367, '<td valign="top">I feel the subject is a little dark in this shot.  I''m having a hard time telling what they are, floppy disks I''m thinking.  Better lighting on the floppies would have blown out the white background therefore I think I would have used a dark background and a bright light to make the subject stand out.</td>', 'I feel the subject is a little dark in this shot.  I''m having a hard time telling what they are, floppy disks I''m thinking.  Better lighting on the floppies would have blown out the white background therefore I think I would have used a dark background and a bright light to make the subject stand out.', '2004-06-05 14:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(751524, 79665, 16148, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  I like the black background for this subject.  Looks like e top three for this challenge.  Good luck!</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  I like the black background for this subject.  Looks like e top three for this challenge.  Good luck!', '2004-06-05 15:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(751526, 79965, 19025, '<td valign="top">my favorite flower captured with the perfect lighting and excellent color. Absolutly gorgeous picture.</td>', 'my favorite flower captured with the perfect lighting and excellent color. Absolutly gorgeous picture.', '2004-06-05 15:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(751527, 80215, 16148, '<td valign="top">Well done.  I like how you positioned the glasses and cropped this image.  Interesting composition and nice lighting.  Good luck.</td>', 'Well done.  I like how you positioned the glasses and cropped this image.  Interesting composition and nice lighting.  Good luck.', '2004-06-05 15:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(751530, 80214, 16148, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot for this challenge.  I can see a three in the stones shape.  I''m not sure it''s obvious enough to score very high.  Your scores might be all over the map.  I''ll be curious to see how you end up.  Good luck!</td>', 'Interesting shot for this challenge.  I can see a three in the stones shape.  I''m not sure it''s obvious enough to score very high.  Your scores might be all over the map.  I''ll be curious to see how you end up.  Good luck!', '2004-06-05 15:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(751532, 79720, 19025, '<td valign="top">I am dying to know how you got those flowers to show the white so well. Mine always come out with a yellow tinge. That is an amazing use of focus and color. Thanks for submitting it.</td>', 'I am dying to know how you got those flowers to show the white so well. Mine always come out with a yellow tinge. That is an amazing use of focus and color. Thanks for submitting it.', '2004-06-05 15:20:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(751538, 80274, 6008, '<td valign="top">Nice textures, composition, and color range.</td>', 'Nice textures, composition, and color range.', '2004-06-05 15:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(751542, 80312, 6008, '<td valign="top">Nice vibrant green, the background material has a good texture. Not sure the bud in the middle is really needed, it would work well without it. The light is a little bright on the top, but not overly distracting.</td>', 'Nice vibrant green, the background material has a good texture. Not sure the bud in the middle is really needed, it would work well without it. The light is a little bright on the top, but not overly distracting.', '2004-06-05 15:29:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(751543, 80340, 6008, '<td valign="top">Wonderful sunset backdrop. The sails are interesting with good composition. The horizon looks a little tilted.</td>', 'Wonderful sunset backdrop. The sails are interesting with good composition. The horizon looks a little tilted.', '2004-06-05 15:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(751544, 80007, 6008, '<td valign="top">The color combination is good and the lighting looks very even and good. Not so sure about the composition, though.</td>', 'The color combination is good and the lighting looks very even and good. Not so sure about the composition, though.', '2004-06-05 15:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(751546, 80075, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice overall composition, lighting is a bit strong and camera needs to be level.</td>', 'Nice overall composition, lighting is a bit strong and camera needs to be level.', '2004-06-05 15:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(751548, 80061, 6008, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. I like the tones, lighting, and contrast. The horse in the lower left seems a little ''forced'' in the composition.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. I like the tones, lighting, and contrast. The horse in the lower left seems a little ''forced'' in the composition.', '2004-06-05 15:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(751549, 80074, 8054, '<td valign="top">Nice family-type photo. Cropping is also good. I like the front/side lighting and it gives a nice outline of the people and hair.</td>', 'Nice family-type photo. Cropping is also good. I like the front/side lighting and it gives a nice outline of the people and hair.', '2004-06-05 15:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(751550, 80265, 8054, '<td valign="top">I don''t fully understand this photo maybe because I don''t smoke. But focus is very good especially on the smoke itself and the burnt tobacco.</td>', 'I don''t fully understand this photo maybe because I don''t smoke. But focus is very good especially on the smoke itself and the burnt tobacco.', '2004-06-05 15:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(751553, 80401, 8054, '<td valign="top">Great shot of the gulls at sunset. The focus and details are very good of the wet sand but lacking somewhat on the gulls themselves. I think the use of a flash would help bring those details out better. Cropping is also excellent. I would have liked to see the boat cloned out. 7</td>', 'Great shot of the gulls at sunset. The focus and details are very good of the wet sand but lacking somewhat on the gulls themselves. I think the use of a flash would help bring those details out better. Cropping is also excellent. I would have liked to see the boat cloned out. 7', '2004-06-05 15:39:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(751562, 79556, 5728, '<td valign="top">For some reason I like this image a lot, I can''t put my finger on it as to why but I do. It''s been done very well, full points from me :)</td>', 'For some reason I like this image a lot, I can''t put my finger on it as to why but I do. It''s been done very well, full points from me :)', '2004-06-05 15:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(751567, 80333, 5728, '<td valign="top">Super photo, very clear and detailed! (9)</td>', 'Super photo, very clear and detailed! (9)', '2004-06-05 16:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(751577, 79760, 6870, '<td valign="top">Cute little violas! Composition is very nice here. The fill flash kind of makes harsh lighting, though. Nice focus and point of view.</td>', 'Cute little violas! Composition is very nice here. The fill flash kind of makes harsh lighting, though. Nice focus and point of view.', '2004-06-05 16:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(751580, 79374, 6870, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this image. I''m having a hard time figuring out how it meets the challenge, though. Nice composition, and the dark tones seem appropriate.</td>', 'I really enjoy this image. I''m having a hard time figuring out how it meets the challenge, though. Nice composition, and the dark tones seem appropriate.', '2004-06-05 16:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(751584, 80183, 6870, '<td valign="top">Okay, I finally see the three birds here! sorry for my denseness. I suppose it would have been easier had all birds been in focus. I like the point of view of this structure. Nice composition, too.</td>', 'Okay, I finally see the three birds here! sorry for my denseness. I suppose it would have been easier had all birds been in focus. I like the point of view of this structure. Nice composition, too.', '2004-06-05 16:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(751588, 80371, 6870, '<td valign="top">Mmmm. Steak! --or are these pork chops? Oh well. The lighting is a bit harsh, and so you lose some clarity, but I like the centered composition. You might want to experiment with getting much closer so we can''t see all of every hunk of meat, or shooting in the shade. Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Mmmm. Steak! --or are these pork chops? Oh well. The lighting is a bit harsh, and so you lose some clarity, but I like the centered composition. You might want to experiment with getting much closer so we can''t see all of every hunk of meat, or shooting in the shade. Keep up the good work.', '2004-06-05 16:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
