(751761, 80155, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is the kind of photo that I have literally hundreds of in my house.  It captures a moment that you will look back on in fondness later in life.  The problem here is that even though it is moving to you (and me in my case) , here in a photo contest, it looks a bit like a snapshot.  As an example, one of the boys has a post coming out of his head, and the focus isn''t tack sharp.<br/> <br/>Since it is advanced editing, I might have cloned out the garden and worked hard on the saturation in the grass.  <br/> <br/>It is a very nice composition though.  Pictures of kids just being kids are good ones.  In this one, I''m left curious about what they are happily chatting about.</td>', 'This is the kind of photo that I have literally hundreds of in my house.  It captures a moment that you will look back on in fondness later in life.  The problem here is that even though it is moving to you (and me in my case) , here in a photo contest, it looks a bit like a snapshot.  As an example, one of the boys has a post coming out of his head, and the focus isn''t tack sharp. Since it is advanced editing, I might have cloned out the garden and worked hard on the saturation in the grass.   It is a very nice composition though.  Pictures of kids just being kids are good ones.  In this one, I''m left curious about what they are happily chatting about.', '2004-06-05 20:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(751767, 79557, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is an average close up of a flower that might be a touch sharp.  To score well, flower shots have to be absolutely perfect, as we see so many of them.</td>', 'This is an average close up of a flower that might be a touch sharp.  To score well, flower shots have to be absolutely perfect, as we see so many of them.', '2004-06-05 20:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
