(751878, 80174, 8891, '<td valign="top">I like this very much but I think I would have liked it more with some more definition on the cat.  I appreciate those piercing green eyes and think it it great that they are well defined but head of the cat looks mis shapened?  Is there it missing an ear? As I scroll this down I see this being better with a crop from the top to just above the eyes...about a half inch on my monitor. It''s a little squarish as a result but the image is much tighter and more effective than it already is. Nice work.</td>', 'I like this very much but I think I would have liked it more with some more definition on the cat.  I appreciate those piercing green eyes and think it it great that they are well defined but head of the cat looks mis shapened?  Is there it missing an ear? As I scroll this down I see this being better with a crop from the top to just above the eyes...about a half inch on my monitor. It''s a little squarish as a result but the image is much tighter and more effective than it already is. Nice work.', '2004-06-05 23:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
