(752163, 79755, 1031, '<td valign="top">Excellent positioning gets you away from the typical "news snap" picture. Just for the purpose of this challenge, I might have tried going to B&amp;W, as all the excitement and color of the flames distract just a bit from the "threeness"  -- and B&amp;W "might" help focus attention on the firefighters.</td>', 'Excellent positioning gets you away from the typical "news snap" picture. Just for the purpose of this challenge, I might have tried going to B&W, as all the excitement and color of the flames distract just a bit from the "threeness"  -- and B&W "might" help focus attention on the firefighters.', '2004-06-06 13:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
