(752197, 80122, 1031, '<td valign="top">Looks like good, dramatic lighting; nice clouds -- I''m not sure if for the "Three" challenge it would be better with a clear sky, but overall I like it this way.</td>', 'Looks like good, dramatic lighting; nice clouds -- I''m not sure if for the "Three" challenge it would be better with a clear sky, but overall I like it this way.', '2004-06-06 13:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(752199, 80204, 1031, '<td valign="top">Nice detail under tricky lighting conditions.</td>', 'Nice detail under tricky lighting conditions.', '2004-06-06 14:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(752201, 80367, 2764, '<td valign="top">ooh - I love the "old postcard" feel of the colors - and the scenic drive sign is perfect.</td>', 'ooh - I love the "old postcard" feel of the colors - and the scenic drive sign is perfect.', '2004-06-06 14:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(752217, 79548, 7033, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites... very nicely done!</td>', 'One of my favorites... very nicely done!', '2004-06-06 14:37:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(752221, 79830, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nicley composed, but a few distractions that impact my score.  The photo appears to have been rotated slightly without being re-cropped (blue background at the bottom of the shot).  The background appears to have been overprocessed to the point of becoming a distraction... it seems so unnatural against the sharp lines on the cones in the foreground.</td>', 'Nicley composed, but a few distractions that impact my score.  The photo appears to have been rotated slightly without being re-cropped (blue background at the bottom of the shot).  The background appears to have been overprocessed to the point of becoming a distraction... it seems so unnatural against the sharp lines on the cones in the foreground.', '2004-06-06 14:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(752224, 79257, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice find... but I find the strong line across the center of the shot rather unsettling.  Perhaps a composition with the line at a thirds point?</td>', 'Nice find... but I find the strong line across the center of the shot rather unsettling.  Perhaps a composition with the line at a thirds point?', '2004-06-06 14:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(752225, 79350, 7033, '<td valign="top">Might benefits from different lighting with more contrast.  Not sure what the pink color is on the edge fo the eggs?</td>', 'Might benefits from different lighting with more contrast.  Not sure what the pink color is on the edge fo the eggs?', '2004-06-06 14:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(752228, 79490, 7033, '<td valign="top">Great lighting... nice abstract shot.</td>', 'Great lighting... nice abstract shot.', '2004-06-06 14:46:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(752230, 79785, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, but I feel the border is a bit overdone to the point of detracting from the shot.</td>', 'Nicely done, but I feel the border is a bit overdone to the point of detracting from the shot.', '2004-06-06 14:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(752231, 79826, 7033, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done... I especially love the subdued lighting.  The composition, or perhaps the floral arrangement leaves the shot feeling a bit out of balance, however.  8</td>', 'Very nicely done... I especially love the subdued lighting.  The composition, or perhaps the floral arrangement leaves the shot feeling a bit out of balance, however.  8', '2004-06-06 14:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(752232, 79101, 7033, '<td valign="top">Not sure I see the connection with the challenge.  Not very exciting, overall.</td>', 'Not sure I see the connection with the challenge.  Not very exciting, overall.', '2004-06-06 14:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(752233, 80224, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice capture; the colors seem a bit overprocessed (oversaturated) to the point of detracting from the shot.  7</td>', 'Nice capture; the colors seem a bit overprocessed (oversaturated) to the point of detracting from the shot.  7', '2004-06-06 14:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(752234, 79576, 7033, '<td valign="top">Far too much grain in the shot, in my opinion.  The shoes do little to add to the subject.</td>', 'Far too much grain in the shot, in my opinion.  The shoes do little to add to the subject.', '2004-06-06 14:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(752235, 80005, 7033, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous color!  --8</td>', 'Gorgeous color!  --8', '2004-06-06 14:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(752236, 80308, 7033, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, and nicely shot.  Color balance seems a bit off (yellowish hue) across the board.</td>', 'Nice subject, and nicely shot.  Color balance seems a bit off (yellowish hue) across the board.', '2004-06-06 14:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(752237, 79829, 7033, '<td valign="top">Cute shot; lighting color on the right seems a bit off.</td>', 'Cute shot; lighting color on the right seems a bit off.', '2004-06-06 14:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(752238, 80383, 7033, '<td valign="top">Love the capture... very funny!  Wish it were just a bit sharper, but nicely done for an action shot.  7</td>', 'Love the capture... very funny!  Wish it were just a bit sharper, but nicely done for an action shot.  7', '2004-06-06 15:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(752240, 80381, 7033, '<td valign="top">Like the overall tone of this shot.  --6</td>', 'Like the overall tone of this shot.  --6', '2004-06-06 15:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(752242, 79787, 12802, '<td valign="top">NIce shot, good use of negative space.  Maybe moving the pins apart a little, the two on the right IMO would look better slightly apart.</td>', 'NIce shot, good use of negative space.  Maybe moving the pins apart a little, the two on the right IMO would look better slightly apart.', '2004-06-06 15:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(752243, 80401, 7033, '<td valign="top">Greater DOF might have been better, in my opinion... --7</td>', 'Greater DOF might have been better, in my opinion... --7', '2004-06-06 15:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(752252, 80121, 17033, '<td valign="top">Despite the potential the subject has for saccharin sentimentality, this image avoids it completely. The composition is highly original....how many photographers would see the potential to make the feet stand out by rotating the canvas in this way? The movement is accentuated by the desaturation and the poses by the burning/dodging. Podium finish by rights.</td>', 'Despite the potential the subject has for saccharin sentimentality, this image avoids it completely. The composition is highly original....how many photographers would see the potential to make the feet stand out by rotating the canvas in this way? The movement is accentuated by the desaturation and the poses by the burning/dodging. Podium finish by rights.', '2004-06-06 15:31:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(752333, 80340, 811, '<td valign="top">I very rarely comment on, and never "adjust" the score because of, borders, but I feel that this one really detracts from a nice pictures.  The colors are so rich and deep,  and the border looks so "unnatural."  Great shot, otherwise. 8</td>', 'I very rarely comment on, and never "adjust" the score because of, borders, but I feel that this one really detracts from a nice pictures.  The colors are so rich and deep,  and the border looks so "unnatural."  Great shot, otherwise. 8', '2004-06-06 17:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(752339, 79466, 811, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors!!!! 10</td>', 'Awesome colors!!!! 10', '2004-06-06 17:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(752364, 80329, 21567, '<td valign="top">this is really cute I like it :-)</td>', 'this is really cute I like it :-)', '2004-06-06 18:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(752373, 79448, 15645, '<td valign="top">Simply awesome!</td>', 'Simply awesome!', '2004-06-06 18:36:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(752403, 80188, 14608, '<td valign="top">It is one o''clock in the afternoon . I like it</td>', 'It is one o''clock in the afternoon . I like it', '2004-06-06 19:30:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(752407, 79888, 14608, '<td valign="top">I do not remember such keyboard  on HP<br/>Nice Micro</td>', 'I do not remember such keyboard  on HPNice Micro', '2004-06-06 19:35:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(752412, 80334, 14608, '<td valign="top">Very originally you used a mirror<br/> <br/>There reflections are visible</td>', 'Very originally you used a mirror There reflections are visible', '2004-06-06 19:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(752415, 79448, 22689, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful !</td>', 'Simply beautiful !', '2004-06-06 19:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(752419, 79791, 14608, '<td valign="top">Very effectively and reflection in water too. If it''s possible beat to cut off with top and to give more in a bottom</td>', 'Very effectively and reflection in water too. If it''s possible beat to cut off with top and to give more in a bottom', '2004-06-06 19:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(752420, 80121, 14608, '<td valign="top">10 from me there are no words very well</td>', '10 from me there are no words very well', '2004-06-06 19:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(752460, 79755, 7969, '<td valign="top">Good photojournalistic shot, good angle on the fireman. Too bad tree was on the left. Still very well done.</td>', 'Good photojournalistic shot, good angle on the fireman. Too bad tree was on the left. Still very well done.', '2004-06-06 21:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(752461, 80214, 7969, '<td valign="top">I will be interested in how you do with this, i am sure you''ve gotten some does nt  meet challenge comments, but I think it is a creative take on subject, requiring a good eye.  Nice capture of water movement.</td>', 'I will be interested in how you do with this, i am sure you''ve gotten some does nt  meet challenge comments, but I think it is a creative take on subject, requiring a good eye.  Nice capture of water movement.', '2004-06-06 21:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(752463, 80095, 7969, '<td valign="top">I like the colorful flowers on the black background, makes for a dramatic feel that really adds to shot, well done.</td>', 'I like the colorful flowers on the black background, makes for a dramatic feel that really adds to shot, well done.', '2004-06-06 21:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(752468, 79785, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good exposure and focus, but tough to distinguish three. Looks like a mass of one.</td>', 'Good exposure and focus, but tough to distinguish three. Looks like a mass of one.', '2004-06-06 21:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(752470, 79759, 17203, '<td valign="top">Nice alignment. A little hot on the left side. A vertical crop of just the heads would avoid the hot areas and create a nice diagonal that emphasizes that alignment.</td>', 'Nice alignment. A little hot on the left side. A vertical crop of just the heads would avoid the hot areas and create a nice diagonal that emphasizes that alignment.', '2004-06-06 21:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(752472, 80368, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but apparent pixelation.  caused by excessive cropping?  A good concept, but technique needs work.  Keep trying.</td>', 'Nice idea, but apparent pixelation.  caused by excessive cropping?  A good concept, but technique needs work.  Keep trying.', '2004-06-06 21:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(752473, 80206, 17203, '<td valign="top">Confusing. The top is overexposed and the centered floodlight becomes a major element here. Looks like you cropped a lot to get to this point- was there any more at the bottom that would allow you to center the shields?</td>', 'Confusing. The top is overexposed and the centered floodlight becomes a major element here. Looks like you cropped a lot to get to this point- was there any more at the bottom that would allow you to center the shields?', '2004-06-06 21:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(752475, 80206, 11738, '<td valign="top">Three arches?  I am struglling to find reference to the challenge with this shot.  Great job at centering though.  Highlights blown out at top of image.</td>', 'Three arches?  I am struglling to find reference to the challenge with this shot.  Great job at centering though.  Highlights blown out at top of image.', '2004-06-06 21:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(752477, 79556, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good idea and composition. Looks like the opposite side of the carousel might have offered more light .</td>', 'Good idea and composition. Looks like the opposite side of the carousel might have offered more light .', '2004-06-06 21:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(752479, 80122, 11738, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit oversharpened (closest windmill baldes)</td>', 'Seems a bit oversharpened (closest windmill baldes)', '2004-06-06 21:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(752481, 80214, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice water shot.  Wonder how many will not see the "3" shape made by the rocks.  I almost missed it.</td>', 'Nice water shot.  Wonder how many will not see the "3" shape made by the rocks.  I almost missed it.', '2004-06-06 21:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(752482, 79588, 17203, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge (just kidding). Highly original concept and well executed.</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge (just kidding). Highly original concept and well executed.', '2004-06-06 21:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(752483, 79389, 11738, '<td valign="top">Poor orchid.  Looks like you chopped one bloom off to attain your goal.  I love the way your background fades from blue to black.</td>', 'Poor orchid.  Looks like you chopped one bloom off to attain your goal.  I love the way your background fades from blue to black.', '2004-06-06 21:47:20.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(752488, 79575, 11738, '<td valign="top">Ooo... you''re braver than me to handle these hell plants!  You receive one extra point for doing this.  Nice job on lighting..</td>', 'Ooo... you''re braver than me to handle these hell plants!  You receive one extra point for doing this.  Nice job on lighting..', '2004-06-06 21:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(752489, 80264, 17203, '<td valign="top">Cool smoke and nice DOF. The burning areas look dull for some reason, like the red channel was desaturated. The composition is kind of scattered with no obvious focal point- if the sticks were on a diagonal, it might form a nice path for your eye to follow.</td>', 'Cool smoke and nice DOF. The burning areas look dull for some reason, like the red channel was desaturated. The composition is kind of scattered with no obvious focal point- if the sticks were on a diagonal, it might form a nice path for your eye to follow.', '2004-06-06 21:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(752493, 80317, 17203, '<td valign="top">No question about meeting the challenge. ;-)  The grayscale background is a good idea, but possibly overdone. The result makes the ball look like a flat illustration. The bottom edge and the ball''s shadow could stand a bit more light.</td>', 'No question about meeting the challenge. ;-)  The grayscale background is a good idea, but possibly overdone. The result makes the ball look like a flat illustration. The bottom edge and the ball''s shadow could stand a bit more light.', '2004-06-06 21:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(752494, 80308, 11738, '<td valign="top">White balance seems off on this one.  Too bad.  Nice flower.</td>', 'White balance seems off on this one.  Too bad.  Nice flower.', '2004-06-06 21:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(752497, 80274, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice image compositon, but too dark.</td>', 'Nice image compositon, but too dark.', '2004-06-06 22:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(752500, 79022, 17203, '<td valign="top">The exposure and color are great for such a tough subject. The tight crop doesn''t offer any context for the 3. It''s so stylized, that I find myself wondering what the background has to do with popcorn.</td>', 'The exposure and color are great for such a tough subject. The tight crop doesn''t offer any context for the 3. It''s so stylized, that I find myself wondering what the background has to do with popcorn.', '2004-06-06 22:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(752506, 80403, 11738, '<td valign="top">The best of the three cherry pictures of this composition... by far.  Good job.  Love how the light fades into "blueness".</td>', 'The best of the three cherry pictures of this composition... by far.  Good job.  Love how the light fades into "blueness".', '2004-06-06 22:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(752508, 79829, 17203, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed and washed out, especially on the right side. Pet and kid shots are so common here that great exposure is essential and you need to do something unusual to stand out. Stack the pups or put them nose to nose and shoot from above, etc.</td>', 'A little overexposed and washed out, especially on the right side. Pet and kid shots are so common here that great exposure is essential and you need to do something unusual to stand out. Stack the pups or put them nose to nose and shoot from above, etc.', '2004-06-06 22:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(752509, 80401, 11738, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful shot!  Love the orange tone of the shot.  Natural or was it manipulated?  Either way, well done.  My choice for 1st.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful shot!  Love the orange tone of the shot.  Natural or was it manipulated?  Either way, well done.  My choice for 1st.', '2004-06-06 22:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(752510, 80196, 17203, '<td valign="top">Lovely subjects and composition. The stems are a little hot. I like the sepia, but much of the interest in a flower shot is the color of the flower.</td>', 'Lovely subjects and composition. The stems are a little hot. I like the sepia, but much of the interest in a flower shot is the color of the flower.', '2004-06-06 22:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(752512, 80147, 11738, '<td valign="top">Love how you biurned the edges of this shot.  Works very well.  Excellent detail in the wool patterns on all three sheep.  I have an idea who this could be, but I won''t say just yet.  Among my top five.</td>', 'Love how you biurned the edges of this shot.  Works very well.  Excellent detail in the wool patterns on all three sheep.  I have an idea who this could be, but I won''t say just yet.  Among my top five.', '2004-06-06 22:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(752515, 79954, 11738, '<td valign="top">Excellent starburst effect with the sun.  How did you achieve this?  Please share once challenge is over.  B&amp;W treatment works wonders for this shot.</td>', 'Excellent starburst effect with the sun.  How did you achieve this?  Please share once challenge is over.  B&W treatment works wonders for this shot.', '2004-06-06 22:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(752520, 79824, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the unfortunate highlight on the big tree makes it look like two (and therefore 4 in your shot). The harsh light keeps the subjects from standing out.</td>', 'Good idea, but the unfortunate highlight on the big tree makes it look like two (and therefore 4 in your shot). The harsh light keeps the subjects from standing out.', '2004-06-06 22:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(752522, 80065, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good find. One of the better entries. Looks like you were at your zoom limit and oversharpened to compensate- there is some pixelization aroud the cranes.</td>', 'Good find. One of the better entries. Looks like you were at your zoom limit and oversharpened to compensate- there is some pixelization aroud the cranes.', '2004-06-06 22:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(752526, 80328, 17203, '<td valign="top">A little underexposed- might have been a good place to force a fill flash. Good find. How''d you narrow them down to ONLY three?  ;-)</td>', 'A little underexposed- might have been a good place to force a fill flash. Good find. How''d you narrow them down to ONLY three?  ;-)', '2004-06-06 22:22:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(752531, 80106, 17203, '<td valign="top">Gotta shoot this at more of an angle or use a very shallow DOF to eliminate those other 2 guitars (or at least crop two out). I don''t know what''s off to the sides, but shooting more from the left side might help with that bright spot on the sky, too.</td>', 'Gotta shoot this at more of an angle or use a very shallow DOF to eliminate those other 2 guitars (or at least crop two out). I don''t know what''s off to the sides, but shooting more from the left side might help with that bright spot on the sky, too.', '2004-06-06 22:26:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(752539, 79101, 17203, '<td valign="top">I''ve stared at it for a while, but I just can''t see three of anything. I must be missing something, but I feel like I''m just looking at a picture of dirt.</td>', 'I''ve stared at it for a while, but I just can''t see three of anything. I must be missing something, but I feel like I''m just looking at a picture of dirt.', '2004-06-06 22:29:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(752542, 80255, 17203, '<td valign="top">Focus! Good find, but a different time of day might have provided better lighting.</td>', 'Focus! Good find, but a different time of day might have provided better lighting.', '2004-06-06 22:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(752548, 79059, 17203, '<td valign="top">Great capture. A little soft. Unless your white balance was WAY off, it looks like this would have been a fabulous color shot.</td>', 'Great capture. A little soft. Unless your white balance was WAY off, it looks like this would have been a fabulous color shot.', '2004-06-06 22:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(752553, 80405, 17203, '<td valign="top">Why, oh, why didn''t you shoot BEFORE the swing to capture the 3 I assume is on his shirt? Looks like the camera focused on the dugout- it''s a little sharper than the players.</td>', 'Why, oh, why didn''t you shoot BEFORE the swing to capture the 3 I assume is on his shirt? Looks like the camera focused on the dugout- it''s a little sharper than the players.', '2004-06-06 22:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(752554, 79805, 17203, '<td valign="top">A bit of a stretch. The subject of this photo is really the one flower (though it''s a good shot of the flower).</td>', 'A bit of a stretch. The subject of this photo is really the one flower (though it''s a good shot of the flower).', '2004-06-06 22:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(752555, 80324, 17203, '<td valign="top">Clever. Even better if you crop just below the nose to center the 3.</td>', 'Clever. Even better if you crop just below the nose to center the 3.', '2004-06-06 22:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(752558, 80367, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good, good, good. Might have been more amusing to crop out the town and clone away that distracting streetlight to get an odd juxtaposition of the butte and stoplights.</td>', 'Good, good, good. Might have been more amusing to crop out the town and clone away that distracting streetlight to get an odd juxtaposition of the butte and stoplights.', '2004-06-06 22:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(752563, 80123, 17203, '<td valign="top">Funny. Color is a little flat, though, and anyone who doesn''t read the title will be lost.</td>', 'Funny. Color is a little flat, though, and anyone who doesn''t read the title will be lost.', '2004-06-06 22:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(752565, 80378, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good stop action and color. Wish there was a little more detail.</td>', 'Good stop action and color. Wish there was a little more detail.', '2004-06-06 22:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(752568, 79448, 6202, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image.  wonderful detail and excellent color. I really like this.</td>', 'Beautiful image.  wonderful detail and excellent color. I really like this.', '2004-06-06 22:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(752570, 79576, 17203, '<td valign="top">Good concept. You needed more ambient light on the scene to avoid grain and the hot spot in the background, but still quite nice. If the grain is intentional, then fading the saturation would add to the nostalgic feel.</td>', 'Good concept. You needed more ambient light on the scene to avoid grain and the hot spot in the background, but still quite nice. If the grain is intentional, then fading the saturation would add to the nostalgic feel.', '2004-06-06 22:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(752572, 79425, 17203, '<td valign="top">Surreal, somewhat unnatural colors. Very pretty. Ideally, I wish there was just a faint glow from the lights, but I''m sure you had no say in the matter. Good luck!</td>', 'Surreal, somewhat unnatural colors. Very pretty. Ideally, I wish there was just a faint glow from the lights, but I''m sure you had no say in the matter. Good luck!', '2004-06-06 23:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(752580, 80387, 8891, '<td valign="top">Very fine lighting and detail and I like the composition and use of negative space. I wish the color of the pears was richer.</td>', 'Very fine lighting and detail and I like the composition and use of negative space. I wish the color of the pears was richer.', '2004-06-06 23:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(752583, 79740, 8891, '<td valign="top">Superb lighting, great colors, excellent detail and composition and I really like. I am surprised it is not in a frame and thank you for not framing it. My only nit is that the stems of the glasses at the bottome of the frame appear to be imcomplete. This is most noticeable in the center glass''s stem.  Otherwise excellent.</td>', 'Superb lighting, great colors, excellent detail and composition and I really like. I am surprised it is not in a frame and thank you for not framing it. My only nit is that the stems of the glasses at the bottome of the frame appear to be imcomplete. This is most noticeable in the center glass''s stem.  Otherwise excellent.', '2004-06-06 23:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(752586, 80188, 17203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Exposure and color are perfect. The little could is a nice detail for interest.</td>', 'Beautiful. Exposure and color are perfect. The little could is a nice detail for interest.', '2004-06-06 23:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(752587, 80238, 17203, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot. I was actually going to shoot palms for this challenge too, but didn''t get around to it.</td>', 'Very cool shot. I was actually going to shoot palms for this challenge too, but didn''t get around to it.', '2004-06-06 23:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(752589, 80325, 17203, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I''d love to see the sky burned in a bit, but still one of my top picks. 8</td>', 'Beautiful. I''d love to see the sky burned in a bit, but still one of my top picks. 8', '2004-06-06 23:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(752590, 79032, 17203, '<td valign="top">Best flower shot in the group. Great color and focus, and triple threes = 9</td>', 'Best flower shot in the group. Great color and focus, and triple threes = 9', '2004-06-06 23:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(752591, 79665, 8891, '<td valign="top">This reminds me very much of a shot of by franziska lang (as opposed to Franziska Lang) which was done in a duo or tri tone (don''t quite get that yet so forgive my tonality). I like this color version very much. The lighting on the seeds and the top of the stem are very good...the bottom of the stem appears blown out a bit but the detail is stunning and I like it very much.</td>', 'This reminds me very much of a shot of by franziska lang (as opposed to Franziska Lang) which was done in a duo or tri tone (don''t quite get that yet so forgive my tonality). I like this color version very much. The lighting on the seeds and the top of the stem are very good...the bottom of the stem appears blown out a bit but the detail is stunning and I like it very much.', '2004-06-06 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(752594, 78955, 8891, '<td valign="top">Great detail, composition and lighting....Like the shadows and the use of negative space very much. The focus on the front of the lowest nut appears soft to me but other than that, very fine work.</td>', 'Great detail, composition and lighting....Like the shadows and the use of negative space very much. The focus on the front of the lowest nut appears soft to me but other than that, very fine work.', '2004-06-06 23:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(752596, 79214, 8891, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. I cannot wait to see how you did it cause it is facinating. I think the focus could be better on the 3 of diamonds and it is a bit composition staggered and maybe, thought I''ve really no idea, shooting this from a different POV with a angled composition might have help the focus as well...I am by no means sure. Fine work and an excellent image.</td>', 'I like this a lot. I cannot wait to see how you did it cause it is facinating. I think the focus could be better on the 3 of diamonds and it is a bit composition staggered and maybe, thought I''ve really no idea, shooting this from a different POV with a angled composition might have help the focus as well...I am by no means sure. Fine work and an excellent image.', '2004-06-06 23:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(752600, 79490, 8891, '<td valign="top">Norelco heads....Who''d a thunk.  Triple heads to give a close shave.  Never would have thought of that at all and yet so obvious.  This is very finely shot and I like the colors and the details very much, particularly the blue in with the gold. Makes and interesting image and abstract. Excellent.</td>', 'Norelco heads....Who''d a thunk.  Triple heads to give a close shave.  Never would have thought of that at all and yet so obvious.  This is very finely shot and I like the colors and the details very much, particularly the blue in with the gold. Makes and interesting image and abstract. Excellent.', '2004-06-06 23:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(752607, 79109, 8891, '<td valign="top">Exceptional image, idea and execution. Vitamin E? What and imaginative eye you have.  The repitition of the light in the shadows is awesome. I also like that you have to really look at it to get it as at first glance (read in the thumbnail) it looks like three well lit, odd shaped pitchers of some sort. Great work.</td>', 'Exceptional image, idea and execution. Vitamin E? What and imaginative eye you have.  The repitition of the light in the shadows is awesome. I also like that you have to really look at it to get it as at first glance (read in the thumbnail) it looks like three well lit, odd shaped pitchers of some sort. Great work.', '2004-06-06 23:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(752610, 80309, 8891, '<td valign="top">Very rich colors and excellent detail...I think it would look better a wee bit brighter.</td>', 'Very rich colors and excellent detail...I think it would look better a wee bit brighter.', '2004-06-06 23:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(752612, 80341, 22686, '<td valign="top">Pretty nice picture but I think the subjects are too central leaving the foreground with nothing of interest. If you brought e subjects down to where you see that darker line of grass they would stand out better and you''d have more of that interesting tree for a background and less of the boring grass.</td>', 'Pretty nice picture but I think the subjects are too central leaving the foreground with nothing of interest. If you brought e subjects down to where you see that darker line of grass they would stand out better and you''d have more of that interesting tree for a background and less of the boring grass.', '2004-06-06 23:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(752614, 80381, 8891, '<td valign="top">I like this idea very much. I think the focus on the hand is off a bit an while I know that the instrument is played with both the use of bot hands, I think you might have considered not having the second thumb covering the valves and having the small place to hold it steady.  Also the background is just too close in color to the horn and a richer darker color might have been better.</td>', 'I like this idea very much. I think the focus on the hand is off a bit an while I know that the instrument is played with both the use of bot hands, I think you might have considered not having the second thumb covering the valves and having the small place to hold it steady.  Also the background is just too close in color to the horn and a richer darker color might have been better.', '2004-06-06 23:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(752634, 80238, 3697, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed, and I love the rich color.</td>', 'Very nicely composed, and I love the rich color.', '2004-06-07 00:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(752635, 80270, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.</td>', 'I like this very much.', '2004-06-07 00:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(752636, 79826, 6130, '<td valign="top">So beautiful.</td>', 'So beautiful.', '2004-06-07 00:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(752650, 79346, 7560, '<td valign="top">I really like the visual contrast between the buildings, ground and sky. Nice use of threes throught. 8</td>', 'I really like the visual contrast between the buildings, ground and sky. Nice use of threes throught. 8', '2004-06-07 00:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(752651, 80188, 7560, '<td valign="top">Simple, striking, and elegant. I would love this shot late afternoon with the sun striking the building. I imagine you get amazing color shifts. Nice work. 8</td>', 'Simple, striking, and elegant. I would love this shot late afternoon with the sun striking the building. I imagine you get amazing color shifts. Nice work. 8', '2004-06-07 00:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(752656, 79322, 7560, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a great image. I love the colors, and repeated use of three. It really pops out with the bright glass on the grey building. One of my very favorites. (9)</td>', 'Wow, this is a great image. I love the colors, and repeated use of three. It really pops out with the bright glass on the grey building. One of my very favorites. (9)', '2004-06-07 00:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(752657, 79443, 7560, '<td valign="top">I love the three shadows from the second hand. :) Nice grain to the image, and excellent showing of threes. Beautiful image. 9</td>', 'I love the three shadows from the second hand. :) Nice grain to the image, and excellent showing of threes. Beautiful image. 9', '2004-06-07 00:25:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(752658, 79588, 7560, '<td valign="top">Great optical illusion. Love the repeated threes. 8</td>', 'Great optical illusion. Love the repeated threes. 8', '2004-06-07 00:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(752660, 79720, 7560, '<td valign="top">I usually do not like flower shots. This one is great! I love the use of extreme wide angle on this shot. Great sharpness and detail on the flowers. Which lens did you use? 8</td>', 'I usually do not like flower shots. This one is great! I love the use of extreme wide angle on this shot. Great sharpness and detail on the flowers. Which lens did you use? 8', '2004-06-07 00:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
