(752672, 80401, 3102, '<td valign="top">Sunset shots usually strike me as being a bit cliche, but I really like this shot a lot!  I love the reflection, and the positioning of the gulls.  I''m not sure if I like this more or less with the boat in the background, but this is still a 10 in my book :)</td>', 'Sunset shots usually strike me as being a bit cliche, but I really like this shot a lot!  I love the reflection, and the positioning of the gulls.  I''m not sure if I like this more or less with the boat in the background, but this is still a 10 in my book :)', '2004-06-07 00:49:52.000000', NULL, 1),
