(752805, 80400, 15407, '<td valign="top">The day was cloudy &amp; it was hard to get the colors/exposure  I wanted. I was not pleased with or without the flash. I chose the entry with "thumbnail WOW factor"...turns out, the flash wasn''t they way to go. The non-flash entry may have faired better.<br/>Thanks for your valuable input. Please see the non-flash version and comment if you care to.<br/> <br/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=81967" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15407/thumb/81967.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15407/thumb/81967.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15407/thumb/81967.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/> <br/>Zap228 ~ I tried a number of settings this ''non-macro'' shot produced much more focus.<br/> <br/>mffnqueen ~ the rest of the backgrounds available were worse..<br/> <br/>scalvert ~ Mmmm... save 1 berry 4 me! I put some on the one I''m saving for you! It''s ready to ship... <br/> <br/>Jesuispeure ~ I did, see above.<br/> <br/>labuda ... you won''t die by then ~ I''m saving them for Shannon Ha Ha<br/> <br/>Maverick ~ Yes! Well it''s time that I got that slave working and rig up a bounce flash. The cameras flash was not up to the task.<br/> <br/>judibrenstein ~ I was using both <br/> <br/>richterrell ~ Yeah <br/> <br/>jaimeegrl ~ was trying for both... <br/> <br/>agrimace no flash ~ Well that seems to sum it up.<br/></td>', 'The day was cloudy & it was hard to get the colors/exposure  I wanted. I was not pleased with or without the flash. I chose the entry with "thumbnail WOW factor"...turns out, the flash wasn''t they way to go. The non-flash entry may have faired better.Thanks for your valuable input. Please see the non-flash version and comment if you care to.     Zap228 ~ I tried a number of settings this ''non-macro'' shot produced much more focus. mffnqueen ~ the rest of the backgrounds available were worse.. scalvert ~ Mmmm... save 1 berry 4 me! I put some on the one I''m saving for you! It''s ready to ship...  Jesuispeure ~ I did, see above. labuda ... you won''t die by then ~ I''m saving them for Shannon Ha Ha Maverick ~ Yes! Well it''s time that I got that slave working and rig up a bounce flash. The cameras flash was not up to the task. judibrenstein ~ I was using both  richterrell ~ Yeah  jaimeegrl ~ was trying for both...  agrimace no flash ~ Well that seems to sum it up.', '2004-06-07 01:56:50.000000', NULL, 0),
