(753124, 79888, 16004, '<td valign="top">I''m half of those that gave you a ten for this, and i only gave 4 of them during this challenge.  shocked it didn''t do better - i mean it wasn''t if you just took a picture of your keyboard; you made this an interesting, well composed and striking piece of art.  i think some fellow voters have blinders on when faced with something seemingly mundane, and anything close to hand to the average internet user.  but dammit, it''s far from being that.  anyway, i guess it''s hard cheese matey, should''ve been a top tenner.</td>', 'I''m half of those that gave you a ten for this, and i only gave 4 of them during this challenge.  shocked it didn''t do better - i mean it wasn''t if you just took a picture of your keyboard; you made this an interesting, well composed and striking piece of art.  i think some fellow voters have blinders on when faced with something seemingly mundane, and anything close to hand to the average internet user.  but dammit, it''s far from being that.  anyway, i guess it''s hard cheese matey, should''ve been a top tenner.', '2004-06-07 09:35:32.000000', NULL, 0),
