(754376, 80318, 2815, '<td valign="top">There are 2 rounds showing in the gun that means there are three empty cylinders.  Most people probably don''t get that, but it leapt right out at me.<br/> <br/>  If it isnt a J Frame then there are 3 empty cylinders and 3 cylinders that are loaded.  Sure seems like a lot of 3s to me.<br/> <br/>Edited:<br/>Just saw the Made in Brazil, that means it is a Taurus.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-06-07 23:36:32.</i></td>', 'There are 2 rounds showing in the gun that means there are three empty cylinders.  Most people probably don''t get that, but it leapt right out at me.   If it isnt a J Frame then there are 3 empty cylinders and 3 cylinders that are loaded.  Sure seems like a lot of 3s to me. Edited:Just saw the Made in Brazil, that means it is a Taurus.', '2004-06-08 00:34:44.000000', '2004-06-08 00:36:32.000000', 0),
